  <name>LBRBas-05</name>
  <desc>ParanormalPert5</desc>
  <url>https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/ParanormalPerth</url>
  <urlname>Paranormal Perth : S5 Kalamunda Hotel by Barrikon</urlname>
  <sym>Geocache</sym>
  <type>Geocache|Lab Cache</type>
  <groundspeak:cache id="1476909761" available="True" archived="False" xmlns:groundspeak="http://www.groundspeak.com/cache/1/0/1">
   <groundspeak:name>Paranormal Perth : S5 Kalamunda Hotel</groundspeak:name>
   <groundspeak:placed_by>Barrikon</groundspeak:placed_by>
   <groundspeak:owner id="">Barrikon</groundspeak:owner>
   <groundspeak:type>Lab Cache</groundspeak:type>
   <groundspeak:container>Virtual</groundspeak:container>
   <groundspeak:attributes>
   </groundspeak:attributes>
   <groundspeak:difficulty>1</groundspeak:difficulty>
   <groundspeak:terrain>1</groundspeak:terrain>
   <groundspeak:country>Australia</groundspeak:country>
   <groundspeak:state>Western Australia</groundspeak:state>
   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Paranormal Perth&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Kalamunda Hotel&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/ParanormalPerth"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/ParanormalPerth&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;Spell ‘Kalamunda’ as displayed on the plaque between the bottle shop and hotel?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/22e570bd-f1ba-48e6-9d18-aa5c52ac4e43" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Beginning life in 1902, the Kalamunda Hotel quickly took on an afterlife. Tales of an affair leading to suicide, mysterious old men on the balcony, a Victorian dressed woman and a mystery man all surround the building and its past. 

Images of the supernatural have been captured and management will always tell you, you are never lonely at the Kalamunda. 
&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/8dc1ada0-08ea-4e7e-964c-57a7b3bf56ff" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Stories of lost souls, destitute apparitions, shadowy figures with unfinished business and ethereal beings providing protection, fill history books and live within myths across the world. Perth is no different. 

Tales of ghostly encounters can be found across the city and by partaking on this paranormal hunt you may experience your very own unexplained event.

Your adventure covers approximately 53kms and is available anytime however to fully experience possibilities of the afterlife, it is suggested you wait until darkness falls. A good torch will be needed if venturing out after dark.
&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Award Information&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/f707dab5-3982-4cf5-bb08-78f2548ddf90" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Award Message:&lt;br /&gt;Congratulations.&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
   <groundspeak:logs>
  </groundspeak:logs>
   <groundspeak:travelbugs>
   </groundspeak:travelbugs>
</groundspeak:cache>
</wpt>
 <wpt lat="-32.14885" lon="116.0164">
