   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;A short journey across a medium bridge&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Give me a sign&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="background:#990000;color:#fff;border-radius:5px;padding:3px 5px;"&gt;linear&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/matagarup"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/matagarup&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;How deep?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/cdd1cb32-a2f6-4fb9-aca6-297a6e627855" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Lots of info here, whats in a name is interesting&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/0835811f-a20f-4814-b617-83e6edb3eb82" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is a quick little tour that will teach you not-a-lot about this and that. 

Matagarup Bridge is a suspension pedestrian bridge crossing over the Swan River in Perth, Western Australia. Situated approximately half-way between Heirisson Island and the Goongoongup Bridge, it provides pedestrian access between Burswood and East Perth.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Award Information&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/3d924562-135f-49b4-b4a6-bf869da79a1c" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
