   <groundspeak:country>Australia</groundspeak:country>
   <groundspeak:state>Western Australia</groundspeak:state>
   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;A short journey across a medium bridge&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;A song by Europe&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="background:#990000;color:#fff;border-radius:5px;padding:3px 5px;"&gt;linear&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/matagarup"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/matagarup&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;While facing the Matagarup sign, what is the name of the pub behind you? use both words&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/fdec2701-d6b7-4970-b60f-d60647597f05" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The lab now asks me 
"Describe what you like about this location, including any specific instructions players may need to answer the Location Question."

What I like about this area is you can answer the final question then decide to either enjoy a cool beverage or a meal at the pub close by, let the kids have a play on one of the great playgrounds right here, go for a walk around the area and across the bridge to East Perth, bike the bridges or just chill out on the grass and enjoy the river.
This is an amazing place and it is right here in Perth. So answer the last silly question, enjoy the 5 smileys you earnt real quick and enjoy this area.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/0835811f-a20f-4814-b617-83e6edb3eb82" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is a quick little tour that will teach you not-a-lot about this and that. 

Matagarup Bridge is a suspension pedestrian bridge crossing over the Swan River in Perth, Western Australia. Situated approximately half-way between Heirisson Island and the Goongoongup Bridge, it provides pedestrian access between Burswood and East Perth.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Award Information&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/45a9e1d8-3965-4c88-98ff-82de878c2847" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Award Message:&lt;br /&gt;Thanks for doing our quick adventure.&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
   <groundspeak:logs>
