Second photo (C) City of Melville&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/083f9189-6cb2-4e26-8615-0cc8889e0398" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is one of our favourite places in Perth to visit. 

