   <groundspeak:name>The Oxford Strip : S2 Vespa City</groundspeak:name>
   <groundspeak:placed_by>.K.B.</groundspeak:placed_by>
   <groundspeak:owner id="">.K.B.</groundspeak:owner>
   <groundspeak:type>Lab Cache</groundspeak:type>
   <groundspeak:container>Virtual</groundspeak:container>
   <groundspeak:attributes>
   </groundspeak:attributes>
   <groundspeak:difficulty>1</groundspeak:difficulty>
   <groundspeak:terrain>1</groundspeak:terrain>
   <groundspeak:country>Australia</groundspeak:country>
   <groundspeak:state>Western Australia</groundspeak:state>
   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;The Oxford Strip&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Vespa City&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/369b029f-0e2d-4f72-8ffd-2de06a2a60c4"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/369b029f-0e2d-4f72-8ffd-2de06a2a60c4&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;What two words appear on the number plate of the car?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/944e1c56-75c6-43c8-b0b4-5ed879bdaada" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Another area overloaded with artwork. One one side of the road is a colourful artwork of a lady with flowers and a Vespa. For a complete contrast, the carpark on the other side of the road showcases a much older artwork. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/483ff958-72c2-43a0-bd81-da6995831721" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Oxford Street runs from Mount Hawthorn at the northern end to Leederville at the southern end. The strip is most famous for its cafes. Quite literally, each block has at least one. As is customary for areas with cafe atmosphere, street art abounds. I’ve picked out 5 locations but there are many more to enjoy. A bike lane does run down the length of the strip on both the eastern and western sides; not the best of designs so use at your own peril.

&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Award Information&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/7c3bbee2-cd1f-4bc0-92eb-c9415cc0ea24" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Award Message:&lt;br /&gt;Ain’t love grand. &lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
   <groundspeak:logs>
  </groundspeak:logs>
   <groundspeak:travelbugs>
   </groundspeak:travelbugs>
</groundspeak:cache>
</wpt>
 <wpt lat="-31.9689" lon="115.796883">
