   <groundspeak:country>Australia</groundspeak:country>
   <groundspeak:state>Western Australia</groundspeak:state>
   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Be bold : Reabold Hill at Bold Park&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;5. At The Top&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/ReaboldHill"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/ReaboldHill&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;On the feft side of the left panel, what is the name of the lake? 1 word only.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/bbf6c8b9-007d-4793-9a3a-4f51b8f24faf" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You have now reached the summit of Reabold Hill, elevation 93m. Take time to enjoy  the views. There are signs ( a bit dated, seeing recent developments! ) to help pick out features of the landscape.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/5277b505-cf56-43e9-9cf9-16b463375042" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Bold Park close to the Coast, North of the River, covers 437 hectares and is one of the largest remaining bushland remnants in the urban area ofthe Swan Coastal Plain.  It was declared an A Class Reserve in 1998, and has an impressive biodiversity despite its proximity to the CBD.
Reabold Hill took the names of local Council figures  of the early 1900’s, Frank Rea and William Bold. It is the highest natural point on the Coastal Plain, the path you will be on will reward you with amazing views of the City and the Indian Ocean.
Please note the carpark hours: 5.30 am to 7pm from 1 April to 31 October, and 5.30am to 8pm 1 November to 31 March.
There is a Bonus Box associated with this Adventure, GC8Z9C2.  Make sure to collect the clues . And have fun!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Award Information&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;Award Message:&lt;br /&gt;Correct. For F of the Bonus Box, on the left side of the right panel, the number of letters in the name of the Sports Park.&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
   <groundspeak:logs>
  </groundspeak:logs>
   <groundspeak:travelbugs>
