  <desc>ItsAllAboutThe4</desc>
  <url>https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/AATK</url>
  <urlname>"Its All About The Kids" - Playing! : S4 Mundaring - Sculpture Park by BJA3</urlname>
  <sym>Geocache</sym>
  <type>Geocache|Lab Cache</type>
  <groundspeak:cache id="1476909897" available="True" archived="False" xmlns:groundspeak="http://www.groundspeak.com/cache/1/0/1">
   <groundspeak:name>"Its All About The Kids" - Playing! : S4 Mundaring - Sculpture Park</groundspeak:name>
   <groundspeak:placed_by>BJA3</groundspeak:placed_by>
   <groundspeak:owner id="">BJA3</groundspeak:owner>
   <groundspeak:type>Lab Cache</groundspeak:type>
   <groundspeak:container>Virtual</groundspeak:container>
   <groundspeak:attributes>
   </groundspeak:attributes>
   <groundspeak:difficulty>1</groundspeak:difficulty>
   <groundspeak:terrain>1</groundspeak:terrain>
   <groundspeak:country>Australia</groundspeak:country>
   <groundspeak:state>Western Australia</groundspeak:state>
   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;"Its All About The Kids" - Playing!&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Mundaring - Sculpture Park&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/AATK"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/AATK&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;How many sections are there in the red &amp; blue tunnel slide?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/c199c5dd-e25e-4cd1-af55-df9a7369a25a" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;A well established park in the Mundaring area boasting a fantastic playground for all ages, even the adults!  You will find swings, flying foxes, merry go round, tunnels, climbing frames and much, much more!

It also has open grassy spaces, benches, water fountains, BBQ facilities, toilets, hotel, fast food, cafes and convenience stores close by. 

There is plenty of parking however can get very busy on the weekends.

Wheelchair friendly!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/8228662f-9b6b-498f-ae3f-705b0234ef20" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Welcome to our Adventure Lab Cache designed by kids for kids!

We have always loved parks and playgrounds so we thought a perfect theme for our series would revolve around some in the Mundaring area.  

This series will only take about an hour to complete, depending if you can pry the kids away from the swings.

Each has plenty of parking, good phone reception and amenities close by.

Please Enjoy!&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
   <groundspeak:logs>
  </groundspeak:logs>
   <groundspeak:travelbugs>
   </groundspeak:travelbugs>
</groundspeak:cache>
</wpt>
 <wpt lat="-31.901983" lon="116.166017">
