   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Rockingham Ramble&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Rockingham Navy  Memorial &lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/OOHYEH"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/OOHYEH&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;What is the last name of the third sailor who died ?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/57bfdfc3-66b2-4fad-af21-22ec662df04e" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Here you are looking for a plaque in memory of who lost their lives whilst serving on Oberon submarines .&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/ad72caef-ba33-4d88-aeb3-1a12bf92615b" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Rockingham points of interest  
You can drive / ride or even walk this tour !!!! &lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Award Information&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/a51bad07-f2dd-4474-99cc-506c90d37b39" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Award Message:&lt;br /&gt;Congrats you have completed this one !!!!!&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
