   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Rockingham Ramble&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Floating Rock Sphere&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/OOHYEH"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/OOHYEH&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;What is the diameter of the floating sphere &lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/ff93b283-ff31-4912-b9c0-2604a14ae699" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Here you will see a large round bolder floating in water . You need to find the plaque to answer this question &lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/ad72caef-ba33-4d88-aeb3-1a12bf92615b" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Rockingham points of interest  
You can drive / ride or even walk this tour !!!! &lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Award Information&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/593aedf2-dd70-49c1-823e-ee08ae1624fb" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Award Message:&lt;br /&gt;Congrats you have completed this one !!!!&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
