   <groundspeak:type>Lab Cache</groundspeak:type>
   <groundspeak:container>Virtual</groundspeak:container>
   <groundspeak:attributes>
   </groundspeak:attributes>
   <groundspeak:difficulty>1</groundspeak:difficulty>
   <groundspeak:terrain>1</groundspeak:terrain>
   <groundspeak:country>Australia</groundspeak:country>
   <groundspeak:state>Western Australia</groundspeak:state>
   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Baldivis Dog Park&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Gondi the Gecko&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/BDP"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/BDP&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;What year was Gondi fabricated?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/a699fc55-7675-499e-916c-79835197952d" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our family have always called this the "Gecko Park" after Gondi and as younger boys, would often play all over him.
I think the biological name on the plaque is the coolest thing and I recon an early option of "doyathinkisaurus" was laughed out so they compromised with "Underwoodisaurus" and tried to pass it off as being named after British herpetologist, Garth Leon Underwood.

While you are reading the plaque, you will need some information off it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/604a7b92-e3c2-46b2-b593-9bcb4266a413" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Take a short stroll from the Baldivis Dog Park, and down along the creek.
There are some interesting artworks along this short adventure lab series.
Park at the dog park, start your wander, then turn around and come back to give your 4 legged friends a real run.

At each location, there will be a clue once you answer the question. Grab the 5 letters (one in each answer), which will reveal a key word. You will need this keyword for a nearby mystery cache.

Keep a note of the clues for the bonus at https://coord.info/GC8PQ4H 
&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Award Information&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/4316d59d-ebd9-4320-8ab2-7122f3cad709" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Award Message:&lt;br /&gt;Well done.

The letter here is "C". Write it down&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
   <groundspeak:logs>
  </groundspeak:logs>
   <groundspeak:travelbugs>
