You will see multiple Gas Buried Below signs as you complete this Lab series.

This is one of the isolation valves.

Oh, You will need to have a good look at the big green valve in the middle.


&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/604a7b92-e3c2-46b2-b593-9bcb4266a413" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Take a short stroll from the Baldivis Dog Park, and down along the creek.
