Keep a note of the clues for the bonus at https://coord.info/GC8PQ4H 
&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Award Information&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/11b326b8-c7dd-4efa-b149-59375c61fb3c" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Award Message:&lt;br /&gt;Thats it.

