   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Mindarie Wanderer&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;The Inner Harbour&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/MINDARIE"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/MINDARIE&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;On the lamp-post is a 7 digit number - this is the answer to the question&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/f210f946-796b-405c-bb01-aad6c89add9e" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;With a great view of one of the Marina's Watering Holes, this is also a place that the kids have been known to catch the odd blowie.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/1bf20d88-6171-4dfb-aa59-a47d56937de8" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The purpose of this adventure lab is to get you out for a walk or bike ride along our stunning coastline. The series can be done in either direction with ample parking and watering holes at either end to aid the weary cacher! 

It is approximately 3km from one end to the other with a suggested route attached to the Bonus Box - GC8YQKG. This route keeps it fairly flat and gives you a nosey at the posh houses. NB There is a section of steps but there is a flat paved section to roll your bike up or down.

&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Award Information&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;Award Message:&lt;br /&gt;Superb! 

The code you need for this location is P.&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
