   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;End of the Line&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Mandurah Station&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/EOTL"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/EOTL&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;What is the Noongar word for "meeting place of the heart" that names the road the train follows into Mandurah? ( _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ )&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/6d9c6550-205b-4f5e-ac61-5745f312e4a8" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Mandurah Station is the southernmost terminus of the Perth Rail Network.

It is located 70.1km from Perth and was opened on December 23rd 2007&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/b725a41a-cce1-431d-909c-cab48dd07c51" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Please be aware the locations for this Adventure Lab are quite a distance from the map marker, make sure you check your nearest Lab point before commencing.

The metropolitan Perth rail network is comprised of five major lines connecting the four Metropolitan Development Corridors and Fremantle to the Perth CBD.

Over the coming years the network is set to expand even further to accomade travelers from Ellenbrook, Forrestfield and extending lines past Armadale to Byford and continuing north to Yanchep.

This Adventure Lab will take you on a tour of the various lines of the Perth Rail Network. You are more than welcome to catch the trains to the stops (it can be done in a single day) if you wish but this is not a requirement, in fact all information can be gained and answered without entering the stations themselves.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Award Information&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/de82ed0a-0ed2-427c-9366-0d0b728825f2" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Award Message:&lt;br /&gt;The clue you need for the bonus final is:
 T&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
   <groundspeak:logs>
  </groundspeak:logs>
   <groundspeak:travelbugs>
   </groundspeak:travelbugs>
