   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Mandurah's Marine Life + Puzzles Adventure Lab&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;The Gatehouse Keeper&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="background:#990000;color:#fff;border-radius:5px;padding:3px 5px;"&gt;linear&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/f6ad5266-a886-4c2e-ae97-fbd8d73a9b99"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/f6ad5266-a886-4c2e-ae97-fbd8d73a9b99&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;You were given a drop quote to solve at the last location. What was the argument about? (three words, 1-4-4, no spaces)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/192e72be-f6b0-4c57-86ec-ab8fd597cb7d" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This another 3D artwork for you to get creative with posing for that perfect picture.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/0918047e-dc18-4811-b483-7502cd0f9637" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This Adventure Lab cache is designed to get people out and about exploring Mandurah and the marine environment it has long been renowned for. The downtown tourist precinct seems to be forever evolving with new things to be discovered each time you wander around. Fortunately there are lots of places to stop, grab a bite to eat or something to drink before continuing on your way.

Please be prepared to spend a little bit of time on these ones with three of them having a fairly simple puzzle of some sort for you to solve. Hopefully, you will bring a pen and paper with you, your thinking caps and of course your cameras, for all the photo opportunities along the way.
&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Award Information&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;Award Message:&lt;br /&gt;You are on a roll now! And no puzzle to solve this time, so just enjoy the scenery as your stroll along your way to the next location.&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
