  <desc>LMandurahsMari2</desc>
  <url>https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/f6ad5266-a886-4c2e-ae97-fbd8d73a9b99</url>
  <urlname>[L] Mandurah's Marine Life + Puzzles Adventure Lab : S2 Supersized Marine Life by Mistraluna</urlname>
  <sym>Geocache</sym>
  <type>Geocache|Lab Cache</type>
  <groundspeak:cache id="-438" available="True" archived="False" xmlns:groundspeak="http://www.groundspeak.com/cache/1/0/1">
   <groundspeak:name>[L] Mandurah's Marine Life + Puzzles Adventure Lab : S2 Supersized Marine Life</groundspeak:name>
   <groundspeak:placed_by>Mistraluna</groundspeak:placed_by>
   <groundspeak:owner id="">Mistraluna</groundspeak:owner>
   <groundspeak:type>Lab Cache</groundspeak:type>
   <groundspeak:container>Virtual</groundspeak:container>
   <groundspeak:attributes>
   </groundspeak:attributes>
   <groundspeak:difficulty>1</groundspeak:difficulty>
   <groundspeak:terrain>1</groundspeak:terrain>
   <groundspeak:country>Australia</groundspeak:country>
   <groundspeak:state>Western Australia</groundspeak:state>
   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Mandurah's Marine Life + Puzzles Adventure Lab&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Supersized Marine Life&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="background:#990000;color:#fff;border-radius:5px;padding:3px 5px;"&gt;linear&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/f6ad5266-a886-4c2e-ae97-fbd8d73a9b99"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/f6ad5266-a886-4c2e-ae97-fbd8d73a9b99&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;At the first location, you were given a cryptogram puzzle to solve. What does "AJKOXIJBDAJDUSG" decode as? (upper case, no spaces)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/a2ff3fc3-3b71-4f36-bef2-faf36b332698" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;At this location you will find an assortment of artworks depicting creatures that are readily found around Mandurah's waterways. Make sure you find the supersized crayfish, the equally large crab and the menacing looking shark who has unfortunately lost a few teeth already. The nearby establishments feature mostly seafood, so I wondered at the appropriateness of the three replica dolphins being in this grouping. I hope you get creative with the poses you think up for each photo though.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/0918047e-dc18-4811-b483-7502cd0f9637" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This Adventure Lab cache is designed to get people out and about exploring Mandurah and the marine environment it has long been renowned for. The downtown tourist precinct seems to be forever evolving with new things to be discovered each time you wander around. Fortunately there are lots of places to stop, grab a bite to eat or something to drink before continuing on your way.

Please be prepared to spend a little bit of time on these ones with three of them having a fairly simple puzzle of some sort for you to solve. Hopefully, you will bring a pen and paper with you, your thinking caps and of course your cameras, for all the photo opportunities along the way.
&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Award Information&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/f20eb830-fa36-4592-ad6e-16d014561aea" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Award Message:&lt;br /&gt;Great work! Now you have new image with a drop quote. Use your pen and paper to solve the puzzle before heading off to the next location. &lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
   <groundspeak:logs>
  </groundspeak:logs>
   <groundspeak:travelbugs>
   </groundspeak:travelbugs>
</groundspeak:cache>
</wpt>
