  <sym>Geocache</sym>
  <type>Geocache|Lab Cache</type>
  <groundspeak:cache id="1476910101" available="True" archived="False" xmlns:groundspeak="http://www.groundspeak.com/cache/1/0/1">
   <groundspeak:name>[L] Six Seasons : S2 Djeran</groundspeak:name>
   <groundspeak:placed_by>Cirrus_WA</groundspeak:placed_by>
   <groundspeak:owner id="">Cirrus_WA</groundspeak:owner>
   <groundspeak:type>Lab Cache</groundspeak:type>
   <groundspeak:container>Virtual</groundspeak:container>
   <groundspeak:attributes>
   </groundspeak:attributes>
   <groundspeak:difficulty>1</groundspeak:difficulty>
   <groundspeak:terrain>1</groundspeak:terrain>
   <groundspeak:country>Australia</groundspeak:country>
   <groundspeak:state>Western Australia</groundspeak:state>
   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Six Seasons&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Djeran&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="background:#990000;color:#fff;border-radius:5px;padding:3px 5px;"&gt;linear&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/d139f461-a4db-4c71-9e62-8aa0e170c4fc"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/d139f461-a4db-4c71-9e62-8aa0e170c4fc&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;What season has fish on the totem?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/f8f3ddec-9da2-4fe0-b0d4-62316644bcd7" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Djeran runs between April &amp; May and is when the hot weather breaks.

The winds change from the east to the south and decrease is intensity. Seeds, bullrushes and fresh water animals such as frogs and turtles come into the diet.
Red flowering plants dominate the flora providing nectar for insects and small mammals.
As the wet weather starts and the cooler nights become more common it signaled time to ensure the mia mia's (shelters) were repaired for the coming rains and winds of Makuru.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/5831b488-1fdd-4ff3-8850-33840cedc500" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The South West of Western Australia is the land of the Noongar people.
Here the year is separated into six season, the signs of the land, animals and weather dictate the changing of the seasons.
This short Adventure Lab will give you some knowledge of each of these seasons.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Award Information&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/33a5b314-2d39-4be7-a029-2f2efac24472" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Award Message:&lt;br /&gt;Well done you will need the following for the bonus cache:
AG&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
   <groundspeak:logs>
  </groundspeak:logs>
   <groundspeak:travelbugs>
   </groundspeak:travelbugs>
