   <groundspeak:attributes>
   </groundspeak:attributes>
   <groundspeak:difficulty>1</groundspeak:difficulty>
   <groundspeak:terrain>1</groundspeak:terrain>
   <groundspeak:country>Australia</groundspeak:country>
   <groundspeak:state>Western Australia</groundspeak:state>
   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Six Seasons&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Kambarang&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="background:#990000;color:#fff;border-radius:5px;padding:3px 5px;"&gt;linear&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/d139f461-a4db-4c71-9e62-8aa0e170c4fc"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/d139f461-a4db-4c71-9e62-8aa0e170c4fc&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;What season is represented by 7 of the same animal on the totem?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/55d98bb4-ac87-42e7-a0b8-3cf88a4417f6" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Kambarang runs from October to November and is highlighted by an explosion of colour from the native flora.

Smaller and more delicate flowers dominate the season, Kangaroo Paws and orchids are in high abundance.

The days are getting longer and the warm weather is returning. It is this time of year that you are most likely to encounter snakes. They are breaking their hibernation and will be seeking any warmth they can find to assist them in searching for food.

&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/5831b488-1fdd-4ff3-8850-33840cedc500" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The South West of Western Australia is the land of the Noongar people.
Here the year is separated into six season, the signs of the land, animals and weather dictate the changing of the seasons.
This short Adventure Lab will give you some knowledge of each of these seasons.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Award Information&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/58cb72df-1979-4a41-b599-615411aba214" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Award Message:&lt;br /&gt;Well done you will need the following for the bonus cache:
N&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
   <groundspeak:logs>
  </groundspeak:logs>
   <groundspeak:travelbugs>
   </groundspeak:travelbugs>
</groundspeak:cache>
</wpt>
