   <groundspeak:country>Australia</groundspeak:country>
   <groundspeak:state>Western Australia</groundspeak:state>
   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Northam Sights&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Avon Decent Start Tower&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/NorthamSights"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/NorthamSights&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;Paddling Legend of the Avon Decent 2013 - What is Gregs surname?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/b09e439b-2ff2-4622-9327-77708b1ad4ac" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ready ... set ... GO! The Avon Decent is a 124km adventure river race that starts in Northam and ends all the way in Bayswater. It runs over 2 days on the 1st w/e in August each year. This is where it all begins! &lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/74f2cf0c-62b8-46b9-bc98-7d9c3780b3b8" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Welcome to Northam the heart of the picturesque Avon Valley. Only an hour from Perth, Northam is home to a diverse range of tourist and heritage attractions. Come relax by the Avon River, take in some of the town’s rich history, or walk across the suspension bridge to view WAs only colony of white swans. Other attractions include, walking trails, historic buildings, the Avon Decent and much more. Seasonal canola splashing fields of yellow, rolling hills and bright coloured hot air balloons are just some of the visual delights to be enjoyed.
There is a bonus cache after collecting the clues. Saving Mount Ommanney till last will stop you having to backtrack.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Award Information&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/01f9d872-83fe-497b-8159-130f67b37363" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Award Message:&lt;br /&gt;Yayy! Another correct answer.
Remember to note the clue for the bonus
B=5&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
