   <groundspeak:attributes>
   </groundspeak:attributes>
   <groundspeak:difficulty>1</groundspeak:difficulty>
   <groundspeak:terrain>1</groundspeak:terrain>
   <groundspeak:country>Australia</groundspeak:country>
   <groundspeak:state>Western Australia</groundspeak:state>
   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Northam Sights&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Morby Cottage&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/NorthamSights"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/NorthamSights&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;What year was Morby Cottage built? (use digits)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/62b6099f-3d31-4bef-868d-30cc235d4933" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is one of Western Australia's oldest surviving colonial residences. It was Northams first Church, school, courthouse, retail &amp; postal outlet. Now thats what I call versatile! &lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/74f2cf0c-62b8-46b9-bc98-7d9c3780b3b8" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Welcome to Northam the heart of the picturesque Avon Valley. Only an hour from Perth, Northam is home to a diverse range of tourist and heritage attractions. Come relax by the Avon River, take in some of the town’s rich history, or walk across the suspension bridge to view WAs only colony of white swans. Other attractions include, walking trails, historic buildings, the Avon Decent and much more. Seasonal canola splashing fields of yellow, rolling hills and bright coloured hot air balloons are just some of the visual delights to be enjoyed.
There is a bonus cache after collecting the clues. Saving Mount Ommanney till last will stop you having to backtrack.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Award Information&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/73a5eed2-c90d-4a03-bab0-ebd42f708329" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Award Message:&lt;br /&gt;You lil ripper!
Take note of this next code for the bonus
C=2&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
