   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Kellerberrin Heritage Trail&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Kellerberrin Folk Museum&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/Kellerberrin"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/Kellerberrin&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;What park was established with Folk Museum?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/dcbb2c6f-a82e-4120-b284-052cbf88e197" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Museum, Built in 1897, it has served as Agricultural Hall, a school, a courthouse, Road Board Office and has been a Folk Museum since 1972.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/cacb1341-9a26-4aeb-8cc5-d088f97c6ca8" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Explore Kellerberrin and soak in some of the local history by following the drive/walk tour of the Kellerberrin Heritage Trail. 

You can find most of the answers from square information board.&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
