   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Lets not Forget&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;RSL&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="background:#990000;color:#fff;border-radius:5px;padding:3px 5px;"&gt;linear&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/Notforget"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/Notforget&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;In what year was the destroyer escort HMAS Swan decommissioned&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/572fbfaa-edd5-4ed0-91c0-12fe64140726" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The RSL is the local gathering place of servicemen and women in the district . The achor is the comemorate 3 Royal Austrralian navy ships name HMAS Swan. 1st The Swan was A torpedo boat destroyer from 1916 -1928. 2nd was a sloop from 1937 -1962,  3rd a destroyer escort from 1970-1996&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/9465ec12-45bd-49d8-b0a1-78eab4aa0fcb" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;My adventure is unique because it gives you time to reflect and give thanks for what we have today because of the sacrifice of our ancestors. This adventure will have you wandering thru cemetaries,a memorial and a cemotaph. Please be respectful of your surrounding.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Award Information&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;Award Message:&lt;br /&gt;Congratulation move on to step 2&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
