   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Dunsborough Travels&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Save a sailor&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/379e47bd-a4d6-483d-b017-abb87b4090a7"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/379e47bd-a4d6-483d-b017-abb87b4090a7&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;What year did the light house operate till&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/5b64b1fc-20b4-48b6-a6fb-d24255d36103" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This lighthouse was the last on the mainland Australia to retain its lighthouse keepers. The lighthouse is majestic to look at but for a great view and walk try walking some of the bush walks in the area and maybe get a few caches on the way.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/1ce9e081-814b-4a64-be6a-1a5bc01f3a7c" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is a unique adventure because it involves visiting locations that have outstanding beauty and includes places that have piqued our geocaching adventures&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Award Information&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;Award Message:&lt;br /&gt;This one wasnt much of a walk but if you have the time go for a walk ,you might even see a whale if the season is right.&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
