   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Dunsborough Travels&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Last but not least. &lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/379e47bd-a4d6-483d-b017-abb87b4090a7"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/379e47bd-a4d6-483d-b017-abb87b4090a7&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;What is the item that is most sold here.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/92809afc-33ed-4724-a807-367bba8d835e" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;After the day we had doing this lab, this is where we needed to be. Relax enjoy and let the kids run wild . Plenty of shade .&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/1ce9e081-814b-4a64-be6a-1a5bc01f3a7c" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is a unique adventure because it involves visiting locations that have outstanding beauty and includes places that have piqued our geocaching adventures&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Award Information&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;Award Message:&lt;br /&gt;Congratulations you have finished our favourite places around Dunsborough.  Hope you enjoyed it.&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
