   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Dunsborough Travels&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Toilet with a view&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/379e47bd-a4d6-483d-b017-abb87b4090a7"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/379e47bd-a4d6-483d-b017-abb87b4090a7&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;What sport can be performed here&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/bd8af93f-6612-4783-9f85-f5c5b820d72a" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This walk has amazing views at the end . The walks not bad either. Gret little place for a picnic. But watch the kiddos around the cliff face.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/1ce9e081-814b-4a64-be6a-1a5bc01f3a7c" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is a unique adventure because it involves visiting locations that have outstanding beauty and includes places that have piqued our geocaching adventures&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Award Information&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;Award Message:&lt;br /&gt;Hope you enjoyed the walk and the view and maybe a few caches in the area.&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
