   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Country Kulin&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Kulin Post Office and Quarters&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/Kulin"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/Kulin&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;What are the numbers below Kulin Post Office?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/50dac839-0f51-4c6b-950f-4fa2ffaec5c4" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The first post office in Kulin was an unofficial post office in 1916, run by Francis. 
That operation continued until the official post office operated from this building in 1926. 
In c1990 the incumbent Post master, Kevin Rogers, purchased the privatised Post Office. 
The residence behind the Post Office is privately owned  and can be rented out for over night stays.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/3d18e99b-8568-4fc5-97bd-e30941c1da45" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;
Welcome to Kulin which is located in the heart of the WA Wheatbelt
The town of Kulin developed after the railway connected from Narrogin in 1915.
100 years on and Kulin remains one of the most productive districts in the WA Wheatbelt.

The Kulin Region community prides itself on being progressive, proactive, safe and friendly. As a community, they have achieved some incredible things:
Their famous Kulin Bush Races are an award winning, 100% voluntarily coordinated and run event
They have the biggest Waterslide in Regional WA.
The Tin Horse Highway is recognised as the Wheatbelt’s most popular tourist drive.
The state-of-the-art Freebairn Recreation Centre is the hub of community life.
Kulin opened the very first Bendigo Community Bank Branch in WA. 
They were the first town to build a combined FESA and Emergency Services building.

There is a bonus cache at the end so don't forget to collect all the information from each Adventure Lab.
CONGRATULATIONS ebenie first to complete this Adventure Lab&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Award Information&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;Award Message:&lt;br /&gt;Congratulations and welcome to Kulin Post Office
