   <groundspeak:difficulty>1</groundspeak:difficulty>
   <groundspeak:terrain>1</groundspeak:terrain>
   <groundspeak:country>Australia</groundspeak:country>
   <groundspeak:state>Western Australia</groundspeak:state>
   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Merredin&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Cummins Theatre&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/d96b4b9c-0cc2-4033-8a39-641e7d60871b"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/d96b4b9c-0cc2-4033-8a39-641e7d60871b&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;This theatres bricks, stage and seats are recycled from what town? &lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/d6125ec2-ecb8-4892-b5ec-2ad4f1ecbc62" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Cummins Theatre is one of the oldest buildings in the Shire of Merredin and is heritage listed. For nine decades and counting it has served as a centre for performances, meetings and social functions of both the local and wider community. It is part of the heart of Merredin. Its so beautiful inside.
I saw my first concert here in the 70's 'Sherbert' and enjoyed many other events here from Ballet to Weddings, School reunions, Repertory and many performers who used this place as a stop over on the  long road to and from the Eastern States. 

&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/3abdc620-6d7d-4535-914b-0d3179db3fb4" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Welcome to Merredin 'The Heart of The Wheatbelt'. Place of my birth and childhood memories. I hope you enjoy a small insight to the place I call home.

 The town’s name is derived from the Aboriginal word “merrit-in” the place of the merrit tree, a eucalypt used to make spears.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Award Information&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/00601f52-1cc3-4697-9a2d-3dbee57aa3a5" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
   <groundspeak:logs>
  </groundspeak:logs>
   <groundspeak:travelbugs>
   </groundspeak:travelbugs>
</groundspeak:cache>
</wpt>
 <wpt lat="-31.477617" lon="118.291567">
