   <groundspeak:attributes>
   </groundspeak:attributes>
   <groundspeak:difficulty>1</groundspeak:difficulty>
   <groundspeak:terrain>1</groundspeak:terrain>
   <groundspeak:country>Australia</groundspeak:country>
   <groundspeak:state>Western Australia</groundspeak:state>
   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Meander thru the ages&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;The last latte before antartica&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/337f3b26-6e4a-43ce-8fa9-ced5bb30a17b"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/337f3b26-6e4a-43ce-8fa9-ced5bb30a17b&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;What is the name of the pictured establishment.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/3902800d-1b6d-4ad1-84a6-0b9782be5c37" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;As children we used to visit our grandparents whilst they camped at Turners caravan park. We would walk to this establishment to buy and icecream or lollies ,back then it was like a goat track . 
Since then the establisment has changed hand the goat track has becomema road with a beautiful foreshore that many flock to for a swim,kayak,kite surfing and fishing. Whilst the mini golf and entertainment centre has seen better days the establishment has risen like the pheonix and become a kind of yuppy hangout. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/8ee60e45-60cf-4613-8de0-fa9bb99ee003" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;I have started this lab in an area that there are no others and to emphasis the uniqueness of the Southwest. From old to new and tourist places to points of interest that we found intriguing. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Award Information&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;Award Message:&lt;br /&gt;Well done. Did you enjoy the scenery?&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
   <groundspeak:logs>
  </groundspeak:logs>
   <groundspeak:travelbugs>
   </groundspeak:travelbugs>
</groundspeak:cache>
</wpt>
