   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Meander thru the ages&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Baby Shark doo doo doo doo&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/337f3b26-6e4a-43ce-8fa9-ced5bb30a17b"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/337f3b26-6e4a-43ce-8fa9-ced5bb30a17b&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;When was the location opened by Colin Barnett&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/a5a5e51c-c189-4308-a55c-69408e234ce7" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This little gem popped up a few years ago ,good fishing and this year another new building. Some really big boats get in here. There have recently been walking trails added so look for the small round plaques to start your walk&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/8ee60e45-60cf-4613-8de0-fa9bb99ee003" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;I have started this lab in an area that there are no others and to emphasis the uniqueness of the Southwest. From old to new and tourist places to points of interest that we found intriguing. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Award Information&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/568607c9-89f4-4b44-9f28-90bb6942ea68" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Award Message:&lt;br /&gt;Have a walk around, maybe do the walk. Becareful when walking along the rocked area because sometimes even on nice days you can get wet.&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
   <groundspeak:logs>
