   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Meander thru the ages&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;View to kill for&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/337f3b26-6e4a-43ce-8fa9-ced5bb30a17b"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/337f3b26-6e4a-43ce-8fa9-ced5bb30a17b&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;What was the name of the boat that Captain Mathew Flinders commanded.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/8bc6a123-2eab-4c94-8763-37586fc9c16f" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is a beautiful little spot that can so easily be missed. The view is astounding and well worth the stop and it also has a little easy reading.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/8ee60e45-60cf-4613-8de0-fa9bb99ee003" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;I have started this lab in an area that there are no others and to emphasis the uniqueness of the Southwest. From old to new and tourist places to points of interest that we found intriguing. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Award Information&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/9b7884c9-91ec-4914-9862-b655358919d6" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Award Message:&lt;br /&gt;Congratulations . Wouldnt you just like to sit here all day and take in the beauty.&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
   <groundspeak:logs>
