With its bold colours, the lighthouse has become an icon of the port town of Geraldton.
This adventure celebrates a familiar structure that has been replicated around the town.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Award Information&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;Award Message:&lt;br /&gt;Awesome.&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
