   <groundspeak:country>Australia</groundspeak:country>
   <groundspeak:state>Western Australia</groundspeak:state>
   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Discover Esperance&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;The Old Wind Farm&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="background:#990000;color:#fff;border-radius:5px;padding:3px 5px;"&gt;linear&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/c775d289-15a5-42a2-b6c2-7df6d95f5899"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/c775d289-15a5-42a2-b6c2-7df6d95f5899&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;How many holes are there in the end of this section?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/4a2bb5f3-3163-4872-80b0-61ba6131b14b" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Salmon Beach Wind Farm was constructed in 1987 and was the first wind farm in Australia. It was decommissioned and dismantled in 2001/2002 due to its location &amp; age.  Two turbines were donated to Esperance community, one of which is still in situ and the other, on display at the Esperance Museum. The remaining turbines were sold and sent to Queensland.  

On the edge of the car park, a large section of a turbine tower is lying on the ground. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/20f64421-e983-4547-9b94-aa514213cb1c" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Esperance is a town in the Goldfields Esperance region of Western Australia, on the Southern Ocean coastline approximately 720 kilometres east-southeast of Perth.  Its major industries are tourism, agriculture, and fishing. 

A beach and nature lover's dream, Esperance is blessed with squeaky-clean white sand, turquoise waters, untouched islands and colour-filled wildflower country. 

This AdventureLab will take to just 5 of the many wonderful places to visit while in Esperance. 
&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Award Information&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/d90a16df-ae59-43fe-9b84-59b89957b050" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Award Message:&lt;br /&gt;Congratulations!&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
