   <groundspeak:terrain>1</groundspeak:terrain>
   <groundspeak:country>Australia</groundspeak:country>
   <groundspeak:state>Western Australia</groundspeak:state>
   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Zamia Trail&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;South-west corner of the park&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/9e4dfea9-9f32-4add-bd82-780ea404cb82"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/9e4dfea9-9f32-4add-bd82-780ea404cb82&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;What animal is depicted on this sign? &lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/21d69e4d-5492-4897-a358-d3ef3834563c" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This leg is the longest and is mostly downhill. The fourth station is at a low point in the south-west corner of the park.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/50e7e046-d21e-4d63-a9d3-b4977538d3a5" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;On this adventure lab, enjoy a challenging 6-7km walk/run on limestone paths through Bold Park. The Park is one of the largest remaining bushland remnants in the Perth urban area with Xamia palms, Tuart and Banksia trees. Along the way there are views of the Indian Ocean, Perth city and the suburbs of Floreat and City Beach. 

The adventure lab is designed to start and finish at the Camel Lake car park, near the corner of Stephenson Ave and Perry Lakes Drive (S 31 56.880, E 115 46.830). There are five stops along the way to answer questions and receive clues to a bonus cache in Perry Lakes.

Allow one to two hours to complete the 6-7km loop along Camel Lake Trail, Zamia Trail and Yoorn Walk. There are some steep uphill and downhill sections. It requires a moderate level of fitness.
&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Award Information&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/a1bb9006-98e3-4a0b-94c9-e31219bee004" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Award Message:&lt;br /&gt;Record this coordinate for the bonus cache, B = 9. What goes down must go up. There are some hills ahead.&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
   <groundspeak:logs>
  </groundspeak:logs>
