   <groundspeak:country>Australia</groundspeak:country>
   <groundspeak:state>Western Australia</groundspeak:state>
   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Zamia Trail&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Zamia fork&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/9e4dfea9-9f32-4add-bd82-780ea404cb82"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/9e4dfea9-9f32-4add-bd82-780ea404cb82&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;What is the common name of the animal in the picture (three words)?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/a4172d6d-5f17-49b1-a285-39df722b5d6f" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Leaving location 2 you could take the left fork and then turn right onto either Hovea Walk or Thornbill walk. However, it is quicker to take the right fork up the hill and then turn left on Zamia Trail and walk along the ridge.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/50e7e046-d21e-4d63-a9d3-b4977538d3a5" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;On this adventure lab, enjoy a challenging 6-7km walk/run on limestone paths through Bold Park. The Park is one of the largest remaining bushland remnants in the Perth urban area with Xamia palms, Tuart and Banksia trees. Along the way there are views of the Indian Ocean, Perth city and the suburbs of Floreat and City Beach. 

The adventure lab is designed to start and finish at the Camel Lake car park, near the corner of Stephenson Ave and Perry Lakes Drive (S 31 56.880, E 115 46.830). There are five stops along the way to answer questions and receive clues to a bonus cache in Perry Lakes.

Allow one to two hours to complete the 6-7km loop along Camel Lake Trail, Zamia Trail and Yoorn Walk. There are some steep uphill and downhill sections. It requires a moderate level of fitness.
&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Award Information&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/94922b71-b26a-4501-93f2-db02d7902102" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Award Message:&lt;br /&gt;Well done you have completed the third stage. Record this coordinate for the bonus cache, C = 8.&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
   <groundspeak:logs>
  </groundspeak:logs>
   <groundspeak:travelbugs>
   </groundspeak:travelbugs>
</groundspeak:cache>
</wpt>
 <wpt lat="-31.557067" lon="116.468917">
