   <groundspeak:difficulty>1</groundspeak:difficulty>
   <groundspeak:terrain>1</groundspeak:terrain>
   <groundspeak:country>Australia</groundspeak:country>
   <groundspeak:state>Western Australia</groundspeak:state>
   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;"Its All About The Kids" in Toodyay!&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Toodyay Mini Railway&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/6089bbb5-94cb-4157-87fb-7ae4730256b1"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/6089bbb5-94cb-4157-87fb-7ae4730256b1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;What is the stations name?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/b9b7298d-de2b-4fb4-a760-b37d9a3debba" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Toodyay Miniature Railway was opened in 1996 and is owned by a local hobby club. Trains run for approx. 8-9 minutes on the 1.1 km long track. 
Trains consist of: 
Petrol engines 'diesels';
a coal fire steam locomotive and;
an electric (24 V battery) unit;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/d1cf63b7-1ba3-4492-abb7-e5c152160efe" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Welcome to our Adventure Lab Cache #2, designed by kids for kids!

Toodyay is a town on the Avon River in the Wheatbelt region of WA, 85 kilometres north-east of Perth.

The name Toodyay is believed to be derived from an Aboriginal word 'Duidgee' which means 'place of plenty', referring to the richness and fertility of the area and was where the first European settlement occurred in 1836. 

This AL will take you on a small tour of some of sights around the town that the kids will want to see with a bonus cache to find at the end.

Please enjoy! 
&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Award Information&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/d9e94e01-c1c5-4589-bf45-c9960561c0aa" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Award Message:&lt;br /&gt;Great work!  You will need A=7&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
   <groundspeak:logs>
  </groundspeak:logs>
   <groundspeak:travelbugs>
   </groundspeak:travelbugs>
</groundspeak:cache>
</wpt>
