   <groundspeak:state>Western Australia</groundspeak:state>
   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Newman Town&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Radio Hill Lookout&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/9e8c0bf3-9acd-41cb-b1e7-cac0bfacf6aa"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/9e8c0bf3-9acd-41cb-b1e7-cac0bfacf6aa&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;According to the Map of WA at the lookout, how many kilometres is it to Perth ? (numbers only)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/73fd2efd-009c-499a-a6cf-48e8debd6f10" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Head up here to get an idea of the size of Newman. 
From the lookout, you can see out to the nearby mine sites, across the town, and really get an idea of the landscape of the area.
There are BBQs and tables here so stop, admire the view, and have a rest. 

&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/fd5fe89f-02fa-430f-9eff-318d9e0eb70e" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Newman is the largest inland town in the Pilbara and provides accomodation and infrastructure for many surrounding minesites.
The Eastern Pilbara is one of the most isolated and inhospitable regions in Australia. Temperatures in summer time hover around 40°C and the hot winds blow in off the Great Sandy Desert. 
This adventure lab will take you to 5 locations around town. Phone reception is strong so you shouldnt have any issues here.
I would like to acknowledge the Nyiyaparli Traditional Owners, on whose ancestral land this Adventure Lab plays. I would like to pay my respect to their Elders past and present and extend that respect to all Aboriginal and Torres Strait Islander peoples today.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Award Information&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/30bb5144-cb37-47fc-8525-41783218a861" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Award Message:&lt;br /&gt;Congratulations. Can you see your next location from up here ?&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
   <groundspeak:logs>
  </groundspeak:logs>
   <groundspeak:travelbugs>
   </groundspeak:travelbugs>
</groundspeak:cache>
</wpt>
