   <groundspeak:country>Australia</groundspeak:country>
   <groundspeak:state>Western Australia</groundspeak:state>
   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Newman Town&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Haul Truck 793B&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/9e8c0bf3-9acd-41cb-b1e7-cac0bfacf6aa"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/9e8c0bf3-9acd-41cb-b1e7-cac0bfacf6aa&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;What is the Max Operating Weight of 793B ?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/13a23615-e2d3-4d63-b17e-be5c9e562c8a" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Long retired but this beast has hauled much of the iron ore in this region.
If you walk up the platform, you will find some information about the truck.
Your answer is up there.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/fd5fe89f-02fa-430f-9eff-318d9e0eb70e" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Newman is the largest inland town in the Pilbara and provides accomodation and infrastructure for many surrounding minesites.
The Eastern Pilbara is one of the most isolated and inhospitable regions in Australia. Temperatures in summer time hover around 40°C and the hot winds blow in off the Great Sandy Desert. 
This adventure lab will take you to 5 locations around town. Phone reception is strong so you shouldnt have any issues here.
I would like to acknowledge the Nyiyaparli Traditional Owners, on whose ancestral land this Adventure Lab plays. I would like to pay my respect to their Elders past and present and extend that respect to all Aboriginal and Torres Strait Islander peoples today.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Award Information&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/505f155a-c451-41d0-ac7f-0035cec5a31d" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Award Message:&lt;br /&gt;Well done, watch out for the wildlife as you drive through the Pilbara&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
