  <desc>ViewsFromVicto1</desc>
  <url>https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/9e9751cb-08fc-4aa6-a067-95ffb7755852</url>
  <urlname>Views from Victoria Gardens : S1 The Shelter by Paskersfind</urlname>
  <sym>Geocache</sym>
  <type>Geocache|Lab Cache</type>
  <groundspeak:cache id="99000418" available="True" archived="False" xmlns:groundspeak="http://www.groundspeak.com/cache/1/0/1">
   <groundspeak:name>Views from Victoria Gardens : S1 The Shelter</groundspeak:name>
   <groundspeak:placed_by>Paskersfind</groundspeak:placed_by>
   <groundspeak:owner id="">Paskersfind</groundspeak:owner>
   <groundspeak:type>Lab Cache</groundspeak:type>
   <groundspeak:container>Virtual</groundspeak:container>
   <groundspeak:attributes>
   </groundspeak:attributes>
   <groundspeak:difficulty>1</groundspeak:difficulty>
   <groundspeak:terrain>1</groundspeak:terrain>
   <groundspeak:country>Australia</groundspeak:country>
   <groundspeak:state>Western Australia</groundspeak:state>
   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Views from Victoria Gardens&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;The Shelter&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/9e9751cb-08fc-4aa6-a067-95ffb7755852"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/9e9751cb-08fc-4aa6-a067-95ffb7755852&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;How many white stripes can be seen on the semi-circular canopy of this shelter?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/ca33c856-16e7-43fa-ae18-b96275b8b7b3" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Often described as an "architectural folly", this quaint shelter is a testament to the popularity of the original gardens at the end of the nineteenth century and would be a good place to start . Interesting stories embedded in the 'seats' under this shelter are worth a read, if time permits. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/54f60d21-1384-489d-b0f3-125fb31b97b6" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Now just might be a great time to visit beautiful Victoria Gardens in East Perth. Located on an elevated peninsula above Claisebrook Cove, these gardens were one of the earliest public parks in Perth and offer stunning views of the Swan River and its surrounds together with a variety of artworks that celebrate Indigenous history and the early culture of this area.  All five locations can be found within the immediate vicinity and can be done in any order as you stroll to  all corners of the park. 
&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Award Information&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/6a78a609-1c1b-4f33-b417-46c0162fd5a7" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Award Message:&lt;br /&gt;Nice work! Remember this number if you are up for the bonus cache. &lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
   <groundspeak:logs>
  </groundspeak:logs>
   <groundspeak:travelbugs>
   </groundspeak:travelbugs>
</groundspeak:cache>
</wpt>
