   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Roundabouts, Sculptures, and high points&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Boulters Heights&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="background:#990000;color:#fff;border-radius:5px;padding:3px 5px;"&gt;linear&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/91e60a96-a610-4881-8d81-0500d6c563b5"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/91e60a96-a610-4881-8d81-0500d6c563b5&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;Boulters Heights is an important natural feature of the ancient ????????? dune system.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/d8573e83-f61c-405c-91ca-61aefcb59b5d" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Boulters Heights is a lookout in the centre of Bunbury offering spectacular panoramic views across the city. Take the wooden steps to the top of Boulter’s Heights Hill to experience uninterrupted views of Bunbury, the Port, Leschenault Estuary and the beautiful coastline.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/61bb6502-37b6-4311-96ed-7401fe9c8920" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Welcome to Bunbury's first Adventure labcache.

This little tour of a little under 2 km will take you to some interesting artwork and spectacular views. 
Please note: there is no bonus cache as we are too far to maintain one.
&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Award Information&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/e2ce01d3-77ae-4e7c-82fe-9527c4d400a5" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Award Message:&lt;br /&gt;Well done&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
