Artist: Gary Aitken

https://visitmandurah.com/art-trails/&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/d8687162-5cc8-4bbb-afc5-fe1343bfe817" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Mandurah is home to many sculptures and art installations. This Adventure Lab will take you to 5 of the neat sculptures we have found in this area. Have fun!!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Award Information&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;Award Message:&lt;br /&gt;Well done, another one found!!&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
