 <wpt lat="-33.949067" lon="115.074117">
  <ele>79.0</ele>
  <time>2021-10-20T08:00:00Z</time>
  <name>LBvB7g-01</name>
  <desc>MargaretRiverA1</desc>
  <url>https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/9aeac2a1-be3c-4a3f-aa80-fdf1eb57926d</url>
  <urlname>Margaret River Adventure : S1 Margaret River Visitor Centre by PilotJen</urlname>
  <sym>Geocache</sym>
  <type>Geocache|Lab Cache</type>
  <groundspeak:cache id="-531" available="True" archived="False" xmlns:groundspeak="http://www.groundspeak.com/cache/1/0/1">
   <groundspeak:name>Margaret River Adventure : S1 Margaret River Visitor Centre</groundspeak:name>
   <groundspeak:placed_by>PilotJen</groundspeak:placed_by>
   <groundspeak:owner id="">PilotJen</groundspeak:owner>
   <groundspeak:type>Lab Cache</groundspeak:type>
   <groundspeak:container>Virtual</groundspeak:container>
   <groundspeak:attributes>
   </groundspeak:attributes>
   <groundspeak:difficulty>1</groundspeak:difficulty>
   <groundspeak:terrain>1</groundspeak:terrain>
   <groundspeak:country></groundspeak:country>
   <groundspeak:state>Western Australia</groundspeak:state>
   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Margaret River Adventure&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Margaret River Visitor Centre&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/9aeac2a1-be3c-4a3f-aa80-fdf1eb57926d"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/9aeac2a1-be3c-4a3f-aa80-fdf1eb57926d&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;What is the 3-digit number, on the black letter box, to the left of the entrance doors?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/d449601b-484d-4475-8456-20d8c957229d" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Visitor Centre offers a free, real-time, comprehensive accommodation, tour and transport booking service, as well as friendly local advice on the best things to see and do in the region. Drop in to pick up your free regional touring map - and if you are travelling further afield, the staff can book your accommodation anywhere in Australia, specialising in the South West Corner!
Margaret River Visitor Centre is located in the heart of the Margaret River townsite and is surrounded by fantastic places to eat, so drop in and ask the local experts where to go for great coffee, sumptuous winery lunches or unforgettable evening meals.

Staff can assist you with bookings for anything from winery tours, eco-adventures to wonderful accommodation places throughout the region. Make sure you pick up your free regional touring map. Whether you are a regular to the region or a first-time visitor, no trip is complete without a stop at the Margaret River Visitor Centre.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/cf9f9c76-bdd7-4cbc-9cf6-1dafe9694e41" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This lab will take you to well known areas of Margaret River and areas that tourists rarely notice or visit. You will see kangaroos and a small waterfall at the end of this lab if you start at the visitor centre. 

This lab is not a long one, but it will be fun. Enjoy! &lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Award Information&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;Award Message:&lt;br /&gt;Congratulations!&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
   <groundspeak:logs>
  </groundspeak:logs>
   <groundspeak:travelbugs>
   </groundspeak:travelbugs>
</groundspeak:cache>
</wpt>
