   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Margaret River Adventure&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Kevill Road Waterfall&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/9aeac2a1-be3c-4a3f-aa80-fdf1eb57926d"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/9aeac2a1-be3c-4a3f-aa80-fdf1eb57926d&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;What are the first 2 digits of the Western Power pole number after the letter S?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/c9cbe8e4-2293-44aa-850e-7d997358fc6f" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is a very small waterfall, but it is a great place to cool off during summer. Swim at your own risk and watch your kids. This is not much of a tourist spot, so you are likely to have some privacy. There is plenty of parking. Enjoy this beautiful location.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/cf9f9c76-bdd7-4cbc-9cf6-1dafe9694e41" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This lab will take you to well known areas of Margaret River and areas that tourists rarely notice or visit. You will see kangaroos and a small waterfall at the end of this lab if you start at the visitor centre. 

This lab is not a long one, but it will be fun. Enjoy! &lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Award Information&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;Award Message:&lt;br /&gt;Congratulations!&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
