  <urlname>Margaret River Adventure : S3 Margaret River Youth Precinct - Skate Park by PilotJen</urlname>
  <sym>Geocache</sym>
  <type>Geocache|Lab Cache</type>
  <groundspeak:cache id="1476910055" available="True" archived="False" xmlns:groundspeak="http://www.groundspeak.com/cache/1/0/1">
   <groundspeak:name>Margaret River Adventure : S3 Margaret River Youth Precinct - Skate Park</groundspeak:name>
   <groundspeak:placed_by>PilotJen</groundspeak:placed_by>
   <groundspeak:owner id="">PilotJen</groundspeak:owner>
   <groundspeak:type>Lab Cache</groundspeak:type>
   <groundspeak:container>Virtual</groundspeak:container>
   <groundspeak:attributes>
   </groundspeak:attributes>
   <groundspeak:difficulty>1</groundspeak:difficulty>
   <groundspeak:terrain>1</groundspeak:terrain>
   <groundspeak:country></groundspeak:country>
   <groundspeak:state>Western Australia</groundspeak:state>
   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Margaret River Adventure&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Margaret River Youth Precinct - Skate Park&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/9aeac2a1-be3c-4a3f-aa80-fdf1eb57926d"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/9aeac2a1-be3c-4a3f-aa80-fdf1eb57926d&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;On the Margaret River Youth Precinct sign, in the yellow circle on the LEFT, what is the FIRST LETTER of the organisation that supported this?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/291270e3-5c51-4a9f-b9e2-114e7fefa021" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This place is great if you are traveling with kids, and they need to blow off some energy. It has at its heart a massive skate park for skateboards, scooters, and roller skates. There is also plenty of space to have a picnic and relax.

Before you ride, here are a few tips
•	The park is for all ages – 5 or 85.
•	If you don’t understand how a skatepark flows, ask someone who knows.
•	Snaking isn’t cool. Give your friend’s plenty of room and take your turn.
•	You can hit, or get hit from any direction, so always look around you.
•	Epic fails and falls can happen, wear protective gear!
•	Wear a helmet and pads in the bowl.
•	Parents and carers – keep an eye on your kids.
&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/cf9f9c76-bdd7-4cbc-9cf6-1dafe9694e41" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This lab will take you to well known areas of Margaret River and areas that tourists rarely notice or visit. You will see kangaroos and a small waterfall at the end of this lab if you start at the visitor centre. 

This lab is not a long one, but it will be fun. Enjoy! &lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Award Information&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;Award Message:&lt;br /&gt;Congratulations!&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
   <groundspeak:logs>
  </groundspeak:logs>
   <groundspeak:travelbugs>
   </groundspeak:travelbugs>
</groundspeak:cache>
</wpt>
 <wpt lat="-33.948117" lon="115.041817">
