   <groundspeak:difficulty>1</groundspeak:difficulty>
   <groundspeak:terrain>1</groundspeak:terrain>
   <groundspeak:country>Australia</groundspeak:country>
   <groundspeak:state>Western Australia</groundspeak:state>
   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Spooky Nights - A NIGHT ADVENTURE LAB&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Meet George at Oakabella Homestead&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/0361894f-c546-409c-bcfe-ba493ba0c7db"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/0361894f-c546-409c-bcfe-ba493ba0c7db&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;What year did we call into Oakabella to visit George? (Look a-round to see a four digit number)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/0c727680-03c4-45df-aae2-c546dcd30355" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Hi, I am George.
I am here in the spirit of George.
I am the most commonly-sighted paranormal presence at this homestead. 
In 1966, I accidentally killed myself while I was cleaning my gun in a room at the end of the cottage. 
When a staff member at the homestead moved furniture in the room, they reported a constant banging sound until all furniture was back in its original place. 
Was it Me making those loud banging noises?
I like things the way they were, I wont disturb you if you leave things as you found them in my room.
Stand at this waypoint, shine your torch to find the reflector, and look all a-round.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/9df66400-852a-4297-98be-99c72d2b8f83" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Western Australia has a number of Haunted Buildings.
Do you belive in the paranormal? 
Maybe this Adventure Lab will change your thoughts.
Unusual sightings, cold pockets of air, or sudden movements of objects for no apparent reason, unusual noises such as knocking or footsteps. 
There have been many reports at a few known locations around Western Australia.
Busselton hasn't been known as one of the famous haunted locations.
Have you experienced any activity or what is your theory, please include these in your logs.
This Adventure is from the Ghosts Point of View,
now it is time to get into the Spirit of things and meet your first Ghost.

This is a NIGHT TIME Adventure Lab.
It is a short walk around Lou Western Oval, 
and you WILL NEED a TORCH to find the answers to the questions.
ENSURE YOU ARE WITHIN 10 METRES OF THE WAYPOINTS TO FIND THE REFLECTORS.
ENJOY.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Award Information&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;Award Message:&lt;br /&gt;Congrats on finding George.&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
   <groundspeak:logs>
  </groundspeak:logs>
   <groundspeak:travelbugs>
   </groundspeak:travelbugs>
</groundspeak:cache>
</wpt>
