   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Spooky Nights - A NIGHT ADVENTURE LAB&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Meet Martha from the Fremantle Prison&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/0361894f-c546-409c-bcfe-ba493ba0c7db"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/0361894f-c546-409c-bcfe-ba493ba0c7db&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;There are many geometric shapes at this Institution. What shape is the reflector?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/4c661c03-10f1-4f51-a0c9-225731c49154" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Hello, I am Martha, a shadowy figure who spent time at this institution, and legend has it that my face occasionally appears in the chapel window.
It has been said, there has been plenty of paranormal activity recorded at this institution, will you devle into the history books to meet some of my ghostly friends?
Stand at this waypoint, and shine your torch around to find the reflector.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/9df66400-852a-4297-98be-99c72d2b8f83" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Western Australia has a number of Haunted Buildings.
Do you belive in the paranormal? 
Maybe this Adventure Lab will change your thoughts.
Unusual sightings, cold pockets of air, or sudden movements of objects for no apparent reason, unusual noises such as knocking or footsteps. 
There have been many reports at a few known locations around Western Australia.
Busselton hasn't been known as one of the famous haunted locations.
Have you experienced any activity or what is your theory, please include these in your logs.
This Adventure is from the Ghosts Point of View,
now it is time to get into the Spirit of things and meet your first Ghost.

This is a NIGHT TIME Adventure Lab.
It is a short walk around Lou Western Oval, 
and you WILL NEED a TORCH to find the answers to the questions.
ENSURE YOU ARE WITHIN 10 METRES OF THE WAYPOINTS TO FIND THE REFLECTORS.
ENJOY.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Award Information&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;Award Message:&lt;br /&gt;Congrats on finding Martha.&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
