   <groundspeak:country></groundspeak:country>
   <groundspeak:state>Western Australia</groundspeak:state>
   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Penguin Island Exploration&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Lookout&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/aba5d9c4-6600-4b5c-aa21-a410b5bb18bc"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/aba5d9c4-6600-4b5c-aa21-a410b5bb18bc&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;What date was the Penguin Island Southern Boardwalk and Lookout opened? (dd/mm/yyyy)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/56b17621-696a-4fa0-92f8-1e441ea27a53" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;There are some excellent places to look out over the beautiful waters and islands of the Shoalwater Islands Marine Park.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/162d10de-e12d-41ef-b117-3f138b8d85f1" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Located in the Shoalwater Islands Marine Park, Penguin Island is home to colonies of pelicans, terns, gulls, and of course Little Penguins. Over the years, the penguin population has been hit hard by human activity such as hunting, as well as introduced animals such as dogs and rabbits, and only a few hundred now remain. Today, Penguin Island's penguins are protected from these threats by the park's rules, appropriate facilities, and conservation work. However, they are still under threat from the broader problems of climate change and habitat damage, as well as human activity such as fishing and boating. To complete this AL, you will be heading to the island on the ferry. The ferry prices and park fees can be found at https://www.penguinisland.com.au/&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Award Information&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/3f7fcdd2-2f16-493b-a764-51b54e793dc7" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Award Message:&lt;br /&gt;There are only four locations in this series, but there's plenty more exploring to do on your own. We hope you enjoy your time here!&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
