   <groundspeak:country>Australia</groundspeak:country>
   <groundspeak:state>Western Australia</groundspeak:state>
   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;GERALDTON FORESHORE WANDERING &lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Play ground activities &lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/fc29b1a0-e5af-4d53-94aa-2463ff375afc"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/fc29b1a0-e5af-4d53-94aa-2463ff375afc&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;You need the large mural…. What are the 3 words painted in this mural ???&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/0bb9c85c-3b29-4818-80fd-00abff648021" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Here you will find a multitude of activities for the young and old &lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/0b1ae1a8-e434-452a-a142-a01c2a4c5571" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Welcome to Geraldton foreshore.
Here you can find many activities for the young and old . I recommend you start at one end and work your way to the other . There is plenty of parking along the way . 
In 2007, the Geraldton foreshore area, previously an abandoned railway marshalling yard, was redeveloped and today hosts a playground with water activities, public green spaces, public beaches, picnic areas, basketball court and shaded play areas. The project was completed in 2008.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Award Information&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/e3623710-98a4-4347-bc42-212d78d01856" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
