   <groundspeak:country>Australia</groundspeak:country>
   <groundspeak:state>Western Australia</groundspeak:state>
   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Australind Bunbury Tourist Drive 260&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Koombana Bay Lookout&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="background:#990000;color:#fff;border-radius:5px;padding:3px 5px;"&gt;linear&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/0b629cdd-df49-49a1-b896-4727eef727e4"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/0b629cdd-df49-49a1-b896-4727eef727e4&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;What is the name of the wreck in one of the images?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/375df1a0-ff10-41c1-a340-0f6156b9a165" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Sitting 15m above sea level and providing 360-views of Bunbury and Koombana Bay, the architecturally-designed Koombana Park lookout opened in 2019

The Lookout sits within Koombana Park and adjacent to the Mangrove Boardwalk and Mangrove Cove.

Around the base of the lookout there are a number of information signs.  One of them will provide the answer for this stage.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/9efba563-718e-4429-b417-f748ede82572" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Australind Bunbury Tourist Drive, designated as Tourist Drive 260, is a 14-kilometre-long  historic route from Bunbury to Leschenault via Australind.

There are numerous places of interest along the way and this Adventure Lab will take you to some of them.

Note the numeric answers to some of the questions as they will allow you to find a bonus geocache after completing all stages of this Adventure Lab.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Award Information&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/6a7b1a97-60dd-4a12-ac00-ce690f982c7a" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Award Message:&lt;br /&gt;Congratulations of completing this stage of the Adventure Lab.

There are no clues for the bonus cache at this location.&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
