There are 5 lab locations, one at each station where the CircleRoute crosses a train line. A bonus final cache is located in Fremantle, the start and end point of the CircleRoute.

Make sure you also pick up the 17 traditional caches located at each timing point along the CircleRoute. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Award Information&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;Award Message:&lt;br /&gt;Make sure to note the following clues, in order to locate the bonus cache:
