  <time>2022-03-28T08:00:00Z</time>
  <name>LBmT8Y-03</name>
  <desc>LItsAllAboutTh3</desc>
  <url>https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/c056f8d9-86e0-4b9c-b3df-33dea0e4b835</url>
  <urlname>[L] "Its All About The Kids" Murder Mystery Adventure! : S3 Clue 3 by BJA3</urlname>
  <sym>Geocache</sym>
  <type>Geocache|Lab Cache</type>
  <groundspeak:cache id="99002514" available="True" archived="False" xmlns:groundspeak="http://www.groundspeak.com/cache/1/0/1">
   <groundspeak:name>[L] "Its All About The Kids" Murder Mystery Adventure! : S3 Clue 3</groundspeak:name>
   <groundspeak:placed_by>BJA3</groundspeak:placed_by>
   <groundspeak:owner id="">BJA3</groundspeak:owner>
   <groundspeak:type>Lab Cache</groundspeak:type>
   <groundspeak:container>Virtual</groundspeak:container>
   <groundspeak:attributes>
   </groundspeak:attributes>
   <groundspeak:difficulty>1</groundspeak:difficulty>
   <groundspeak:terrain>1</groundspeak:terrain>
   <groundspeak:country>Australia</groundspeak:country>
   <groundspeak:state>Western Australia</groundspeak:state>
   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;"Its All About The Kids" Murder Mystery Adventure!&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Clue 3&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="background:#990000;color:#fff;border-radius:5px;padding:3px 5px;"&gt;linear&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/c056f8d9-86e0-4b9c-b3df-33dea0e4b835"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/c056f8d9-86e0-4b9c-b3df-33dea0e4b835&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;Which suspect was allegedly sleeping at the time of the murder?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/39a85878-416c-4774-9586-5466293a825e" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Suspects: The Wife, The Butler, The Gardener, The Cook &amp; The Maid.

Answer the question to find out the suspects alibi for the time of the murder!
&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/4376f4e9-f726-4d69-94ed-d4d569a17406" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;It's a sleepy Sunday morning, and who doesn't love sleeping in on a Sunday, UNLESS .........!  

You guessed it, all is not okay with the world, a man has been found murdered.  

There were five seemingly innocent people in the house besides the victim: the Wife, the Butler, the Gardener, the Cook and the Maid.

The Police are called to interview all five and with your help make an arrest.

So, who was it?

Go to each location in sequence to get the nominated suspects alibi.  One might not add up??  Once you have made your deductions, go to the Bonus Cache page (GC9QCDZ) and input your suspect into Certitude, as per the instructions to get the final location.

So what are you waiting for, let's START this Adventure.
&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Award Information&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/b53aae23-974f-4130-81d7-9471428f6ac9" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Award Message:&lt;br /&gt;Your third clue: 
The wife was supposedly enjoying her Sunday sleep in?? Take a walk to the next location to obtain another clue.&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
   <groundspeak:logs>
  </groundspeak:logs>
   <groundspeak:travelbugs>
   </groundspeak:travelbugs>
</groundspeak:cache>
</wpt>
