   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;A Swing through Swan&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Oasis Supa Golf and Mini Golf&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/12123491-dfc0-4b3d-ad8c-6285380e0ef5"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/12123491-dfc0-4b3d-ad8c-6285380e0ef5&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;What is the name of the Laser shooting game company that is held near by?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/c95f67d2-8cb2-497d-a295-4162aeca003c" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Nothing like a little fun and exercise to work off all this food, chocolate, coffee and wine.
Supa Golf is like regular Golf but more fun, they have a front 9 holes and back 9. The front 9 being the easier of the two.
There are lots of cover from the trees and it is usally not to hot.
&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/adc4fa20-01c9-48bb-856c-e9afac1e098f" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This Adventure Lab features a few favourite places to be with friends when i use to live near by.


