Oggies Ice Cream Cafe.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Award Information&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/e027695b-bb21-4cc9-941b-90a5b6c14376" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
