   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;HMAS Sydney II Memorial&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Wall Of Remembrance&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="background:#990000;color:#fff;border-radius:5px;padding:3px 5px;"&gt;linear&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/890d2d1b-386c-4e34-9b99-05a9ede1de0c"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/890d2d1b-386c-4e34-9b99-05a9ede1de0c&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;On the end of the wall, closest to the ocean, what are the last four words written?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/0a07e658-5a44-4a20-a17b-6445c5de0e7c" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The wall of remembrance is a semi circular wall made from WA black granite engraved with the names of the 645 men lost aboard the HMAS Sydney II. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/7e5bfe44-2aab-4337-8a32-4fcfa5eb4147" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The HMAS Sydney II Memorial comprises many symbolic elements expressing the tragic loss of 645 lives on board the HMAS Sydney II.

There is a bonus box to this lab - GC9R0XT&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Award Information&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/69e189c3-1723-4b56-8f58-3c433bb043be" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Award Message:&lt;br /&gt;Congratulations &lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
