  <url>https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/890d2d1b-386c-4e34-9b99-05a9ede1de0c</url>
  <urlname>[L] HMAS Sydney II Memorial : S4 The Waiting Women Sculpture by Barnzy12</urlname>
  <sym>Geocache</sym>
  <type>Geocache|Lab Cache</type>
  <groundspeak:cache id="-633" available="True" archived="False" xmlns:groundspeak="http://www.groundspeak.com/cache/1/0/1">
   <groundspeak:name>[L] HMAS Sydney II Memorial : S4 The Waiting Women Sculpture</groundspeak:name>
   <groundspeak:placed_by>Barnzy12</groundspeak:placed_by>
   <groundspeak:owner id="">Barnzy12</groundspeak:owner>
   <groundspeak:type>Lab Cache</groundspeak:type>
   <groundspeak:container>Virtual</groundspeak:container>
   <groundspeak:attributes>
   </groundspeak:attributes>
   <groundspeak:difficulty>1</groundspeak:difficulty>
   <groundspeak:terrain>1</groundspeak:terrain>
   <groundspeak:country>Australia</groundspeak:country>
   <groundspeak:state>Western Australia</groundspeak:state>
   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;HMAS Sydney II Memorial&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;The Waiting Women Sculpture&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="background:#990000;color:#fff;border-radius:5px;padding:3px 5px;"&gt;linear&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/890d2d1b-386c-4e34-9b99-05a9ede1de0c"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/890d2d1b-386c-4e34-9b99-05a9ede1de0c&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;On the sculpture, how many buttons are on the front of her outfit? (Number only)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/63776af9-9527-4f4b-9a43-7df9a25bd8dc" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The waiting woman statue stands at the edge of the precinct. Appearing almost real, she leans anxiously into the wind. Frozen in time and bronze she is the all encompassing “waiting woman” grieving her menfolk. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/7e5bfe44-2aab-4337-8a32-4fcfa5eb4147" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The HMAS Sydney II Memorial comprises many symbolic elements expressing the tragic loss of 645 lives on board the HMAS Sydney II.

There is a bonus box to this lab - GC9R0XT&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Award Information&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/8b1c4709-f419-4938-87b3-e57c6dfe6721" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Award Message:&lt;br /&gt;Congratulations &lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
   <groundspeak:logs>
  </groundspeak:logs>
   <groundspeak:travelbugs>
   </groundspeak:travelbugs>
</groundspeak:cache>
</wpt>
 <wpt lat="-28.7731" lon="114.615767">
