   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Lighthouse Park - A night time lab&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Lime Kilns&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/98e52a77-ac64-4e6c-9992-9d159339430d"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/98e52a77-ac64-4e6c-9992-9d159339430d&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;What temperature was exceeded to burn limestone? (digits)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/ea0d22c2-836e-44a1-a8a4-9b4a956084cb" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;There have been a few caches around here over the years but never an AdLab. Look for those three dots&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/a407ffa9-44c3-47e7-9766-3ce77e29b828" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;When is the best time to view a working lighthouse? Well in the dark of course! So this adventure is all about the dark. Grab your torch and your device and off you go. Bonus cache available. https://coord.info/GC9RFYH&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Award Information&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;Award Message:&lt;br /&gt;Great hunting. Your bonus letter is I&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
