   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Hidden Suburban Art &lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Diversity in Gosnells&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/7152a471-7de7-4efc-8e35-b2905d5f4cae"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/7152a471-7de7-4efc-8e35-b2905d5f4cae&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;In the YELLOW section, what is the prominent word written in LIGHT-BLUE?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/a6cc2c05-427b-409e-a824-0a9ad6485f64" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Here, a hip-high retainer wall serves as a canvas to showcase Gosnells' large multicultural community.
&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/979c4783-24fa-4cc7-abaa-9609b17fa833" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This little tour will take you around the heart of Gosnells to some obvious and some less obvious examples of suburban street art, celebrating culture, heritage and diversity in the City.
You can park your car at the first location (the Railway markets in Gosnells), the tour will loop you back here, should you choose to do them in order. We can recommend a stop at the nearby pub as a reward. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Award Information&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/9bf5d77c-f285-47e9-b16b-54b4c7ed49f8" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
