   <groundspeak:difficulty>1</groundspeak:difficulty>
   <groundspeak:terrain>1</groundspeak:terrain>
   <groundspeak:country></groundspeak:country>
   <groundspeak:state>Western Australia</groundspeak:state>
   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;The (old) Road to Bunbury&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Yarloop&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/c8032bc6-fa86-4ce5-9234-a06129c1e8fc"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/c8032bc6-fa86-4ce5-9234-a06129c1e8fc&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;Where are you?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/8a5b1498-f08b-427d-aa52-ebed482fa6d7" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;On 7 January 2016, 121 homes were destroyed by a massive bushfire. Over a seven-minute period, the fire also burned the historic timber workshops, factories, an old church, the old hospital, shops, the hotel, fire station and a part of the school.

Public access to Yarloop was restored on 11 August 2016, seven months after the fire, when roadblocks were removed. A new community centre was built, incorporating the facade of the original town hall, and opened in November 2019.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/3de6cb8d-13fc-4aec-90e3-a2dd257ecc2d" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Before the Forrest Hwy was opened in 2009 one of the main routes to Bunbury was along the South Western Hwy. The old road to Bunbury passes through several towns which this Adventure Lab will cause you to visit. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Award Information&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/eaf09323-0980-43a3-8610-0171d779caac" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Award Message:&lt;br /&gt;Well done!&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
   <groundspeak:logs>
  </groundspeak:logs>
   <groundspeak:travelbugs>
