   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Gastronomic Gadabout @ Denmark&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Cheese Please&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/ee9a56ca-03dc-4b34-a232-98718e0e4553"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/ee9a56ca-03dc-4b34-a232-98718e0e4553&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;On the top section of the signboard, what are the 2 words following 'The'? &lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/6aadacfc-51b1-4218-9dbc-65212dbbdc21" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fromage frenzy indeed at this spot.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/ce1aa43b-a982-4bda-b8b7-03947cf72b81" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Welcome to a tour around some of Denmark's gastronomic delights.
You will need a vehicle to navigate to most of the locations but along the way you will be treated to fantastic scenery and views.
There is no need to enter any of the facilities to gain the answers but if you must, enter at your own peril - we accept no responsibility for $'s spent or weight gained!!
Collect the letter after completing each of the locations and make a word appropriate to this theme to enter into the checker to claim the bonus cache.
Enjoy the tour!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Award Information&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;Award Message:&lt;br /&gt;Are you enjoying your gadabout? You will need this letter to claim the bonus cache: T&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
