The host has a very cheeky sense of humour which will be noted in his various 'made on the premises' products.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/ce1aa43b-a982-4bda-b8b7-03947cf72b81" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Welcome to a tour around some of Denmark's gastronomic delights.
You will need a vehicle to navigate to most of the locations but along the way you will be treated to fantastic scenery and views.
There is no need to enter any of the facilities to gain the answers but if you must, enter at your own peril - we accept no responsibility for $'s spent or weight gained!!
Collect the letter after completing each of the locations and make a word appropriate to this theme to enter into the checker to claim the bonus cache.
Enjoy the tour!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Award Information&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;Award Message:&lt;br /&gt;Did you get your 'bit on the side'? You will need this letter to claim the bonus cache: S&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
