   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Gastronomic Gadabout @ Denmark&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Java Junkie&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/ee9a56ca-03dc-4b34-a232-98718e0e4553"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/ee9a56ca-03dc-4b34-a232-98718e0e4553&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;What is the silver coloured word on the window on immediate left hand side of front door?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/95dab61d-040c-4396-acf9-cc8894bd8b99" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Coffee roasters - what a great way to start the day!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/ce1aa43b-a982-4bda-b8b7-03947cf72b81" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Welcome to a tour around some of Denmark's gastronomic delights.
You will need a vehicle to navigate to most of the locations but along the way you will be treated to fantastic scenery and views.
There is no need to enter any of the facilities to gain the answers but if you must, enter at your own peril - we accept no responsibility for $'s spent or weight gained!!
Collect the letter after completing each of the locations and make a word appropriate to this theme to enter into the checker to claim the bonus cache.
Enjoy the tour!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Award Information&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/1acc3c58-0ab3-42b1-81b1-24cd44ecf0c1" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Award Message:&lt;br /&gt;Did you get your rocket fuel? You will need this letter to claim the bonus cache: A&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
