   <groundspeak:difficulty>1</groundspeak:difficulty>
   <groundspeak:terrain>1</groundspeak:terrain>
   <groundspeak:country></groundspeak:country>
   <groundspeak:state>Western Australia</groundspeak:state>
   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Beaches of Bunbury&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Back Beach&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/f57c3292-16fb-45e9-87e1-7b463235590f"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/f57c3292-16fb-45e9-87e1-7b463235590f&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;On the sign titled "The Bright Spot" what style of building is mentioned?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/2edc9689-19ea-4ac7-bde5-676fe8079dde" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;A place with a simple name - Back Beach.  Here there is a cafe, surf club, a super beach and a space across the road where you can camp in your caravan or mobile home.  What more do you need.
&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/bcbff0d4-3ac0-4509-80e1-a912db6dacca" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Welcome to Bunbury.  One of my favourite parts of this city is Ocean Drive.  Ocean Drive takes you past some fabulous beaches.  Whether you like to swim, surf, cycle, walk or just sit and contemplate life, you'll find a perfect spot at one of the beaches along Ocean Drive.

So drive, walk cycle or even grab one of the many e-scooters available for hire along this stretch.  You will pass a number of traditional geocaches, earthcaches, cafes, a pub, plus many spots to access the beaches, or to sit and watch the water.

Maybe you'll spot a whale, or some ships lining up to enter the port.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Award Information&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/236bba5a-f9b0-4dd8-9535-efb28d3e1cb8" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Award Message:&lt;br /&gt;Nice Job.  On to the next one?  Don't forget to grab a coffee before you go.&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
   <groundspeak:logs>
  </groundspeak:logs>
