   <groundspeak:country></groundspeak:country>
   <groundspeak:state>Western Australia</groundspeak:state>
   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Beaches of Bunbury&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Hungry Hollow&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/f57c3292-16fb-45e9-87e1-7b463235590f"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/f57c3292-16fb-45e9-87e1-7b463235590f&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;At this location you should see a sign titled "Hungry Hollow".  What is the last word on this sign?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/f9de359f-1659-4bdf-95a1-f964ee41b7f8" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Hungry Hollow is a larger space, with BBQs, toilets, good access to the beach and walking distance to a popular pub where you can enjoy the view over a meal and a drink&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/bcbff0d4-3ac0-4509-80e1-a912db6dacca" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Welcome to Bunbury.  One of my favourite parts of this city is Ocean Drive.  Ocean Drive takes you past some fabulous beaches.  Whether you like to swim, surf, cycle, walk or just sit and contemplate life, you'll find a perfect spot at one of the beaches along Ocean Drive.

So drive, walk cycle or even grab one of the many e-scooters available for hire along this stretch.  You will pass a number of traditional geocaches, earthcaches, cafes, a pub, plus many spots to access the beaches, or to sit and watch the water.

Maybe you'll spot a whale, or some ships lining up to enter the port.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Award Information&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/0ca72c47-20ce-4710-a7a6-2ecf10663f4f" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Award Message:&lt;br /&gt;Well done! Do you need to use the facilities?&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
