   <groundspeak:terrain>1</groundspeak:terrain>
   <groundspeak:country></groundspeak:country>
   <groundspeak:state>Western Australia</groundspeak:state>
   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Beaches of Bunbury&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Pendal Street&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/f57c3292-16fb-45e9-87e1-7b463235590f"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/f57c3292-16fb-45e9-87e1-7b463235590f&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;On the seat at this location is a plaque commemorating "Jo".  Where was Jo born?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/8d9b86e2-541d-4c63-b070-bd4b6fdae8de" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;A nice spot here to sit and watch the sunset.  Often, in early evening there is a food truck here so you can pick up a meal and sit at the nearby tables.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/bcbff0d4-3ac0-4509-80e1-a912db6dacca" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Welcome to Bunbury.  One of my favourite parts of this city is Ocean Drive.  Ocean Drive takes you past some fabulous beaches.  Whether you like to swim, surf, cycle, walk or just sit and contemplate life, you'll find a perfect spot at one of the beaches along Ocean Drive.

So drive, walk cycle or even grab one of the many e-scooters available for hire along this stretch.  You will pass a number of traditional geocaches, earthcaches, cafes, a pub, plus many spots to access the beaches, or to sit and watch the water.

Maybe you'll spot a whale, or some ships lining up to enter the port.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Award Information&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/1858f2f8-a393-4b19-b387-7c4b782f817c" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Award Message:&lt;br /&gt;Well done.  Take a seat, look out to sea.  What can you see?&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
