  <url>https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/1e18a3cd-50d0-4f4c-9009-4a10d943ec79</url>
  <urlname>Joondal-Up &amp; Down : S1 Water Tower Park by atCatpacity</urlname>
  <sym>Geocache</sym>
  <type>Geocache|Lab Cache</type>
  <groundspeak:cache id="99003621" available="True" archived="False" xmlns:groundspeak="http://www.groundspeak.com/cache/1/0/1">
   <groundspeak:name>Joondal-Up &amp; Down : S1 Water Tower Park</groundspeak:name>
   <groundspeak:placed_by>atCatpacity</groundspeak:placed_by>
   <groundspeak:owner id="">atCatpacity</groundspeak:owner>
   <groundspeak:type>Lab Cache</groundspeak:type>
   <groundspeak:container>Virtual</groundspeak:container>
   <groundspeak:attributes>
   </groundspeak:attributes>
   <groundspeak:difficulty>1</groundspeak:difficulty>
   <groundspeak:terrain>1</groundspeak:terrain>
   <groundspeak:country>Australia</groundspeak:country>
   <groundspeak:state>Western Australia</groundspeak:state>
   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Joondal-Up &amp; Down&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Water Tower Park&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/1e18a3cd-50d0-4f4c-9009-4a10d943ec79"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/1e18a3cd-50d0-4f4c-9009-4a10d943ec79&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;Who unveiled the plaque on the water tower? &lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/f25c14d3-6486-4e5e-b835-7228c260bdf3" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You made it to the top! This park has some small ocean views and a large water tower.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/50e63217-bf21-4a76-9766-c83d165d15de" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Take a trek through this beautiful network of parks in northern Joondalup. 

This adventure will take you up to the water tower at the top of the hill and back down to explore some of the area's interesting features. 

You will be able to follow footpaths for most of the way and the slopes are not overly challenging. But if you decide to walk the whole way, you might want to bring some water.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Award Information&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/6f7b67af-fe62-417b-a645-efd77c2c785a" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Award Message:&lt;br /&gt;118

You will need all 5 numbers to locate the bonus cache.&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
   <groundspeak:logs>
  </groundspeak:logs>
   <groundspeak:travelbugs>
   </groundspeak:travelbugs>
</groundspeak:cache>
</wpt>
