   <groundspeak:state>Western Australia</groundspeak:state>
   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Joondal-Up &amp; Down&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Nanika Park&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/1e18a3cd-50d0-4f4c-9009-4a10d943ec79"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/1e18a3cd-50d0-4f4c-9009-4a10d943ec79&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;Who is the artist of the mural titled 'Friendship'? (Two words)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/3651c604-d28a-4d20-8d1e-0904c0aaea09" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Featuring a basketball/cricket play area.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/50e63217-bf21-4a76-9766-c83d165d15de" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Take a trek through this beautiful network of parks in northern Joondalup. 

This adventure will take you up to the water tower at the top of the hill and back down to explore some of the area's interesting features. 

You will be able to follow footpaths for most of the way and the slopes are not overly challenging. But if you decide to walk the whole way, you might want to bring some water.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Award Information&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/1ec0146a-84ef-4a22-979c-81545f892e08" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Award Message:&lt;br /&gt;1260

You will need all 5 numbers to locate the bonus cache.&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
   <groundspeak:logs>
  </groundspeak:logs>
   <groundspeak:travelbugs>
   </groundspeak:travelbugs>
</groundspeak:cache>
</wpt>
