   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Bunbury Hidden Art &lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Blue lipped Mural &lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/043949a8-b601-43a6-a32f-1ee304f3891b"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/043949a8-b601-43a6-a32f-1ee304f3891b&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;How many Blue lipped girls? Spelling&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/c01a4739-48fd-4383-823c-535166c24501" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Askew One is an artist reared in the Aotearoa New Zealand graffiti scene. His murals have appeared on walls all over the world.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/f09837e4-c26c-467b-ba85-94ea3e6f6d99" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Down the alleyways and back streets of Bunbury you can find a wide range of murals by world renowned and local artists. This is only a small sample of the murals that dot the city.  So put on your walking shoes and get out or hire an e-scooter and enjoy your Adventure Lab. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Award Information&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/d21b8cf1-b314-4b11-af07-76527a1dfc3b" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Award Message:&lt;br /&gt;Well done. On to the next :) &lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
