   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Photo Frames&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Natural Tree Frame&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/95ae8bed-5f40-4378-b046-123a25fa3a39"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/95ae8bed-5f40-4378-b046-123a25fa3a39&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;What shape is the cross section of the ballustrade's handrail?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/458faecc-a73f-4e8b-87f0-50234c057b0d" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Great natural frames here, there and everywhere!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/68110986-8173-45ef-8b12-9c225e328209" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;All the locations on this adventure form great frames for photos. So grab your camera and get clicking!&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
