Railway was built. In ..... the State Government bought
out the private company, and the line between Beverley and
Albany became part of the West Australian Government
Railway.
&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/ce526394-5db9-405a-b1f4-b5edb31147b3" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Newton House Barbecue stands on the site of the original Newton family home, build in the early 1900's. It recreates the elements of a pioneer home - the stone chimney matters stove. water tank and kitchen table - representing comfort and shelter. surrounding the  house is an old fashioned country garden. 
