   <groundspeak:terrain>1</groundspeak:terrain>
   <groundspeak:country>Australia</groundspeak:country>
   <groundspeak:state>Western Australia</groundspeak:state>
   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Wandering around Wandering&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;The Wandering Sikhs&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/808ebf1f-61da-4499-9de2-3f1e116fa6cb"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/808ebf1f-61da-4499-9de2-3f1e116fa6cb&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;The traviling salesmen of the regions were called? (One Word)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/0db6104b-612f-4212-a780-70c211138b5a" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Junga, Ham and Veer Singh all traded goods within the Wandering area, with Veer Singh taking up residency for a while.

This memorial will contribute to the Wandering community’s sense of place as a reminder of the Sikh’s presence in this area and the cultural diversity of Wandering.

More information on the sign.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/6dc6050d-a8df-49ba-8a19-a2540647fc01" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The area's name appears to come from a local Aboriginal word, "wandooin", after the wandoo or white gum tree that is prevalent in the area, although some sources suggest it was named to recall the first sighting of wandering stock, and was originally applied to Wandering Brook, first recorded in 1866.

Wandering was first settled in 1859 by members of the George Stedman Watts family when their straying wagon team horses were found grazing in lush grass around a fresh water spring known to this day as Horse Well. In 1861, they selected an area on what is now the south-eastern approach to the town, and named it "Grassdale".&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Award Information&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/6debf55f-4202-4b61-aaef-b2255448aafd" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
   <groundspeak:logs>
  </groundspeak:logs>
   <groundspeak:travelbugs>
   </groundspeak:travelbugs>
</groundspeak:cache>
