  <urlname>[L] Welcome to Narrogin : S2 Memorial Park by ebenie</urlname>
  <sym>Geocache</sym>
  <type>Geocache|Lab Cache</type>
  <groundspeak:cache id="99003703" available="True" archived="False" xmlns:groundspeak="http://www.groundspeak.com/cache/1/0/1">
   <groundspeak:name>[L] Welcome to Narrogin : S2 Memorial Park</groundspeak:name>
   <groundspeak:placed_by>ebenie</groundspeak:placed_by>
   <groundspeak:owner id="">ebenie</groundspeak:owner>
   <groundspeak:type>Lab Cache</groundspeak:type>
   <groundspeak:container>Virtual</groundspeak:container>
   <groundspeak:attributes>
   </groundspeak:attributes>
   <groundspeak:difficulty>1</groundspeak:difficulty>
   <groundspeak:terrain>1</groundspeak:terrain>
   <groundspeak:country>Australia</groundspeak:country>
   <groundspeak:state>Western Australia</groundspeak:state>
   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Welcome to Narrogin&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Memorial Park&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="background:#990000;color:#fff;border-radius:5px;padding:3px 5px;"&gt;linear&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/06cef230-1579-45bf-80d4-a688189fdcae"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/06cef230-1579-45bf-80d4-a688189fdcae&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;What were the yards here used for&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/19d22121-8447-4fc3-82cf-6f723809a848" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Triangle park was a yard for horses before becoming a park which now holds our ANZAC services.  They built a Memorial Pavilion to which holds names of the battlefields of our Australian Forces. The police station is still close by, but now housing horse power of a different kind within their compound.
The still received many people and of varying cultures for ANZAC services here&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/7da06754-2acf-4ffe-822b-df860ab943ce" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;A bit of the history of our town 
Of days gone by.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Award Information&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/ec290799-bf29-4685-90d6-6f264473f6c9" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Award Message:&lt;br /&gt;Congratulations   Now off to the next&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
   <groundspeak:logs>
  </groundspeak:logs>
   <groundspeak:travelbugs>
   </groundspeak:travelbugs>
</groundspeak:cache>
</wpt>
