   <groundspeak:country>Australia</groundspeak:country>
   <groundspeak:state>Western Australia</groundspeak:state>
   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Welcome to Narrogin&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Duke of York Hotel&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="background:#990000;color:#fff;border-radius:5px;padding:3px 5px;"&gt;linear&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/06cef230-1579-45bf-80d4-a688189fdcae"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/06cef230-1579-45bf-80d4-a688189fdcae&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;How old was Nickolas Bushalla when he died&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/0b32c4f7-e994-4d00-9e7b-5851a10fa6c0" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;A pioneer - Nickolas Bushalla.  Arrived in Narrogin in 1897 and built the Duke off York Hotel here.  There is many pictures inside the hotel of the early days.  Well worth a visit
Nickolas has you would say had his finger in many pies as the board here suggests.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/7da06754-2acf-4ffe-822b-df860ab943ce" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;A bit of the history of our town 
Of days gone by.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Award Information&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/37339619-3b8a-4cbe-ab3d-0b640b9e0dbe" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Award Message:&lt;br /&gt;Congratulations  Now on to the next&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
   <groundspeak:logs>
  </groundspeak:logs>
   <groundspeak:travelbugs>
   </groundspeak:travelbugs>
