   <groundspeak:difficulty>1</groundspeak:difficulty>
   <groundspeak:terrain>1</groundspeak:terrain>
   <groundspeak:country>Australia</groundspeak:country>
   <groundspeak:state>Western Australia</groundspeak:state>
   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Waterfalls and Rapids&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Noble Falls&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/7f15a1f3-fda5-4858-b478-c635f52f22ee"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/7f15a1f3-fda5-4858-b478-c635f52f22ee&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;What is the name of the tree on the sign?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/80f85a80-ee69-4640-a09c-413f2fe57c3c" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Noble Falls is a delightful little patch of eastern Perth, offering a serene waterfall setting amongst dense jarrah, marri and blackbutt bushland. Given it’s smaller size and location, it’s one of the first waterfalls to begin filling up with the rains, making it a popular early-winter day trip spot. The surrounding walk trail is pleasant, easily accessible, and dog-friendly! There are  picnic tables and toilet facilities. 

Distance: 3.5km
Recommended for: Everyone&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/38a3bbf1-4aa8-494d-97b9-f8694299312b" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you’ve found yourself a clear day after a heavy downpour, the best thing you can do is hop in your car and get yourself to one of these waterfall hikes as soon as possible! Perth has a good collection of waterfalls within its hills, snuggled up against the scarp, some higher than others but all set in beautiful natural bushlands.
Pack a picnic, your hiking boots, walking poles and don't forget your camera. 

*Please note: all but one of these locations will require a short hike, sometimes over rough ground.*
Source: https://perthisok.com/best-of-wa/the-best-waterfall-hikes-in-perth/&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Award Information&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/e11fcc7f-02c3-4360-905a-f2f492603760" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Award Message:&lt;br /&gt;Another great location; the local bush is recovering well from the February 2021 fires.&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
