   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Millie’s Slides&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Ardross Graham Lanark Reserve&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/9da10ede-8d03-484c-bcbb-395d52ac9410"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/9da10ede-8d03-484c-bcbb-395d52ac9410&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;What colour is the slide?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/1c184912-7d1f-4b32-91a9-963276b1f1f3" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;One of many quiet little parks in Coolbinia. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/bcde3c90-f3de-49f8-b198-e0fa1b3e3acc" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are blessed to have plenty of parks within walking distance of home. We thought we would share some with you.

Family friendly. To enable those without children to visit each location, it is possible to walk on a paved, public path to answer each question. 

There is no need to enter any playground area, although you’re encouraged to do so. If your bum fits, slide I say.

&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
