   <groundspeak:attributes>
   </groundspeak:attributes>
   <groundspeak:difficulty>1</groundspeak:difficulty>
   <groundspeak:terrain>1</groundspeak:terrain>
   <groundspeak:country></groundspeak:country>
   <groundspeak:state>Western Australia</groundspeak:state>
   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;NGN MMRS&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Narrogin Hospital&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/aa155a58-7237-492e-a955-664960fb5b19"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/aa155a58-7237-492e-a955-664960fb5b19&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;What substance is present in the roofing tiles above the entry doors?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/cf0dd985-f76f-4098-8a5c-c7e476228aca" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;My memories of the hospital go all the way back to 1988 when I received my first stitches after copping a cricket wicket to the head during a game of pirates at the gliding club.

I was routinely brought into town to get patched up from various cuts and scrapes from adventures out around the airfield and surrounding farms.

Things have changed a lot in the following years and I will always think of this building as the whole hospital.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/bf292e1c-19f3-4fc5-9d54-d65eeedbb258" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;BE AWARE: The airfield can be busy, especially on weekends, make sure you drive slowly and are aware of aircraft when walking around.

My childhood and youth are filled with memories of Friday afternoons piling into the car and heading down to Narrogin to spend the weekend at the gliding club. On occasions, summer holidays were spent in the town and its surrounds.

So many great stories were had here and in the town and this lab aims to share those memories with you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Award Information&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;Award Message:&lt;br /&gt;Info for Bonus

_ _ - _ U _&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
   <groundspeak:logs>
  </groundspeak:logs>
   <groundspeak:travelbugs>
   </groundspeak:travelbugs>
</groundspeak:cache>
</wpt>
 <wpt lat="-32.93475" lon="117.177883">
