   <groundspeak:difficulty>1</groundspeak:difficulty>
   <groundspeak:terrain>1</groundspeak:terrain>
   <groundspeak:country>Australia</groundspeak:country>
   <groundspeak:state>Western Australia</groundspeak:state>
   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Welcome to Perth&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Like a virgin &lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="background:#990000;color:#fff;border-radius:5px;padding:3px 5px;"&gt;linear&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/80c1d3e9-402f-4f2e-b66d-305b908dbdb8"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/80c1d3e9-402f-4f2e-b66d-305b908dbdb8&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;Who founded the Virgin Group? (Two words)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/57c88bb6-635d-42ec-a194-1f3ab3903225" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Virgin Australia is one of the two major commercial airlines operating in Australia.

It is the largest airline by fleet size (pre-COVID anyway!) to use the Virgin brand. It commenced services on 31 August 2000 as Virgin Blue, with two aircraft on a single route. The airline found itself in the fortunate position of becoming Australia's second major domestic airline following the collapse of Ansett Australia in September 2001&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/dc289c8f-ab76-4013-9afa-872188ca6ddc" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Perth Airport is not the world's largest transfer hub but it (in normal times) does handle approx 1.3 million passengers per month! That's a lot of passengers twiddling their thumbs with not much to do. So here is a small AdLab to pass 5 minutes or more.&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
   <groundspeak:logs>
  </groundspeak:logs>
   <groundspeak:travelbugs>
   </groundspeak:travelbugs>
</groundspeak:cache>
</wpt>
 <wpt lat="-31.935833" lon="115.970833">
