Mr Zuks has had paintings exhibited at the Louvre in Paris, the Venice Biennale and the London Olympics art exhibition.

In 2009 he won the People’s Choice award at Sculptures by the Sea. After wide public consultation, he created Byford’s sculptures of historical figures from ideas put forward by Byford residents.

The works were commissioned by the Byford Progress Association with support from the Shire of Serpentine Jarrahdale.&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
