  <sym>Geocache</sym>
  <type>Geocache|Lab Cache</type>
  <groundspeak:cache id="-831" available="True" archived="False" xmlns:groundspeak="http://www.groundspeak.com/cache/1/0/1">
   <groundspeak:name>[L] Discover Geraldton : S2 Water Well</groundspeak:name>
   <groundspeak:placed_by>Ian&amp;Sue - Team Pathfinder</groundspeak:placed_by>
   <groundspeak:owner id="">Ian&amp;Sue - Team Pathfinder</groundspeak:owner>
   <groundspeak:type>Lab Cache</groundspeak:type>
   <groundspeak:container>Virtual</groundspeak:container>
   <groundspeak:attributes>
   </groundspeak:attributes>
   <groundspeak:difficulty>1</groundspeak:difficulty>
   <groundspeak:terrain>1</groundspeak:terrain>
   <groundspeak:country>Australia</groundspeak:country>
   <groundspeak:state>Western Australia</groundspeak:state>
   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Discover Geraldton&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Water Well&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="background:#990000;color:#fff;border-radius:5px;padding:3px 5px;"&gt;linear&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/2125fac9-bf70-4b8b-b775-57a9f3010a23"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/2125fac9-bf70-4b8b-b775-57a9f3010a23&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;Name of the borefield Geraldton now draws it water from&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/0dc6d4ff-7de7-479b-87c4-f8f19c1172ee" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Once up a time there was a significant sand hill behind this site - Flagstaff Hill.  A water course running beneath it offered brackish but drinkable water.

The Old Police Well was dug to service the newly constructed Police Barracks, Lock-up and Stables which once stood on this site.  The buildings deteriorated and were demolished in 1935.  The well remains as the only standing reminder of this time.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/6da70222-27e7-491d-82ab-bb449c046563" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Discover Geraldton will take you on a short stroll / cycle around town sharing with you some of Geraldtons’ history which is often overlooked.

A short stroll - approximately 30 minutes.&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
   <groundspeak:logs>
  </groundspeak:logs>
