   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Discover Geraldton&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Customs House&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="background:#990000;color:#fff;border-radius:5px;padding:3px 5px;"&gt;linear&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/2125fac9-bf70-4b8b-b775-57a9f3010a23"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/2125fac9-bf70-4b8b-b775-57a9f3010a23&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;Number of bolts secure the information board to the paving&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/4bc5f7e2-9ac3-4194-983a-bbed311205de" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Customs House was the primary base for the Australian Navy’s operations in this regions during World War 2.  
Today the building is used as the office for the Australian Customs and Border Protection Service.  
&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/6da70222-27e7-491d-82ab-bb449c046563" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Discover Geraldton will take you on a short stroll / cycle around town sharing with you some of Geraldtons’ history which is often overlooked.

A short stroll - approximately 30 minutes.&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
