The Golden Pipeline Trail aims to use adventure labs to highlight some of the historic places and towns along the journey.

------

Old Doodlakine
The town sprung up due to the well sunk not far from here, it's demise came due to the running of the trainline.
Although today there are no buildings left at the original Doodlakine townsite there is still lots to see.&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
