   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Campus Caper&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Whozits and Whatsits Galore&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/c6b50eaf-377b-4463-86e1-8d540a96d6eb"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/c6b50eaf-377b-4463-86e1-8d540a96d6eb&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;What was the name of this facility in 1999 when it was Curtin University of Technology? (Answer format - 3 words - "_ _ _ " Facility)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/08910ace-5378-4137-b551-9cbf3555a138" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Possibly one of the best things about Curtin is the more you explore, the more you find. 

There are so many surprises hidden all over  the campus - the fun is in discovering all the hidden spaces, interactive pieces, historical artefacts and urban art... 

The best place to start then is Platform 9 and 3/4 and see what wizardry awaits you!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/3f1633b2-956e-4800-b926-07d872ff1164" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;There's more than meets the eye at Curtin University's Bentley campus. 

Curtin is the largest of Western Australia's universities. It's main campus at Bentley, situated on a former pine plantation, stretches over 116 hectares. 
  
Around campus you will find award winning architecture, hidden gardens, urban art and secret tidbitz at every turn - this adventure will take you to just a few favourites - be sure to explore a little more and see what treasures you uncover!

PLEASE NOTE WELL:
Parking is paid. There are 5 different colour coded zones. Rates and access vary. Please take note and park accordingly. Inspectors are are often swift and fines can be hefty. 

Consider arriving via an alternative method. Getting to Curtin is fairly easy, with good transperth bus connections and free local shuttles (from Waterford, Bentley, Vic Park and South Perth).&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
   <groundspeak:logs>
  </groundspeak:logs>
   <groundspeak:travelbugs>
   </groundspeak:travelbugs>
</groundspeak:cache>
</wpt>
