   <groundspeak:state>Western Australia</groundspeak:state>
   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Rockingham Mural Meander&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Rockingham - Be The Change You Want To See&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/81a5109e-b9bb-46eb-abd6-34c8a0e01059"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/81a5109e-b9bb-46eb-abd6-34c8a0e01059&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;The year five students involved for this design were from what school? (3 words)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/b83d2916-4c2a-4668-ab60-2118b56c7701" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;As part of the School Take pArt program local schools are invited to submit a design fitting the theme for the year.
The students whose designs are selected are invited to work with a local artist to create and install the final design.
This mural was part of the 20?? installations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/365aa659-cb71-49bb-a2cb-42af0a723e82" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Over the last few years the City of Rockingham has partnered with local and state based artists to create murals around the city.

This adventure will take you to some of these murals and talk about the stories of how they have been developed.&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
   <groundspeak:logs>
  </groundspeak:logs>
   <groundspeak:travelbugs>
   </groundspeak:travelbugs>
</groundspeak:cache>
</wpt>
