   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Murals of Mount Barker&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Magpie Flourish&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/e30528ba-ef5d-4d95-8618-ecf7a587acae"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/e30528ba-ef5d-4d95-8618-ecf7a587acae&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;On the lower left hand corner, was is the one word name above the four digits?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/f599a878-4631-445e-9a5d-38bf1d3cf828" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The thrill of dodging swooping magpies while racing down a hill on a wobbly billy cart is the youthful memory that inspired this light hearted mural in the heart of town.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/c99cdff7-04ff-4c99-8b0b-981410b6464b" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The locations of the murals have been placed to bring tourists into town by creating an exploration trail through the heart of town.
The murals were painted by visiting international artists during the 2019 Mountains and Murals Festival.
Remember to take note of your answers because you will need them to log a find on the bonus cache!
Enjoy your walk through town.&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
