   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Tomato Lake Walk Trail &lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Tomato Lake - A Sri Chinmoy Harmony&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/4d2d2149-79c1-455f-9e8b-7a72c1fa25b6"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/4d2d2149-79c1-455f-9e8b-7a72c1fa25b6&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;The complete circuit  loop around the lake is&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/e7e174a5-f126-4ccd-b13f-0d993d14b327" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This pathway around the lake has been dedicated as a Sri Chinmoy Harmony Run, symbolically linking Tomato lake with hundreds of sites around the world through Sri Chinmoy Peace-Blossoms programmes. The answer you seek can be found on the sign in front of you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/93a6c83f-60dc-401c-8fbe-8dda4ed5cf10" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Tomato Lake Walk Trail winds its way among shady trees around the perimeter of this peaceful urban oasis in Kewdale. The dual-use pathway provides a safe walk-friendly environment for people of all ages as well as an opportunity to be awed by the abundance of birdlife on and around the lake.

Enjoy a short walk around (half) the lake and marvel at the breeding colony of Australian White ibises as you cross the boardwalk bridge. 

There is a mystery bonus cache for those interested in such things.







&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
