   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;The Story of Yagan&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Yagan the Nyoongar Warrior&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="background:#990000;color:#fff;border-radius:5px;padding:3px 5px;"&gt;linear&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/775a8e5c-f81c-4941-8524-66b0d69e1509"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/775a8e5c-f81c-4941-8524-66b0d69e1509&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;What type of bird is this? ( black in colour)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/df8ae366-2857-41f7-b340-303c1f8d897f" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is the memorial walk was created to tell the story of Yagan to commemorate his life, death and spirit.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/a5ab75c8-83bd-4c13-bccb-2a752a4f2be4" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Welcome to the Yagan memorial.

“I would like to acknowledge the traditional owners the Whadjuk Noongars of the lands on which we meet today and the Elders, past and present. 
This is the story of Yagan known as a Noongar leader and resistance fighter.&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
