  <desc>GoldenPipelin10</desc>
  <url>https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/944ff8d0-ccde-4143-8931-2e6fa251610c</url>
  <urlname>Golden Pipeline Trail - Meckering : S2 Railway line by geotrakka</urlname>
  <sym>Geocache</sym>
  <type>Geocache|Lab Cache</type>
  <groundspeak:cache id="1476915755" available="True" archived="False" xmlns:groundspeak="http://www.groundspeak.com/cache/1/0/1">
   <groundspeak:name>Golden Pipeline Trail - Meckering : S2 Railway line</groundspeak:name>
   <groundspeak:placed_by>geotrakka</groundspeak:placed_by>
   <groundspeak:owner id="">geotrakka</groundspeak:owner>
   <groundspeak:type>Lab Cache</groundspeak:type>
   <groundspeak:container>Virtual</groundspeak:container>
   <groundspeak:attributes>
   </groundspeak:attributes>
   <groundspeak:difficulty>1</groundspeak:difficulty>
   <groundspeak:terrain>1</groundspeak:terrain>
   <groundspeak:country>Australia</groundspeak:country>
   <groundspeak:state>Western Australia</groundspeak:state>
   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Golden Pipeline Trail - Meckering&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Railway line&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/944ff8d0-ccde-4143-8931-2e6fa251610c"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/944ff8d0-ccde-4143-8931-2e6fa251610c&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;The tectonic plates clashed pushing a fault line longer than - how many km?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/2b3732aa-44ae-4147-b77b-c5898d7e4c3a" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The sheer force of the earthquake twisted and buckled the railway line connecting Perth to Kalgoorlie. Amazingly they cut the damaged pieces out and repaired them to reopen the railroad within 24 hours!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/2607e740-9581-4825-8507-65fe73ace4d1" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Golden Pipeline Heritage Trail follows the water pipeline conceived by C.Y.O'Connor to supply the Goldfields of Western Australia with much needed fresh water.
Meckering - a town along the way, benefited from the pipeline and still does today. Once a thriving country town, the devastation of an earthquake in 1968 flattened the town and it has never fully recovered.
This Adventure Lab will take you on a trip into the history of this little town.&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
   <groundspeak:logs>
  </groundspeak:logs>
   <groundspeak:travelbugs>
   </groundspeak:travelbugs>
</groundspeak:cache>
</wpt>
