   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Horseyard Hill Part 2 &lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Danger, danger&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/314ecaff-f545-40de-89c3-b6f9d81cb10f"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/314ecaff-f545-40de-89c3-b6f9d81cb10f&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;What is the name of this plant? 2 words &lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/d003e562-f661-4302-b2a5-338618efe9d1" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;All parts of this plant are poisonous however the 'nuts' from this plant have been successfully used as food by Indigenous Australians after proper processing; however, when eaten by European explorers they incurred poisoning.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/94926b8f-8b87-4bbf-ac53-c20bb16178e9" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Continue your walk around the trail and find the second part of this adventure. &lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
