   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Kings Park - Fraser Ave&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;South African Wars Memorial&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/5863f379-5bdb-42ee-b18b-906281c33058"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/5863f379-5bdb-42ee-b18b-906281c33058&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;There is a plaque at the rear of the monument - what are the underlined words (3 words)?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/f0233bef-2167-4e20-acaf-be860e636c4b" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;In 1899-1902 there were Officers from West Australain Contingents who were killed in action, died from wounds or diseases in South African Wars.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/e1fa713b-0775-4ace-ad00-6eff90846441" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Welcome to King Park, Fraser Ave has a few lesser known monuments and statues of WA’s history.
