 <wpt lat="-31.994017" lon="115.755983">
  <ele>39.0</ele>
  <time>2022-11-27T08:00:00Z</time>
  <name>LBJd43-05</name>
  <desc>MysteryOfTheSt5</desc>
  <url>https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/40b41820-3bbd-48f9-9811-6830a152bd2f</url>
  <urlname>The Mystery of the Stolen Painting : S5 War Memorial by ____akluger</urlname>
  <sym>Geocache</sym>
  <type>Geocache|Lab Cache</type>
  <groundspeak:cache id="-731" available="True" archived="False" xmlns:groundspeak="http://www.groundspeak.com/cache/1/0/1">
   <groundspeak:name>The Mystery of the Stolen Painting : S5 War Memorial</groundspeak:name>
   <groundspeak:placed_by>____akluger</groundspeak:placed_by>
   <groundspeak:owner id="">____akluger</groundspeak:owner>
   <groundspeak:type>Lab Cache</groundspeak:type>
   <groundspeak:container>Virtual</groundspeak:container>
   <groundspeak:attributes>
   </groundspeak:attributes>
   <groundspeak:difficulty>1</groundspeak:difficulty>
   <groundspeak:terrain>1</groundspeak:terrain>
   <groundspeak:country>Australia</groundspeak:country>
   <groundspeak:state>Western Australia</groundspeak:state>
   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;The Mystery of the Stolen Painting&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;War Memorial&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/40b41820-3bbd-48f9-9811-6830a152bd2f"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/40b41820-3bbd-48f9-9811-6830a152bd2f&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;The note says, "Sorry, I didn't have time. The odd one out is not guilty." You scratch your head, but then you look at the plaque and it's clear&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/464f933c-2a67-4082-a500-2887d47f864f" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Oh goodness... your witness isn't here! All you spot is a note, so you read it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/09cbec68-fe11-474d-b178-d59b8171b7c6" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Somebody has stolen the priceless painting "The Lady and the Geocache" by Geonardo DaVinci from the Akluger Art Gallery in the Cottesloe Civic Center! Police have identified six possible suspects. But now they need a witty and clever detective to find out who dunnit! That's where you come in. You have been asked by the police and the Akluger Art Gallery to ask witnesses and in this way discover the culprit.
These are the suspects:
Kevin Brown
Desiree McCabe
Richard Lesser
Lara Williams
Kira Orwell
