   <groundspeak:country>Australia</groundspeak:country>
   <groundspeak:state>Western Australia</groundspeak:state>
   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;The Mystery of the Stolen Painting&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Wishing Well&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/40b41820-3bbd-48f9-9811-6830a152bd2f"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/40b41820-3bbd-48f9-9811-6830a152bd2f&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;One of the suspects' first name (missing a letter) is part of the text that runs around the top of the well. That person is innocent.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/e1e7775a-979f-4638-af9c-6cc725ee9821" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;As you approach the wishing well, you notice a young lady in her twenties wearing a black dress, tights and high heels. That must be your next witness! She probably has a lot to tell you about the suspects.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/09cbec68-fe11-474d-b178-d59b8171b7c6" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Somebody has stolen the priceless painting "The Lady and the Geocache" by Geonardo DaVinci from the Akluger Art Gallery in the Cottesloe Civic Center! Police have identified six possible suspects. But now they need a witty and clever detective to find out who dunnit! That's where you come in. You have been asked by the police and the Akluger Art Gallery to ask witnesses and in this way discover the culprit.
These are the suspects:
Kevin Brown
Desiree McCabe
Richard Lesser
Lara Williams
Kira Orwell
Sam Bennet&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
   <groundspeak:logs>
  </groundspeak:logs>
   <groundspeak:travelbugs>
