   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;The Mystery of the Stolen Painting&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;The Chessboard Pavilion&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/40b41820-3bbd-48f9-9811-6830a152bd2f"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/40b41820-3bbd-48f9-9811-6830a152bd2f&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;The old man chuckles.The person he versed shares a name with the Mayor who unveiled the reconstruction of this pavilion.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/02a5eaa1-ad19-4717-9041-f6450acde1bd" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;A 64-year-old man is waiting at the pavilion for you. He says that he was playing chess here with one of the suspects at the time of the robbery.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/09cbec68-fe11-474d-b178-d59b8171b7c6" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Somebody has stolen the priceless painting "The Lady and the Geocache" by Geonardo DaVinci from the Akluger Art Gallery in the Cottesloe Civic Center! Police have identified six possible suspects. But now they need a witty and clever detective to find out who dunnit! That's where you come in. You have been asked by the police and the Akluger Art Gallery to ask witnesses and in this way discover the culprit.
These are the suspects:
Kevin Brown
Desiree McCabe
Richard Lesser
Lara Williams
Kira Orwell
Sam Bennet&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
