  <url>https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/2dccdb2d-049c-4432-a102-7f62954051ad</url>
  <urlname>OOH YEH’s BACKYARD : S1 Homestead park by OOH YEH</urlname>
  <sym>Geocache</sym>
  <type>Geocache|Lab Cache</type>
  <groundspeak:cache id="-747" available="True" archived="False" xmlns:groundspeak="http://www.groundspeak.com/cache/1/0/1">
   <groundspeak:name>OOH YEH’s BACKYARD : S1 Homestead park</groundspeak:name>
   <groundspeak:placed_by>OOH YEH</groundspeak:placed_by>
   <groundspeak:owner id="">OOH YEH</groundspeak:owner>
   <groundspeak:type>Lab Cache</groundspeak:type>
   <groundspeak:container>Virtual</groundspeak:container>
   <groundspeak:attributes>
   </groundspeak:attributes>
   <groundspeak:difficulty>1</groundspeak:difficulty>
   <groundspeak:terrain>1</groundspeak:terrain>
   <groundspeak:country>Australia</groundspeak:country>
   <groundspeak:state>Western Australia</groundspeak:state>
   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;OOH YEH’s BACKYARD&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Homestead park &lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/2dccdb2d-049c-4432-a102-7f62954051ad"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/2dccdb2d-049c-4432-a102-7f62954051ad&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;What is the 23rd letter &lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/9f9ca5eb-9bc0-4675-83ca-d3ffb1d60458" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Here is a great park to bring the kids and dogs . Our community hold many entertainment in this location . You can park your car and walk / bike the whole series from here . Sorry no toilets .You are looking for a sign to answer the question.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/d05409b3-25f7-42f4-bf9c-4316a779cc2e" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Welcome to our play ground . 
Here you will find many walk trails and parks .
Homestead ridge has a long history . The Wellard hospital was constructed in 1926 to service the settlement in the area . It was dismounted in 1930 and moved to Esperance. There is a plaque where the hospital stood on shipwright street. 
There are many native animals roaming in the parks and bush land . We have see kangaroo’s to bandicoots snakes and many different types of lizards so be careful. All the paths and trails are suitable for all ages .&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
   <groundspeak:logs>
  </groundspeak:logs>
   <groundspeak:travelbugs>
   </groundspeak:travelbugs>
</groundspeak:cache>
</wpt>
