   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Masons Landing Park&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Let nature feed itself&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/ffd6034a-ad02-46a3-ae76-5b0684e8b293"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/ffd6034a-ad02-46a3-ae76-5b0684e8b293&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;What is the Latin name for European Carp? (two words)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/4e3e818a-55d9-4592-b416-98c80ca99193" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Feeding the wildlife that you see living in and around the Canning River System is actually doing more harm than good.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/683085f4-1abc-49e6-b3ac-47888691d176" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Masons Landing Park is on the banks of the Canning River.
It is a great spot for a family fun day out as there is a playground, bbqs, toilets and a gazebo.
It is a perfect place to launch a canoe and explore the river.
Take a stroll around the park and learn about the local environment and history.

There is information on each journal page that will help you locate bonus cache GCA2KT0 when it is published.&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
