   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Run a muck in Muka!&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Barbalin Water Supply Pump and motor&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="background:#990000;color:#fff;border-radius:5px;padding:3px 5px;"&gt;linear&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/bb5134e3-b76c-4d8a-95f3-42a968d73c14"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/bb5134e3-b76c-4d8a-95f3-42a968d73c14&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;Horizontal Oil Engine ______   ____&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/abe347ee-ebe6-4fc8-9d18-e75cbee255ec" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The history of this pump and the restoration work, it is situated in the Main Street near the information centre. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/50f80758-536c-4460-99bd-c4815feb252f" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Mukinbudin is three and a half hours drive from Perth in the Wheatbelt region of Western Australia. The district is famous for its wheat and sheep farming. 
The town was gazetted in 1922 and has many interesting historical and natural features. Not too mention the hidden talent of many locals of which I plan to take you to see some of their work on this adventure. &lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
