  <urlname>[L] Coogee Community Garden : S1 A memorial to our gardening heritage by SirFancy</urlname>
  <sym>Geocache</sym>
  <type>Geocache|Lab Cache</type>
  <groundspeak:cache id="-821" available="True" archived="False" xmlns:groundspeak="http://www.groundspeak.com/cache/1/0/1">
   <groundspeak:name>[L] Coogee Community Garden : S1 A memorial to our gardening heritage</groundspeak:name>
   <groundspeak:placed_by>SirFancy</groundspeak:placed_by>
   <groundspeak:owner id="">SirFancy</groundspeak:owner>
   <groundspeak:type>Lab Cache</groundspeak:type>
   <groundspeak:container>Virtual</groundspeak:container>
   <groundspeak:attributes>
   </groundspeak:attributes>
   <groundspeak:difficulty>1</groundspeak:difficulty>
   <groundspeak:terrain>1</groundspeak:terrain>
   <groundspeak:country>Australia</groundspeak:country>
   <groundspeak:state>Western Australia</groundspeak:state>
   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Coogee Community Garden&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;A memorial to our gardening heritage&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="background:#990000;color:#fff;border-radius:5px;padding:3px 5px;"&gt;linear&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/80b6c2b4-9f3b-4c6f-ae7b-07fa2d63caec"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/80b6c2b4-9f3b-4c6f-ae7b-07fa2d63caec&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;Many bush tucker plants can still be found alongside thick what?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/0f6ce521-6fd6-456d-b55f-b546dcb17eb7" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;What did the grape say when it was crushed? Nothing, but it let out a little wine.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/1992c335-02f5-41c7-b94b-2580c957cb37" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Established in 2018, the Coogee Community Garden WA group aims to establish and maintain a community garden in Coogee which is accessible to public.

The garden will promote the art of organic gardening where possible and also have an area dedicated to the history of the indigenous bush tucker and local market gardener families.

How the game is played
all lab points will be avalible to unlock in one location, thats how you get your questions, 
your answers are on one of the five signs, your only hint is the Lab Spot's title.

good luck.

Bonus Cache is at: S 32° 6.???' E 115° 46.???'&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
   <groundspeak:logs>
  </groundspeak:logs>
   <groundspeak:travelbugs>
   </groundspeak:travelbugs>
</groundspeak:cache>
</wpt>
