   <groundspeak:difficulty>1</groundspeak:difficulty>
   <groundspeak:terrain>1</groundspeak:terrain>
   <groundspeak:country>Australia</groundspeak:country>
   <groundspeak:state>Western Australia</groundspeak:state>
   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Fiona Stanley 2&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;The bamboo flowers&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/9a6fc962-495b-4d16-9ec8-3642121f9a11"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/9a6fc962-495b-4d16-9ec8-3642121f9a11&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;The tall bamboo has men walking up the spiral. On the top is a 4 letter word. State the word.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/7996d9ae-5727-471b-8c20-c6b9de6ae116" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Another of the many artworks along this meandering section of garden. I’m not entirely sure what they are….let your imagination run wild. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/c55cbd18-ac91-409a-a63c-82303d4f90fc" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Take a stroll around part of the grounds of Fiona Stanley hospital.

Fiona is a remarkable woman who contributed immensely to the medical field.

On the ground floor of the hospital is a stunning portrait of Professor Stanley. 70 small canvases depicting some of her life surround the portrait. 

Wikipedia:
Fiona Juliet Stanley AC FAA FASSA (born 1 August 1946) is an Australian epidemiologist noted for her public health work, her research into child and maternal health as well as birth disorders such as cerebral palsy. Stanley is the patron of the Telethon Kids Institute and a distinguished professorial fellow in the School of Paediatrics and Child Health at the University of Western Australia. From 1990 to December 2011 she was the founding director of Telethon Kids.&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
   <groundspeak:logs>
  </groundspeak:logs>
   <groundspeak:travelbugs>
   </groundspeak:travelbugs>
</groundspeak:cache>
</wpt>
