   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Fiona Stanley 2&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Glass roof panels &lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/9a6fc962-495b-4d16-9ec8-3642121f9a11"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/9a6fc962-495b-4d16-9ec8-3642121f9a11&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;How many of the glass roof panels are patterned?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/1e36472d-5d65-4a06-9012-4564114813e1" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Along this section you’ll notice plenty of construction during 2023. Outside of one of the main interior garden areas is a concrete bench which seems to get rarely used. The roof shelter is glass panels.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/c55cbd18-ac91-409a-a63c-82303d4f90fc" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Take a stroll around part of the grounds of Fiona Stanley hospital.

Fiona is a remarkable woman who contributed immensely to the medical field.

On the ground floor of the hospital is a stunning portrait of Professor Stanley. 70 small canvases depicting some of her life surround the portrait. 

Wikipedia:
Fiona Juliet Stanley AC FAA FASSA (born 1 August 1946) is an Australian epidemiologist noted for her public health work, her research into child and maternal health as well as birth disorders such as cerebral palsy. Stanley is the patron of the Telethon Kids Institute and a distinguished professorial fellow in the School of Paediatrics and Child Health at the University of Western Australia. From 1990 to December 2011 she was the founding director of Telethon Kids.&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
   <groundspeak:logs>
  </groundspeak:logs>
   <groundspeak:travelbugs>
   </groundspeak:travelbugs>
</groundspeak:cache>
</wpt>
 <wpt lat="-32.07" lon="115.845117">
