Dogs on a leash are welcome but please pick up after them and take your rubbish away as there are no bins at picnic areas. There is a dog free run area in bush (“The Commonage”) on the eastern edge of Foxes Lair
You can enjoy many trails with a mountain bike, but please remember that you are sharing 
