   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Kaya Wandjoo Baldivis&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Djilba&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/7fd44f71-ab8d-4a31-829a-e04367f9f18c"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/7fd44f71-ab8d-4a31-829a-e04367f9f18c&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;How many flying animals on this pillar ? (digit)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/701b28a5-c04b-4547-8436-0b0fe0ea2e44" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;DJILBA AUGUST — SEPTEMBER
Season of Conception
During this season the wattles come into full bloom, along with lemon myrtle, and this signals the start of the mass blooming in the south-west. Large birds nest to hatch their eggs and popular foods include yongas (kangaroos) and weitj (emu).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/61181880-0c83-449e-9572-495e418d435e" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Welcome to the new Baldivis Sporting complex
The new home for the Baldivis Brumbies and White Knights.
This lab centres around the artwork here.
Titled “Karrikins Dirdong” the distinctive sculpture by artists Jason Hirst and Peter Farmer is both aesthetically pleasing and educational, depicting the six Nyoongar seasons within the design.

There a five stages, all at the same location so not much walking needed.

At the three stages Birak, Boonaroo and Kambarang you will need to keep the answers to find the bonus cache 
https://coord.info/GCA64DN&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
