  <url>https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/53e04450-da1b-4c04-9eea-30517fdce88a</url>
  <urlname>Narrogin Heritage Walk Trail (Part 3) : S3 Stop 13: Nurse Ness by cravo10</urlname>
  <sym>Geocache</sym>
  <type>Geocache|Lab Cache</type>
  <groundspeak:cache id="99012227" available="True" archived="False" xmlns:groundspeak="http://www.groundspeak.com/cache/1/0/1">
   <groundspeak:name>Narrogin Heritage Walk Trail (Part 3) : S3 Stop 13: Nurse Ness</groundspeak:name>
   <groundspeak:placed_by>cravo10</groundspeak:placed_by>
   <groundspeak:owner id="">cravo10</groundspeak:owner>
   <groundspeak:type>Lab Cache</groundspeak:type>
   <groundspeak:container>Virtual</groundspeak:container>
   <groundspeak:attributes>
   </groundspeak:attributes>
   <groundspeak:difficulty>1</groundspeak:difficulty>
   <groundspeak:terrain>1</groundspeak:terrain>
   <groundspeak:country></groundspeak:country>
   <groundspeak:state>Western Australia</groundspeak:state>
   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Narrogin Heritage Walk Trail (Part 3)&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Stop 13: Nurse Ness&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/53e04450-da1b-4c04-9eea-30517fdce88a"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/53e04450-da1b-4c04-9eea-30517fdce88a&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;The picture of Nurse Ness in the bottom right corner of the sign was taken in _____?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/2f34f549-9b05-4de1-9e6b-41ebc5999fa6" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The sign for this stage is located on the footpath adjacent to the road.

You will need to be within 20 metres of the location to unlock the geofence.

Answer the question by reading the plaque and obtaining the relevant information.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/ca2eddd8-71df-47a2-8316-b2a9d7fdfcc0" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Narrogin's Heritage Walk Trail is a fascinating and pleasant 1,250 metre circuit which includes many of the town's historic buildings. It offers a wealth of knowledge about the early settlers and events in the development of the town.

The trail route is designed in a clockwise direction and marked with black-on-silver triangles affixed to the footpath at regular intervals.

There are twenty-five silver information signs along the trail, which detail stories and history of the town.
&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
   <groundspeak:logs>
  </groundspeak:logs>
   <groundspeak:travelbugs>
   </groundspeak:travelbugs>
</groundspeak:cache>
</wpt>
