   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Running Around Herdies&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;The Start&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="background:#990000;color:#fff;border-radius:5px;padding:3px 5px;"&gt;linear&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/e445ea2f-aeb7-4eaf-a842-cf298c32c969"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/e445ea2f-aeb7-4eaf-a842-cf298c32c969&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;What is not allowed here?   _ _ _&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/9fa6a747-2e48-44d9-af78-ea4cb5584784" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Every hour on the hour the competitors assemble here ready to head out on another lap of the lake. Up to 300 participants will assemble here at 4:00pm on a Friday afternoon to see who will last the longest. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/2b7c2ed5-2006-40d2-932b-5c8bf3f02a94" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Every year an ultra-marathon takes place around Herdsmans Lake but it is an ultra marathon with a difference. There is no finish line, no required distance to run and all except 1 runner will fail to finish the event.
The run is a backyard ultra where the runners are required to run a 6.71km lap (referred to as a yard) every hour on the hour and they keep going until there is only 1 person left and that person can only run 1 more lap that the second last person. 
On the 21st June 2023 Philip Gore set a new world record in Queensland of 102 laps, that's running 6.71km every hour on the hour for 102 hours. The total distance covered in that time is 684km.

Collect the info for the bonus cache GCAA8W0&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
