   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Jurien walk trail&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Blueberry Tree&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/16b2ea94-4a50-4460-8379-be7b8550b2ab"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/16b2ea94-4a50-4460-8379-be7b8550b2ab&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;The flowers are white with purple dots inside a slightly ————— throat.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/0ed71827-1582-4010-941a-a78a2b98fcab" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;An information plaque for one of the native plants that you see whilst travelling along the path.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/19605aa4-3ecb-4f45-8682-423cca9679cc" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Jurien Bay has this amazing walk/cycle path that is over 12kms long.  There are some amazing ocean views and if you time it right great sunsets.&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
