   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Manjimup's Art Deco Heritage &lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Manjimup Agricultural Bank&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/94f5c389-7355-494d-9b2a-718e5dd6ff12"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/94f5c389-7355-494d-9b2a-718e5dd6ff12&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;What kind of business is currently using the building &lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/8d1eab7e-e73c-4296-81b4-9ae7ea9b1394" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Welcome to what was originally the Agricultural bank in Manjimup and also the Rural and Industry Bank for Manjimup and the surrounding area. The building is one of the many art deco buildings located around Manjimup and is still in use to this day.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/b784de0d-4837-4aa3-b0d1-b961eeb01640" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Manjimup has the highest concentration of Art Deco buildings in regional Western Australia.
The Art Deco buildings within the CBD are rich with architectural history and worth. The buildings form a collection that stands as the best remaining example of Art Deco structures in such concentration in Western Australia.&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
