   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Secret Playgrounds&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Lagoon with a playground.&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="background:#990000;color:#fff;border-radius:5px;padding:3px 5px;"&gt;linear&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/66c215ed-93eb-4ab5-b7db-92ce437fe2cf"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/66c215ed-93eb-4ab5-b7db-92ce437fe2cf&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;On the table, that sits by itself is an aluminum tag.  What is the six-digit number on this tag.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/e4339ada-c1cf-4f8e-b5db-4beeb7adcb3c" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is a great location, with a small playground, a BBQ, tables and chairs.  The view to the lagoon is great, as is the birds that can be seen preening and swimming on the water.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/1cbd6f64-4760-432f-bac9-e869c4ec8fb2" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;With the weather starting to improve, I thought I would create my first Adventure Lab and highlight some of the fantastic playgrounds and parks in my home suburb.  Take a look at the area and stop to enjoy some of the equipment, or even have a picnic or bbq at the nearby facilities.

You can get to all these locations on foot, but I would recommend wheels to get you arounds with greater ease.  Either bikes or cars will work.&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
