   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Secret Playgrounds&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Octopus Park Playground&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="background:#990000;color:#fff;border-radius:5px;padding:3px 5px;"&gt;linear&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/66c215ed-93eb-4ab5-b7db-92ce437fe2cf"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/66c215ed-93eb-4ab5-b7db-92ce437fe2cf&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;At this spot is a table.  On the leg of the table is an aluminum tab with a six-digit number.  &lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/fe0717d0-4f7c-4152-949a-a9388daa969f" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This Playground is a fully fenced, inclusive play space located on the Secret Harbour foreshore designed for all ages, all abilities and all levels of adventure.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/1cbd6f64-4760-432f-bac9-e869c4ec8fb2" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;With the weather starting to improve, I thought I would create my first Adventure Lab and highlight some of the fantastic playgrounds and parks in my home suburb.  Take a look at the area and stop to enjoy some of the equipment, or even have a picnic or bbq at the nearby facilities.

You can get to all these locations on foot, but I would recommend wheels to get you arounds with greater ease.  Either bikes or cars will work.&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
