   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Perth Invaders&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;PRT17 - Subiaco &lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/880d17e3-4880-481f-92a2-a4b1fd510091"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/880d17e3-4880-481f-92a2-a4b1fd510091&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;What restaurant is underneath the Invader?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/07ceebfc-376f-44e0-9efa-d352c7e5f5fa" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Subiaco. Home to the fancy and wannabe fancy.

Street art is everywhere. 

Thousands of people walk past this Invader and have no idea it is even there. 

If only they looked up. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/0d8aff3c-6013-4299-9141-34e0ba109c95" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;In 2001 a French street artist with the pseudonym, INVADER, began a street art project which spanned the world. Tiles with Space Invaders emblazoned on them, adorned city buildings and infrastructure from Eilat in Israel to Sao Paulo in Brazil. There is even one on the International Space Station! 

Included in the Invasion was the humble city of Perth, Western Australia. 

26 INVADER tiles found themselves installed across Perth, each with a points system attached to them. When installed you were given a rudimentary map to find them all and 400 points to collect. 

Sadly, only 6 tiles remain. And this is where your adventure begins. 

Travel Perth to discover the 5 remaining tiles and maybe find the Bonus 6th.&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
   <groundspeak:logs>
  </groundspeak:logs>
   <groundspeak:travelbugs>
   </groundspeak:travelbugs>
</groundspeak:cache>
</wpt>
 <wpt lat="-30.398983" lon="119.6302">
