   <groundspeak:country>Australia</groundspeak:country>
   <groundspeak:state>Western Australia</groundspeak:state>
   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Charles Riley Wander&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Hockey Club&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/f67c51e2-3901-46e8-b008-211340b5e52f"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/f67c51e2-3901-46e8-b008-211340b5e52f&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;In what year were the clubrooms named?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/b9f8f582-7c07-4b9a-b04a-1ba77a723611" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Look for the plaque to the right of the clubhouse door.

North Coast Raiders Hockey Club traces its heritage back to 1903. The club today was established in 1988 from an amalgamation of the Perth Hockey Club (founding hockey club of WA, 1903) and Scarborough Hockey Club (founded 1953).

The club boasts 9 men's and 9 women's teams alongside 17 junior teams and 7 masters teams.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/27df700e-0cc6-4076-bcd7-8df556ca7d0b" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;A short wander around the Charles Riley Memorial Reserve. The journal entries will also lead you to a bonus cache (GCAJW8T).

Covering 8ha of sporting fields and recreation space, the Charles Riley reserve includes an impressive array of facilities, including:

Multiple sports clubs
Cricket nets
Stirling Community Centre
North Beach War Memorial
North Beach RSL Sub-branch
Two community play areas
BBQs &amp; picnic shelters
Fenced dog park
North Beach Toy Library
Accessible paths and amenities&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
   <groundspeak:logs>
  </groundspeak:logs>
   <groundspeak:travelbugs>
   </groundspeak:travelbugs>
</groundspeak:cache>
</wpt>
 <wpt lat="-31.862833" lon="115.760133">
  <ele>10.0</ele>
  <time>2024-01-30T08:00:00Z</time>
  <name>LBwiHC-01</name>
