   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;An Excursion around Perth's Queens Gardens&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;The Music Centre&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/40268012-7f44-4352-96e2-ae97c70ea9c8"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/40268012-7f44-4352-96e2-ae97c70ea9c8&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;The noticeboard lists three bands currently using this building. What is the name of the third band listed? (two words)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/9ba2eadf-aadc-4a12-abe1-d7135e56dcd0" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Located in the northeast corner of the gardens is the Sir Charles Court Music Centre which hosts the Perth Concert Band and caters for music lovers of all ages and experience looking to play music and meet like-minded people. On the wall of the building is a noticeboard giving visitors to the gardens 
 useful info about the building. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/d7a1242f-8256-4530-8a9c-46853d484f20" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The beautifully manicured gardens and lakes of Perth's Queens Gardens can be found nestled among the sporting venues and office buildings of the East Perth precinct and provide a quiet and relaxed escape from the noise and bustle of the nearby city centre. 

You are invited to take a peaceful stroll around the gardens and locate the five stages of this Adventure Lab including one at Sir George Frampton's delightful replica statue of Peter Pan. Correct answers to the questions will enable access to the journal information necessary to solve the mystery bonus cache puzzle which uses five of the characters of the story of Peter Pan as clues.

From the city, you can take the free Red Cat bus and get off just a stone's throw from the entrance to  the gardens.&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
   <groundspeak:logs>
  </groundspeak:logs>
   <groundspeak:travelbugs>
   </groundspeak:travelbugs>
</groundspeak:cache>
</wpt>
