   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Augusta Amble&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Turner Street Jetty &lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/780515ab-6fd5-4222-84e5-1bac01822f3f"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/780515ab-6fd5-4222-84e5-1bac01822f3f&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;What 4 digit number can you see on jetty&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/c97d529c-ffa7-437f-a0d3-145f18017e63" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Little jetty and shallow lagoon, perfect for the littlest to play safely, canoeing, SUP, fishing and water plays. Café nearby, boat ramp, parking, not for towed vehicles.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/a4891f8e-a78b-41c0-b29e-b5c3a28f10fb" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Welcome to Augusta.

During our recent trip to Augusta we took some time to explore around the area.

We have chosen some spots that we enjoyed because of their location and history.

There is a bonus attached with the coordinates 
revealed by entering numerically the numbers in the journal (no spaces or commas) into the certitude checker.

Enjoy!&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
