   <groundspeak:country></groundspeak:country>
   <groundspeak:state>Western Australia</groundspeak:state>
   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Meet The Baby Animals&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Blaze&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/a68d2a9e-fa80-488c-b43c-5b37623e452a"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/a68d2a9e-fa80-488c-b43c-5b37623e452a&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;What must Blaze be on the lookout for?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/0b0eb87d-499e-453b-9031-e26d1e5bd402" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;A flouncy and springy Artic Fox
He hides in a snow den not  the rocks
An adorable face covered in white fluff
He loves to play but can be quite rough
&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/6a480da4-bbbf-4e3d-a091-f4b4c069694e" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Perth Zoo hosts many animals. For a fee you can see them, learn about them and even get hands on with some of the not-so-bitey ones.

In order to be big animal, you first need to be a small animal. 

21 baby animals figures are found around Perth. 14 within the zoo and 7 outside. 

'Jaylen' the baby Zebra and 'Arturo' the Brown Bear are near the entrance to the zoo.  
'Maya' the tiny Hippo is hidden at Elizabeth Quay and 'Joy' the cute Rock Wallaby is in Yagan Square.

This quest will have you finding the remaining 5 in Windsor Park. 

And for a bonus - there is also a Giant Gorilla at the zoo entrance. Why not take a picture with it!?

Visit perthzoo.wa.gov.au/wildaboutbabies for more information &lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
   <groundspeak:logs>
  </groundspeak:logs>
   <groundspeak:travelbugs>
   </groundspeak:travelbugs>
</groundspeak:cache>
</wpt>
