   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Meet The Baby Animals&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Stella&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/a68d2a9e-fa80-488c-b43c-5b37623e452a"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/a68d2a9e-fa80-488c-b43c-5b37623e452a&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;Name the Worst Predator?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/aedd3975-d575-4247-a787-8e8835d17d5c" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This super fast cat, likes to play
She will hide in the grass, hidden away
When the time is right, she will pounce
Ending her prey's, gleeful bounce. 
&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/6a480da4-bbbf-4e3d-a091-f4b4c069694e" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Perth Zoo hosts many animals. For a fee you can see them, learn about them and even get hands on with some of the not-so-bitey ones.

In order to be big animal, you first need to be a small animal. 

21 baby animals figures are found around Perth. 14 within the zoo and 7 outside. 

