   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Grape Expectations!&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Singlefile&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/b578cad5-90ae-429c-9a01-2eeca4e3ab15"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/b578cad5-90ae-429c-9a01-2eeca4e3ab15&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;At the plaque at the base of the tree, what is the two word name on the bottom line?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/a9f964c0-6403-4efa-86d6-f40f2d870508" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Singlefile is a family run vineyard, noted chiefly for their Chardonnay wines. Set in beautifully kept gardens, this is a favourite spot for picnics and visiting the cellar door.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/ee5bcc84-5279-48b4-a276-9785f561e118" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;A wine lovers paradise. This stunning region offers over 20 wineries, all within close proximity to each other and in stunning locations. Award winning wines of many varieties, some vineyards have restaurants, play areas for the kids, unique gift ideas, hampers for picnics and live entertainment. So get out and explore 'our paradise' and breathe in some of the freshest air on the planet!!&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
