   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Grape Expectations!&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Rockcliffe&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/b578cad5-90ae-429c-9a01-2eeca4e3ab15"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/b578cad5-90ae-429c-9a01-2eeca4e3ab15&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;What is the white tall thin structure in front garden near the fenceline to right hand side of entry (Two words)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/d01dc6ce-da1d-4ad9-91f9-1dda917fd0b4" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Just off the Scotsdale Road, Rockcliffe was established in 2007. Very popular with the locals due to regular live entertainment and their delicious pizzas and gelato. All about good vibes, great wine and treats.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/ee5bcc84-5279-48b4-a276-9785f561e118" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;A wine lovers paradise. This stunning region offers over 20 wineries, all within close proximity to each other and in stunning locations. Award winning wines of many varieties, some vineyards have restaurants, play areas for the kids, unique gift ideas, hampers for picnics and live entertainment. So get out and explore 'our paradise' and breathe in some of the freshest air on the planet!!&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
