   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Grape Expectations!&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Silverstream&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/b578cad5-90ae-429c-9a01-2eeca4e3ab15"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/b578cad5-90ae-429c-9a01-2eeca4e3ab15&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;What is the word on the second line of the large yellow sign on right hand side of the driveway.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/f6621444-49e5-44c3-8d46-85dc515c8696" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Silverstream Wines was established in 2004 on what was originally a cattle farm. The vineyard is situated on both sides of a valley allowing them to grow Reisling, Chardonnay on the north slope and Pinot Noir, Merlot and Cabernet Franc on the south facing slopes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/ee5bcc84-5279-48b4-a276-9785f561e118" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;A wine lovers paradise. This stunning region offers over 20 wineries, all within close proximity to each other and in stunning locations. Award winning wines of many varieties, some vineyards have restaurants, play areas for the kids, unique gift ideas, hampers for picnics and live entertainment. So get out and explore 'our paradise' and breathe in some of the freshest air on the planet!!&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
