   <groundspeak:country></groundspeak:country>
   <groundspeak:state>Western Australia</groundspeak:state>
   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Grape Expectations!&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Castelli&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/b578cad5-90ae-429c-9a01-2eeca4e3ab15"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/b578cad5-90ae-429c-9a01-2eeca4e3ab15&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;What flowers are planted in front of the building at the carpark?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/d5deaa6b-75f8-46d4-b7c8-7fbc3b1b1aa6" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Castelli is located on the picturesque Mount Shadforth Road and set on the side of a hill. The Tudor style architecture of the winery is a contrast to the state-of-the-art winemaking facilities within. Stunning views all around make this location a popular venue for concerts and gigs including 'Summer Salt'.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/ee5bcc84-5279-48b4-a276-9785f561e118" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;A wine lovers paradise. This stunning region offers over 20 wineries, all within close proximity to each other and in stunning locations. Award winning wines of many varieties, some vineyards have restaurants, play areas for the kids, unique gift ideas, hampers for picnics and live entertainment. So get out and explore 'our paradise' and breathe in some of the freshest air on the planet!!&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
