   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Lap of the lake&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Mitchell Freeway&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/58a964fe-b088-4d71-a644-b7f58f7b28d2"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/58a964fe-b088-4d71-a644-b7f58f7b28d2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;The stage was officially opened by the M.L.C, THE HON. D.J. _____________. Provide the surname.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/6e20aa13-4d51-474f-9f0f-d29212789474" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;At this location there is a number of information signs. Attached to the overpass is a silver plaque outlining the Mitchell Freeway Stage III.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/e7fb639e-44e2-4f4c-8c2c-f6ed5669c08c" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Lake Monger Reserve is a major Perth tourist and local community destination offering a mix of passive recreation areas, shared use paths, nature trails, shaded playgrounds, picnic and barbecue facilities and some sporting facilities for recreation use.

