   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Fremantle Hotels&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;His Majesty's Hotel&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/14be8ef5-980a-486f-9d2f-5298a641fbd8"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/14be8ef5-980a-486f-9d2f-5298a641fbd8&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;Look up and to the left and you will see a date indicating when this building was erected. What year is shown?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/c7142092-daed-4983-897b-be911e98f8e9" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This hotel was built between 1890 and 1904 on the site of the earlier pub, His Lordship's Larder. 
It was restored extensively in 1999 and now houses the NDUA School of Religious Education, School of Teaching and College of Education.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/b2366708-2100-41fe-afd3-ed6e32096f35" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This Adventure Lab will take you to some of the existing and former hotels dotted around Freo. 
Please note that parking fees may apply in some areas.&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
