   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Maple's Walk&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;UV INDEX&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/f34171cf-80f2-484a-afd5-71db4eb087de"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/f34171cf-80f2-484a-afd5-71db4eb087de&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;Name of artist? (2 words lower case no spaces)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/12aa33f2-8812-4b34-93e8-9b5a49a5b4aa" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The solar powered artwork features marine navigation channels markers and combines a nautical warning theme with the warning about UV radiation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/91040966-eae1-45e2-8532-35a4d323f68d" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is a quick five stage mosaic and sculpture Adventure lab cache around  Deep Water Point. 
Deep Water Point is a beautiful spot at the Canning River. The area is particular good for some  "Duck43 hunting" &lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
