Mosaic artwork by Danka Scholtz con Lorenz Completed 2006-2010&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/91040966-eae1-45e2-8532-35a4d323f68d" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is a quick five stage mosaic and sculpture Adventure lab cache around  Deep Water Point. 
