   <groundspeak:difficulty>1</groundspeak:difficulty>
   <groundspeak:terrain>1</groundspeak:terrain>
   <groundspeak:country>Australia</groundspeak:country>
   <groundspeak:state>Western Australia</groundspeak:state>
   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Golden Pipeline Trail - Southern Cross&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Up the hill we go.&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/de0eb636-943d-4a3a-bd8b-4aa0fb89afb2"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/de0eb636-943d-4a3a-bd8b-4aa0fb89afb2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;Old mate is carrying a Pick and a ????&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/b4ff9875-37cc-4ac6-b7ef-f933446bb001" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You just imagine the miner, making his way out to find his fortune,  tools in hand&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/0e893c86-4289-4328-9f32-db761d6db490" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Wimmera Hill is a great lookout above Southern Cross which offers views from the western side of the town.

The farming and mining equipment suspended from the monument depicts the town’s past and present history.

The monument was erected to the region’s pioneers in 1988 to celebrate Australia’s bicentenary as well as the centenary of settlement in Southern Cross. Each night the monument is lit up by an arrangement of lights in the form of the constellation “Southern Cross”.&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
   <groundspeak:logs>
  </groundspeak:logs>
   <groundspeak:travelbugs>
   </groundspeak:travelbugs>
</groundspeak:cache>
