   <groundspeak:difficulty>1</groundspeak:difficulty>
   <groundspeak:terrain>1</groundspeak:terrain>
   <groundspeak:country>Australia</groundspeak:country>
   <groundspeak:state>Western Australia</groundspeak:state>
   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Golden Pipeline Trail - Southern Cross&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;The Pipeline&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/de0eb636-943d-4a3a-bd8b-4aa0fb89afb2"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/de0eb636-943d-4a3a-bd8b-4aa0fb89afb2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;How many Bolts remain in the holes that attach the valve to the pipe (count both sides and use a digit answer)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/1074b243-a15a-462f-9328-368659ca4e1f" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Remnants remain of the early pipeline at the top. There are two valves on here. The left one is an isolating valve. To stop the flow. The one on the right is an air valve that allows air to escape or to enter the line.
You will need to focus on the larger Isolating valve&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/0e893c86-4289-4328-9f32-db761d6db490" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Wimmera Hill is a great lookout above Southern Cross which offers views from the western side of the town.

The farming and mining equipment suspended from the monument depicts the town’s past and present history.

The monument was erected to the region’s pioneers in 1988 to celebrate Australia’s bicentenary as well as the centenary of settlement in Southern Cross. Each night the monument is lit up by an arrangement of lights in the form of the constellation “Southern Cross”.&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
   <groundspeak:logs>
  </groundspeak:logs>
   <groundspeak:travelbugs>
   </groundspeak:travelbugs>
</groundspeak:cache>
</wpt>
