   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Lake Goollelal - Western Side&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Let's get started&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/c94d66a4-2fd8-41af-9a5f-f8e0782aeef6"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/c94d66a4-2fd8-41af-9a5f-f8e0782aeef6&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;How far to Woodlake Retreat (exactly as written on sign)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/9d473fbd-a96a-4097-be4b-4c830bfa5cd1" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Reasonable off road parking nearby here. It is often busy with dog walkers and people out for some exercise.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/712b541b-e31b-40d7-8dd0-87eeb8f53888" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Walk or cycle on the 4.5 kilometre path around Lake Goollelal and enjoy the richness and beauty of Perth metropolitan bushland in Yellagonga Regional Park. This Adventure Lab will help you enjoy the Eastern side of the Lake.&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
