   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Whaling Station&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Where are we?&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/7acfd639-9d5d-4fd2-beb1-23e97ae8b2f5"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/7acfd639-9d5d-4fd2-beb1-23e97ae8b2f5&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;What is the number on the sign? Include the AL&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/62326e3c-d150-45d7-9fed-7521ebaae71d" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Is nice to look at our beautiful coastline. But when things go wrong you need to know where you are!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/c4d684f2-86c5-453b-b85a-109d94297304" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Just a short little lab around the front of Albanys favourite tourist attraction The whaling station.&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
