   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;ANZAC Peace Park&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Western Australia’s Troops&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/d9a0eb8f-3ca4-4138-9ed6-e4690307ee51"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/d9a0eb8f-3ca4-4138-9ed6-e4690307ee51&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;How many WA men and women joined up?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/843eca03-f979-48b5-9e3c-228e3fb7824e" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The rush to enlist and the assembly of convoys at Albany gave an early indication that Western Australia would play a prominent role in Australia's war effort.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/823921f4-ea28-45c5-8096-e5273e70e687" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;A Bonus Box is available for this adventure lab - GCAZXB3

