   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;East Perth Gasworks&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Kids&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="background:#990000;color:#fff;border-radius:5px;padding:3px 5px;"&gt;linear&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/829f2b33-494b-4c2f-a164-fc04a0d3cba1"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/829f2b33-494b-4c2f-a164-fc04a0d3cba1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;What was the name of the street in the anecdote?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/1a054d40-64c0-4e96-bb15-9dbeb704a784" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This location features a totem pole detailing an anecdote from a gasworker.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/feec1c9c-746e-42fa-afe0-b8e8e46fcb32" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This lab will explore the history of Mardalup Park, formerly the East Perth Gasworks. After completing the lab, a bonus final cache can be accessed using the journal entries.&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
