   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;South side&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Track entry &lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/d5b59a5e-04dc-45e4-8d01-f23f0fcf72de"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/d5b59a5e-04dc-45e4-8d01-f23f0fcf72de&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;What 2 words describe the tracks provided to help minimise the spread of dieback?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/d2a89428-173f-4e96-b2cc-69bc45118134" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is one of many entrances into the park.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/1577fa57-9dde-4d05-96a9-37ca49a5a0d7" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Recommended parking at the listed coordinates. 

Welcome to the south side of Dianella Regional Open Space. Enjoy a gentle stroll along well formed limestone tracks. The walk is almost completely shaded making it generally quite pleasant. Although fencing makes it almost a guarantee, please stick to the formed paths to minimise further destruction from dieback.&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
   <groundspeak:logs>
  </groundspeak:logs>
   <groundspeak:travelbugs>
   </groundspeak:travelbugs>
</groundspeak:cache>
</wpt>
