   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Lock, lock and 2 rolling wheels&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Lock 5&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/ec55f594-4a0f-41ef-b6bf-0e6e01d734c9"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/ec55f594-4a0f-41ef-b6bf-0e6e01d734c9&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;On the gate is a lock.What is the 6 character code on the lock?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/fa064923-6779-440c-85c4-f29830e6af7d" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;A wander through the path.
Maybe explore the nearby bike track.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/33cc9aaa-b5ce-4756-8fa4-34685489b320" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Welcome to the Dianella Regional Open Space. It’s previously been home to plenty of caches. A great place for a walk. The purpose of this lab is to encourage a short walk and to showcase this fantastic facility. Stages have deliberately been kept simple.&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
