   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Diving into Dunsborough &lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Hannay Lane&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/9c2e9861-9fd2-4d0b-b964-a866c82d5779"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/9c2e9861-9fd2-4d0b-b964-a866c82d5779&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;A man made feature has sunk to the bottom of the ocean, what is the number on it?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/ad5c4330-d5bf-434d-bc6e-41700c9eeb30" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The talented artist has drawn inspiration from his upbringing surrounded by different landscapes, animals and cultures. 
The landscape around Dunsborough is featured here in this mural.
From the stunning rare spider orchids, to the beautiful birds, the incredible fauna, the amazing marine life, to the depths of the bottom of the ocean.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/cccc8088-294e-470c-b58e-db52c9030b45" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Diving into Dunsborough will show you some of the murals that have been painted around town to enhance the ‘arty vibe’ throughout this iconic holiday destination.
The murals have been painted by an Australian artist exploring beauty through nature, characters and details. He creates work on a variety of scales using acrylics, aerosol, and inks. Abstract brushstrokes and layered backgrounds are detailed with entertaining whimsical illustrations of characters, trees, birds, animals, colliding universes and patterns. &lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
