  <url>https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/c3944da0-f924-4a07-90be-5f9c71791833</url>
  <urlname>Heathcote Reserve  : S3 Gyinning Ellen Brook Building by cravo10</urlname>
  <sym>Geocache</sym>
  <type>Geocache|Lab Cache</type>
  <groundspeak:cache id="-834" available="True" archived="False" xmlns:groundspeak="http://www.groundspeak.com/cache/1/0/1">
   <groundspeak:name>Heathcote Reserve  : S3 Gyinning Ellen Brook Building</groundspeak:name>
   <groundspeak:placed_by>cravo10</groundspeak:placed_by>
   <groundspeak:owner id="">cravo10</groundspeak:owner>
   <groundspeak:type>Lab Cache</groundspeak:type>
   <groundspeak:container>Virtual</groundspeak:container>
   <groundspeak:attributes>
   </groundspeak:attributes>
   <groundspeak:difficulty>1</groundspeak:difficulty>
   <groundspeak:terrain>1</groundspeak:terrain>
   <groundspeak:country></groundspeak:country>
   <groundspeak:state>Western Australia</groundspeak:state>
   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Heathcote Reserve &lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Gyinning Ellen Brook Building &lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/c3944da0-f924-4a07-90be-5f9c71791833"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/c3944da0-f924-4a07-90be-5f9c71791833&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;The building s modern name, Gyinning, Is the Indigenous Noongar title for? &lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/d9806863-4515-4ca7-b400-5a9ff9d9b781" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Once known as Administration, this building was constructed for the Point Heathcote Reception Home in the late 1920s. It was flanked by the women's ward to the north, and the men's ward to the south. In 1954 plans were drawn to extend the administration building to include offices, waiting rooms, a surgery and a bedroom with ensuite. This required the removal of a chimney and other changes to the roof structure.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/3ca75baa-9bf7-4538-9d16-bc163f8db0a1" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Goolugatup Heathcote features a contemporary art gallery and art precinct, artist studios, workshop spaces and stunning venues for hire, as well as a world class restaurant, and one of the most popular award-winning children’s playgrounds in the metropolitan area.

It’s also the home to an old mental health hospital with all the right history and information to make up this Adventure Lab. 
&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
   <groundspeak:logs>
  </groundspeak:logs>
   <groundspeak:travelbugs>
   </groundspeak:travelbugs>
</groundspeak:cache>
</wpt>
