   <groundspeak:state>Western Australia</groundspeak:state>
   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;The Giants of Mandurah&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Billie Bob&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/9aef694f-ddaa-41a9-ba3d-63c354ad64ae"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/9aef694f-ddaa-41a9-ba3d-63c354ad64ae&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;What number giant is Billie Bob? (3 numerals)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/7652f693-1a62-4336-b7f2-8d72e83776b4" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;"Is this where the Giant story starts… or ends?"



Billie Bob got lost on the way to Mandurah and can be found in Subiaco.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/c081a55b-22ba-4087-9ca2-118b5451428e" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;First discussed in 2019 the Giants of Mandurah are art installations by Danish artist Thomas Dambo.
After a delay due to COVID the project was completed in 2022.

Initially the statues were to be in place for one year however due to the popularity with both local and international visitors the Giants were extended until the end of 2026.

The faces of the Giants were created in Dambo's workshop in Denmark and shipped to Western Australia with the bodies being completed with recycled local materials. Each of the 5 "public" Giants has a necklace or belt that includes a symbol that can be used to find the location of a 6th "hidden" Giant. Local schools were invited to assist the with the creation of some of these necklaces and students were able to meet and interact with Dambo during the making of these elements.

Hunters are able to download or collect a guidebook that gives more information about the artist, the giants and be able to answer questions while visiting the Giants.
Guide book can be collected near the starting pin for this lab however no locations for the lab are at this point.
&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
   <groundspeak:logs>
  </groundspeak:logs>
   <groundspeak:travelbugs>
   </groundspeak:travelbugs>
</groundspeak:cache>
</wpt>
