Yaburgurk Cirkelstone came to the Coodanup foreshore a few months after the other giants as unfortunately it's predecessor here was destroyed by fire.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/c081a55b-22ba-4087-9ca2-118b5451428e" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;First discussed in 2019 the Giants of Mandurah are art installations by Danish artist Thomas Dambo.
After a delay due to COVID the project was completed in 2022.

