   <groundspeak:country>Australia</groundspeak:country>
   <groundspeak:state>Western Australia</groundspeak:state>
   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;I Crossed The Nullarbor. &lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Cockebiddy Road House&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/362fb28b-826c-4ecd-a601-7f3357468c19"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/362fb28b-826c-4ecd-a601-7f3357468c19&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;To the left of the entrance, in the garden there is a creature looking at the outside patrons. What is it? (1 word)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/14fe5e01-b282-460e-9452-c0166892479e" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is another nice little stop.
We have a laugh at the population sign  every time we stop here at.

You will need to head toward the reception and Bar. If you go in is up to you but be warned you are being watched.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/7e4458f8-42e8-484d-8a59-2f5f96e6dfa7" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We enjoy each crossing either East or West and have also enjoyed the different AD Labs placed to break up the drive.
So we thought we would place one to help others enjoy this fantastic drive.
We see many people purchase "I Crossed the Nullarbor" stickers but here is your chance to get an "I crossed the Nullarbor" Post Card.
Each location we checked had at least 3 bars of Telstra service but not sure about other carriers.

We did use 2 points at roughly the same locations as the Nullarbor Links AL as we forgot there were 2 of them and only checked the WA side before creating this one. We have added a note to the completion page so no one forgets.
We hope you enjoy your visits to different popular stops.
&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
