   <groundspeak:state>Western Australia</groundspeak:state>
   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Quotation from Anzac's&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;25.04.1915&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/723f82f6-0f37-4af4-9f37-b3a3496d406c"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/723f82f6-0f37-4af4-9f37-b3a3496d406c&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;Whom was the quote from?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/b06626a9-9e72-4910-a9a9-9e51195b5b80" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;He pointed out that it would
be better for us to die fighting
on the ridge than to be
butchered like sheep on the
beach.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/6bdf135f-9261-41a1-8c1d-f96365ea26b9" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Take a walk up to the Desert Mounted Corps Memorial. Taking in some nice views and some quotes from letter sent home from the Anzac's.&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
   <groundspeak:logs>
  </groundspeak:logs>
   <groundspeak:travelbugs>
   </groundspeak:travelbugs>
</groundspeak:cache>
</wpt>
 <wpt lat="-35.025433" lon="117.89635">
  <ele>160.0</ele>
  <time>2025-02-02T08:00:00Z</time>
  <name>LBJ8Ma-02</name>
  <desc>ANZACMemorialS2</desc>
  <url>https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/f0c3fdb0-8900-4662-b70e-cb286e4b6e0c</url>
  <urlname>ANZAC Memorial : S2 'The fleet was gathered' by MummaBear5</urlname>
  <sym>Geocache</sym>
  <type>Geocache|Lab Cache</type>
  <groundspeak:cache id="1476918534" available="True" archived="False" xmlns:groundspeak="http://www.groundspeak.com/cache/1/0/1">
   <groundspeak:name>ANZAC Memorial : S2 'The fleet was gathered'</groundspeak:name>
   <groundspeak:placed_by>MummaBear5</groundspeak:placed_by>
   <groundspeak:owner id="">MummaBear5</groundspeak:owner>
   <groundspeak:type>Lab Cache</groundspeak:type>
   <groundspeak:container>Virtual</groundspeak:container>
   <groundspeak:attributes>
   </groundspeak:attributes>
   <groundspeak:difficulty>1</groundspeak:difficulty>
   <groundspeak:terrain>1</groundspeak:terrain>
   <groundspeak:country>Australia</groundspeak:country>
   <groundspeak:state>Western Australia</groundspeak:state>
   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;ANZAC Memorial&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;'The fleet was gathered'&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/f0c3fdb0-8900-4662-b70e-cb286e4b6e0c"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/f0c3fdb0-8900-4662-b70e-cb286e4b6e0c&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;Who is the author of this piece?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/f114f910-c548-4ed2-896e-a988ba488e2c" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The ships arrived at Albany in ones and twos and threes, till at
last the fleet was gathered. There they swung at anchor for five
clear days while water and coal were taken in by the vessels that
required them
Each day there was a report that we were about to sail on the
following day, but day after day passed, and no move was made
by any of the ships.
At last on Saturday, October 31, word passed round in the mysterious
way in which word does pass round at sea that the transports would
leave next morning.
All hands turned in with serene hope that this at last was the real signal to move.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/0198e668-c06c-497d-ab67-220af0f041fe" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Enjoy an informative walk at the ANZAC Memorial, the site of the first Dawn Service.&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
   <groundspeak:logs>
  </groundspeak:logs>
   <groundspeak:travelbugs>
   </groundspeak:travelbugs>
</groundspeak:cache>
</wpt>
