   <groundspeak:state>Western Australia</groundspeak:state>
   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Star Swamp Heritage Trail&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Site 8: Remnant By-Way &lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/897fd310-db34-4a5d-b2d3-c9bc18418f78"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/897fd310-db34-4a5d-b2d3-c9bc18418f78&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;In what direction did this track run?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/6ff3157c-5276-4ad9-bcea-af54ca65d728" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This section of the Heritage Trail is all that remains of a major track that ran through this bushland.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/47bb10d8-7327-409e-83ad-192611d95825" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Star Swamp Bushland Reserve provides countless opportunities for birdwatching, spotting native wildflowers and orchids, chance encounters with Quenda and Rainbow Bee Eaters, and photography, all situated in the middle of suburbia.

It has been the site of many bushfires. The most recent occurred on 21 March 2023 and burnt approximately 6.5 hectares of the 96 hectare reserve. The fire was believed to be deliberately lit.

This Adventure Lab has been prepared with children in mind, it encourages bushwalking, highlights conservation and offers an opportunity to learn some local history.&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
