The area is often used by the community for sporting activities, playgrounds, food markets and even the odd concert.
It's a regular hang out for the local kids to exert some energy.

Remember to take note of your answers to assist with the Bonus Cache&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/6eda61e1-446d-4714-aa48-63cddc7e93d1" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;I C Nothing kids love nothing more than jumping on their bikes to explore and play at the local playgrounds. This is their lab to provide you a tour around their local hang out spots.&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
