   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;WAQuokka AdLab Art #001&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Quokka facts 4&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/53450e84-8aa1-4283-a32c-961e253fa42c"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/53450e84-8aa1-4283-a32c-961e253fa42c&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;Quokka selfies are fun to take. Which of these famous people is not well known for a Quokka Selfie?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/e0041ccb-9591-474d-8489-980dd818aecb" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Welcome to the WAQuokka AdLab art - Please join in by contacting WAQuokkaAdLab@gmail.com &lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/d944e45d-11a0-4e99-b9b5-0cd5a4f8522d" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Welcome to the WAQuokka AdLab art series - which intends to form a giant quokka off the coast of Perth. There is a 500m geofence on stages which allows you to solve all the AdLabs from the docks from the Fremantle Maritime Museum and the Rottnest Ferry Terminal. 
To join this project, please contact the project Admins on WAQuokkaAdLab@gmail.com&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
