   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;WAQuokka AdLab Art #016&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Bunker Bay&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/459e1a0c-90ec-4bdd-9c44-794b98a674b9"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/459e1a0c-90ec-4bdd-9c44-794b98a674b9&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;Where is this beautiful beach located?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/f2928314-dc3a-4500-8b8e-fa228cd2271d" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Another beautiful bay with white powdery soft sand, clear aqua blue water and a little further down submerged rocks that make a great snorkel spot. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/7bc2299a-0e5f-4115-bfb3-5da757968c47" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Welcome to the WAQuokka AdLab art series - which intends to form a giant quokka
off the coast of Perth. There is a 500m geofence on stages which allows the AdLabs
to be solved from between the Fremantle Maritime Museum and the Rottnest Ferry
Terminal.

This Adventure Lab is themed on the beautiful beaches of WA&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
