   <groundspeak:difficulty>1</groundspeak:difficulty>
   <groundspeak:terrain>1</groundspeak:terrain>
   <groundspeak:country></groundspeak:country>
   <groundspeak:state>Western Australia</groundspeak:state>
   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;WAQuokka AdLab Art #073&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Florida, USA&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/47501866-f346-4767-aae1-f63cc101d2d5"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/47501866-f346-4767-aae1-f63cc101d2d5&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;What is the most magical place on Earth called here in Florida? &lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/48e8778c-8049-44a8-bd1c-b879f5668b22" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Florida boasts numerous unique characteristics. It's known as the "Sunshine State" due to its warm climate and abundant sunshine. It's also the flattest state in the US, with its highest point being significantly lower than many of Miami's skyscrapers. Additionally, Florida is a peninsula, almost entirely surrounded by water

Nickname: Sunshine State 
Motto: In God We Trust 
Anthem: "Florida" (state anthem), "Old Folks at Home" (state song) &lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/e791f5ae-326e-4057-b010-24a34f98f646" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Welcome to the WAQuokka AdLab art series - which intends to form a giant quokka off the coast of Perth. There is a 500m geofence on stages which allows the AdLabs to be solved from between the Fremantle Maritime Museum and the Rottnest Ferry Terminal.

To join this project, please contact the project Admins on WAQuokkaAdLab@gmail.com
&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
   <groundspeak:logs>
  </groundspeak:logs>
   <groundspeak:travelbugs>
   </groundspeak:travelbugs>
</groundspeak:cache>
</wpt>
 <wpt lat="-32.052483" lon="115.74085">
