   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;WAQuokka AdLab Art #077&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Lets all have pun time 2&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/2f614776-caaf-4cf8-9601-35d46a4b16d9"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/2f614776-caaf-4cf8-9601-35d46a4b16d9&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;What cant jump&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/fbd93121-2b16-4944-953a-cce8ff55426e" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;What do you call an alligator in a vest? An investigator.

Did you know deer can jump higher than the average house? It’s because of their strong hind legs and the fact that the average house can’t jump.

What did one eye say to the other? Just between you and me, something smells.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/e7ef68b0-63bf-48e4-81d3-e6395f142be5" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Welcome to the WAQuokka AdLab art series - which intends to form a giant quokka off the coast of Perth. There is a 500m geofence on stages which allows the AdLabs to be solved from between the Fremantle Maritime Museum and the Rottnest Ferry Terminal.

To join this project, please contact the project Admins on WAQuokkaAdLab@gmail.com

&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
