   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;WAQuokka AdLab Art #073&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Kansas, USA&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/47501866-f346-4767-aae1-f63cc101d2d5"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/47501866-f346-4767-aae1-f63cc101d2d5&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;What is the famous classic children's movie called?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/62377065-0e1e-4ee8-9632-d3523f5fabee" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Kansas is best known for its agriculture, particularly wheat production, and is often referred to as the "Breadbasket of America".  Additionally, Kansas has a rich history as a cattle and railroad state. 

Nickname: The Sunflower State 
The Wheat State; America's Heartland
Motto: To the stars through difficulties
Anthem: "Home on the Range"&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/e791f5ae-326e-4057-b010-24a34f98f646" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Welcome to the WAQuokka AdLab art series - which intends to form a giant quokka off the coast of Perth. There is a 500m geofence on stages which allows the AdLabs to be solved from between the Fremantle Maritime Museum and the Rottnest Ferry Terminal.

