   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;WAQuokka AdLab Art #077&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt; Lets all have pun time 3&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/2f614776-caaf-4cf8-9601-35d46a4b16d9"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/2f614776-caaf-4cf8-9601-35d46a4b16d9&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;What is a Photon?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/7d6ab554-54e7-447a-be87-ec51df6d291e" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;What do you say to a Llama that loves picnicking? Alpaca lunch.

A photon checks into a hotel. The front desk asks if it has any luggage. It replies “no, I’m traveling light”

I can’t stand Russian dolls. They’re so full of themselves.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/e7ef68b0-63bf-48e4-81d3-e6395f142be5" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Welcome to the WAQuokka AdLab art series - which intends to form a giant quokka off the coast of Perth. There is a 500m geofence on stages which allows the AdLabs to be solved from between the Fremantle Maritime Museum and the Rottnest Ferry Terminal.

To join this project, please contact the project Admins on WAQuokkaAdLab@gmail.com

&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
