   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;WAQuokka AdLab Art #077&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Lets all have pun time 4&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/2f614776-caaf-4cf8-9601-35d46a4b16d9"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/2f614776-caaf-4cf8-9601-35d46a4b16d9&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;What Store was mentioned.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/b4d494fb-48aa-48f4-8dc0-a024cd3778b7" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Did you hear about the glass blower who accidentally inhaled? He got stomach pane.

What do you call a snail that isn’t moving? An escar-stay.

If you see an Apple Store get robbed, does that make you an iWitness?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/e7ef68b0-63bf-48e4-81d3-e6395f142be5" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Welcome to the WAQuokka AdLab art series - which intends to form a giant quokka off the coast of Perth. There is a 500m geofence on stages which allows the AdLabs to be solved from between the Fremantle Maritime Museum and the Rottnest Ferry Terminal.

To join this project, please contact the project Admins on WAQuokkaAdLab@gmail.com

&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
