  <url>https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/72e39781-a3bb-49bc-b272-4dbf47dc75a4</url>
  <urlname>WAQuokka AdLab Art #068 : S3 WA's Most Influential Musicians #8 - Eskimo Joe by Deefa71</urlname>
  <sym>Geocache</sym>
  <type>Geocache|Lab Cache</type>
  <groundspeak:cache id="-1400" available="True" archived="False" xmlns:groundspeak="http://www.groundspeak.com/cache/1/0/1">
   <groundspeak:name>WAQuokka AdLab Art #068 : S3 WA's Most Influential Musicians #8 - Eskimo Joe</groundspeak:name>
   <groundspeak:placed_by>Deefa71</groundspeak:placed_by>
   <groundspeak:owner id="">Deefa71</groundspeak:owner>
   <groundspeak:type>Lab Cache</groundspeak:type>
   <groundspeak:container>Virtual</groundspeak:container>
   <groundspeak:attributes>
   </groundspeak:attributes>
   <groundspeak:difficulty>1</groundspeak:difficulty>
   <groundspeak:terrain>1</groundspeak:terrain>
   <groundspeak:country></groundspeak:country>
   <groundspeak:state>Western Australia</groundspeak:state>
   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;WAQuokka AdLab Art #068&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;WA's Most Influential Musicians #8 - Eskimo Joe&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/72e39781-a3bb-49bc-b272-4dbf47dc75a4"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/72e39781-a3bb-49bc-b272-4dbf47dc75a4&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;Which notorious religious sect was the family of Eskimo Joe's lead singer Kavyen Temperley part of? &lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/b9433797-a976-42e8-975a-58eab486e23b" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Eskimo Joe:

Eskimo Joe are an Australian alternative rock band that was formed in 1997 by Stuart MacLeod, on lead guitar, Joel Quartermain, on drums and guitar, and Kavyen Temperley, on bass guitar and vocals, in East Fremantle. In addition to the release of six albums, Eskimo Joe have won eight ARIA Music Awards; in 2006, the band achieved four wins—from nine nominations—for work associated with Black Fingernails, Red Wine.
&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/7feaac35-913b-4fa1-877a-206244e75af7" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Welcome to the WAQuokka AdLab art series - which intends to form a giant quokka off the coast of Perth. There is a 500m geofence on stages which allows the AdLabs to be solved from between the Fremantle Maritime Museum and the Rottnest Ferry Terminal.

To join this project, please contact the project Admins on WAQuokkaAdLab@gmail.com
&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
   <groundspeak:logs>
  </groundspeak:logs>
   <groundspeak:travelbugs>
   </groundspeak:travelbugs>
</groundspeak:cache>
</wpt>
 <wpt lat="-32.0522" lon="115.74065">
  <ele>2.0</ele>
