   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;WAQuokka AdLab Art #078&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;QUIZ ABOUT W.A. #01&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/55e8060c-7fea-49d8-9dc2-e7372824b0dd"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/55e8060c-7fea-49d8-9dc2-e7372824b0dd&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;During World War 1, which nation had the highest casualty rate per 1000 men enlisted?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/1b2558b3-69cc-4bad-88ee-8d8f0104b20a" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;How much do you know about Western Australia? 

This quiz will test your knowledge and some of the answers may surprise you.
&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/883fb095-0e71-4d8e-8991-b7c3eee9deb4" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Welcome to the WAQuokka AdLab art series - which intends to form a giant quokka
off the coast of Perth. 

There is a 500m geofence on stages which allows the AdLabs
to be solved from between the Fremantle Maritime Museum and the Rottnest Ferry
Terminal.

To join this project, please contact the project Admins on
