   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;WAQuokka AdLab Art #079&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;QUIZ ABOUT W.A. #09&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/5ab61b05-422c-490c-98a0-bd08756ebe44"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/5ab61b05-422c-490c-98a0-bd08756ebe44&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;The only colony of white swans in W.A. can be found in:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/eab3b97b-7b22-4eef-a4d5-178b2183d40e" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;How much do you know about Western Australia? 

