   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;WAQuokka AdLab Art #029&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Eagle's Norms 2018?&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/533880f3-5f93-44cc-9f10-22e85f352d73"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/533880f3-5f93-44cc-9f10-22e85f352d73&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;Who won the Norm Smith medal in 2018?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/4292d033-4986-4950-a7c9-7b70286b8974" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;In arguably one of the best Grand Finals to be played, the Eagles triumphed over Collingwood by 5 points.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/47a9745e-9250-4977-aab5-031a907a3a01" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Welcome to the WAQuokka AdLab art series - which intends to form a giant quokka off the coast of Perth. There is a 500m geofence on stages which allows the AdLabs to be solved from between the Fremantle Maritime Museum and the Rottnest Ferry Terminal. To join this project, please contact the project Admins on WAQuokkaAdLab@gmail.com.

This Adventure Lab is all about West Coast Eagles FC's Norm Smith Medallists.&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
