   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;WAQuokka AdLab Art #055 - Pommie Adventures in Aus&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Cheers!&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/d813470f-d2b7-4ff9-9482-f41e6cf236e4"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/d813470f-d2b7-4ff9-9482-f41e6cf236e4&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;This sculpture is in a local park, a short drive from the town centre but where is it?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/75db46af-1beb-44f7-8be0-553aa2db76d3" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The dog is mans best friend!
Joined up with the Aussie crew here, stayed a couple of days in a rented house and walked all over the area. 
The alcohol here is wonderful, why not sample a glass - if you aren't driving!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/e9a25770-161f-49fc-81aa-998143705f25" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Welcome to the WAQuokka AdLab art series - which intends to form a giant quokka off the coast of Perth. There is a 500m geofence on stages which allows the AdLabs to be solved from between the Fremantle Maritime Museum and the Rottnest Ferry Terminal.

Hi all, my daughter &amp; family emigrated to WA Australia many years ago and we have been visiting regularly to see our grandaughters growing up.
This AdLab covers some places we have visited, well known landmarks and features in Western Australia. &lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
