   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;WAQuokka AdLab Art #056&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;WA Science Hall of Fame &lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/c6690439-3add-44b0-9671-2ee4ddfb87ed"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/c6690439-3add-44b0-9671-2ee4ddfb87ed&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;What year was Professor Fiona Wood AO FAHMS inducted into the Hall of Fame?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/a3b0eda8-e90e-4ef7-ab71-79750bdecd96" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Winthrop Professor Fiona Wood AO FAHMS has established herself as a pioneer and world-leading burns specialist and researcher, with a career marked by significant advancements in medical science. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/d54eb30e-8c28-47f9-8fdd-df7f841ab9ea" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Welcome to the WAQuokka AdLab art series - which intends to form a giant quokka off the coast of Perth. There is a 500m geofence on stages which allows the AdLabs to be solved from between the Fremantle Maritime Museum and the Rottnest Ferry Terminal.

To join this project, please contact the project Admins on WAQuokkaAdLab@gmail.com
&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
