   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;WAQuokka AdLab Art #056&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;WA Science Hall of Fame &lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/c6690439-3add-44b0-9671-2ee4ddfb87ed"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/c6690439-3add-44b0-9671-2ee4ddfb87ed&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;What year was Professor Fiona Stanley AC inducted into the Hall of Fame&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/53e3acce-902a-4f7d-b791-08ec165d92f6" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Professor Fiona Stanley is known for her work on Cerebral Palsy and children's health. She is an advocate for the needs of children and their families and promotes the importance of using population data to provide significant health, social and economic benefits to the community. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/d54eb30e-8c28-47f9-8fdd-df7f841ab9ea" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Welcome to the WAQuokka AdLab art series - which intends to form a giant quokka off the coast of Perth. There is a 500m geofence on stages which allows the AdLabs to be solved from between the Fremantle Maritime Museum and the Rottnest Ferry Terminal.

To join this project, please contact the project Admins on WAQuokkaAdLab@gmail.com
&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
   <groundspeak:logs>
  </groundspeak:logs>
   <groundspeak:travelbugs>
   </groundspeak:travelbugs>
</groundspeak:cache>
</wpt>
