   <groundspeak:difficulty>1</groundspeak:difficulty>
   <groundspeak:terrain>1</groundspeak:terrain>
   <groundspeak:country></groundspeak:country>
   <groundspeak:state>Western Australia</groundspeak:state>
   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;WAQuokka AdLab Art #099&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;BIG CROC - Wyndham WA&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/2ba2f8e7-331c-4fab-b57e-ed76f222efd0"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/2ba2f8e7-331c-4fab-b57e-ed76f222efd0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;What is the Length of the Big Crocodile?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/a3478b4a-4dfe-46af-b6d8-e0fcb0581fd2" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;As you drive into this historic port town, the welcoming smile of the statue is hard to miss from the roadside. 

The statue was crafted using a photograph of a crocodile and advanced computer technology to map its shape. It was constructed with the assistance of students from Halls Creek Technology of Advanced Further Education (TAFE). While its size is somewhat exaggerated, it serves as a strong reminder to avoid swimming in the crocodile-infested waters surrounding Wyndham.

Wyndham, founded during the Halls Creek gold rush in 1885, is located an hour’s drive from Kununurra&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/e44a9fc8-cf07-4dcc-a66c-beee2a460849" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Welcome to the WAQuokka AdLab art series - which intends to form a giant quokka
off the coast of Perth. There is a 500m geofence on stages which allows the AdLabs
to be solved from between the Fremantle Maritime Museum and the Rottnest Ferry
Terminal.

To join this project, please contact the project Admins on
WAQuokkaAdLab@gmail.com

This adventure is about Notable WA "Big Things&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
   <groundspeak:logs>
  </groundspeak:logs>
   <groundspeak:travelbugs>
   </groundspeak:travelbugs>
</groundspeak:cache>
</wpt>
