   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;WAQuokka AdLab Art #096&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Fremantle Dockers - 2025 Captain&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/2d4e616f-4c5f-45cc-ac60-92f899a9e8c9"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/2d4e616f-4c5f-45cc-ac60-92f899a9e8c9&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;The captain of the Fremantle Dockers in 2025 is&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/e6f6dbe9-5262-4d90-82bb-39a7154c4079" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The captain is known for their toughness and leadership. Our 2025 captain is a powerful defender and is known for his contested work and relentless effort.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/8a0f0e76-ecb5-404e-a992-d914e80f0ceb" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Welcome to the WAQuokka AdLab art series - which intends to form a giant quokka
