   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;WAQuokka AdLab Art #096&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Fremantle Dockers - When did they join the AFL?&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/2d4e616f-4c5f-45cc-ac60-92f899a9e8c9"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/2d4e616f-4c5f-45cc-ac60-92f899a9e8c9&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;What date did Fremantle Dockers join the AFL?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/c5ecce29-4b36-4c89-a695-ebb63b7002ed" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The AFL started in 1990 when the Victorian Football League (VFL) officially changed its name to the Australian Football League (AFL) to reflect its expansion beyond Victoria into a national competition.
