   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;WAQuokka AdLab Art #034&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Daisy Quokka: World's Scariest Animal (2020)&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/57ff6467-e14b-43b9-a6c9-ded0e76c9242"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/57ff6467-e14b-43b9-a6c9-ded0e76c9242&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;Not much to say about this film, but hey it has a Quokka in it! Q: Do you know how long a Quokka gestation period is?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/69991903-7e51-425a-ae61-5dc34f4cda74" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Australian (?) films and their animal stars&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/2b51b7eb-bcbf-463c-85de-cba79a303a1d" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Welcome to the WAQuokka AdLab art series - which intends to form a giant quokka off the coast of Perth. There is a 500m geofence on stages which allows the AdLabs to be solved from between the Fremantle Maritime Museum and the Rottnest Ferry Terminal.


