   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;WAQuokka AdLab Art #034&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Babe (1995)&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/57ff6467-e14b-43b9-a6c9-ded0e76c9242"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/57ff6467-e14b-43b9-a6c9-ded0e76c9242&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;Because baby pigs grow so fast, how many pigs do you think were used during filming for the role of Babe.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/28ece5ac-c14f-4b7a-9270-667cead6b263" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Australian films and their animal stars.
