   <groundspeak:state>Western Australia</groundspeak:state>
   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;WAQuokka AdLab Art #083&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;The Lodge Wadjemup&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/b896d6c6-667f-437d-b378-ddc1741548f0"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/b896d6c6-667f-437d-b378-ddc1741548f0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;This location is set to reopen when? &lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/e1bd04da-c57e-4317-b3fb-4182a40668d8" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Whether you’re travelling solo, as a couple, or with family and friends, you can choose from a range of rooms designed to suit every need for a space that feels like home. Surrounded by native landscaping, the property provides a peaceful and natural environment to enjoy, allowing you to immerse yourself in the island's natural rhythm.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/9aea0e2a-2083-401f-84db-789209a2559e" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Staying at Rottnest Island can be a chance to reconnect with nature, have a moment of indulgence, or embark on an invigorating adventure. And, it might be all of this.
Rottnest Island has accommodation options for every kind of person who ventures to the island! &lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
   <groundspeak:logs>
  </groundspeak:logs>
