   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;WAQuokka AdLab Art #083&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Samphire Rottnest&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/b896d6c6-667f-437d-b378-ddc1741548f0"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/b896d6c6-667f-437d-b378-ddc1741548f0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;How many rooms are available here &lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/edd9c553-0c83-48bc-b788-8084961c18e6" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Rooms available at Samphire Rottnest have been thoughtfully designed to complement the natural surroundings. Experience understated modern surrounds from the comforts of your room and marvel at the island from your own private balcony or deck.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/9aea0e2a-2083-401f-84db-789209a2559e" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Staying at Rottnest Island can be a chance to reconnect with nature, have a moment of indulgence, or embark on an invigorating adventure. And, it might be all of this.
Rottnest Island has accommodation options for every kind of person who ventures to the island! &lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
