   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;WAQuokka AdLab Art #107&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Perth's Tall Buildings - Brookfield Place&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/fe304deb-7b07-4465-a6c9-c89eee63b1cb"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/fe304deb-7b07-4465-a6c9-c89eee63b1cb&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;How many floors in the building?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/7f2b2ac2-22aa-46ac-ae84-c60028fb804f" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Brookfield Place is within the Brookfield Place office complex in Perth. It is currently the second tallest building in Western Australia. Located at 125 St Georges Terrace, the major tenant is BHP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/080c6895-e4d0-4673-89de-434f8c4b1196" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Welcome to the WAQuokka AdLab art series - which intends to form a giant quokka off the coast of Perth. There is a 500m geofence on stages which allows the AdLabs to be solved from between the Fremantle Maritime Museum and the Rottnest Ferry Terminal.&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
