   <groundspeak:country></groundspeak:country>
   <groundspeak:state>Western Australia</groundspeak:state>
   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;WAQuokka AdLab Art #106&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;The Moral Compass - Honesty&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/1f37cafa-ae2d-4520-b4ff-26f58b289c9b"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/1f37cafa-ae2d-4520-b4ff-26f58b289c9b&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;What is the moral lesson for this stage?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/ac279f99-72d9-47b8-89a8-7f805c1945ed" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Honesty or truthfulness is a facet of moral character that connotes positive and virtuous attributes such as integrity, truthfulness, along with the absence of lying, cheating, theft, etc. Honesty also involves being trustworthy, loyal, fair, and sincere.  &lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/24b3a78d-6654-45b4-896f-952a12cb5676" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Welcome to the WAQuokka AdLab art series - which intends to form a giant quokka off the coast of Perth. There is a 500m geofence on stages which allows the AdLabs to be solved from between the Fremantle Maritime Museum and the Rottnest Ferry Terminal.&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
