   <groundspeak:difficulty>1</groundspeak:difficulty>
   <groundspeak:terrain>1</groundspeak:terrain>
   <groundspeak:country></groundspeak:country>
   <groundspeak:state>Western Australia</groundspeak:state>
   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;WAQuokka AdLab Art #062&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Shades of Fremantle: South Fremantle&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/62a9f3d6-096f-465d-93dd-fa3b6d0be15a"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/62a9f3d6-096f-465d-93dd-fa3b6d0be15a&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;Which suburb is located to the south of Fremantle?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/e2530dec-639d-4bec-a299-f2489ebf69f0" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;South Fremantle is a highly sought-after, vibrant suburb located south of Fremantle's city centre, stretching from Fishing Boat Harbour to South Beach and inland to Hampton Road. It's renowned for its relaxed coastal energy and a unique blend of historic charm and modern amenities.

The suburb boasts a mix of housing, from charming historic cottages on smaller blocks to contemporary low-rise apartments, all contributing to its desirable real estate market. Its peaceful, tree-lined streets create a distinct village ambiance.

A major draw of South Fremantle is its direct access to South Beach, a beautiful stretch of white sand perfect for swimming, sunbathing, and various water sports. The area is well-serviced with walking and bike trails, parklands, and a popular beachfront cafe.

Along South Terrace, residents and visitors can enjoy a thriving array of locally-owned cafes, restaurants, wine bars, pubs, and boutique retail. The suburb also has a strong maritime connection, with businesses along the waterfront, including the iconic Sealanes fishmonger.

South Fremantle offers a high quality of life with a strong sense of community, appealing to a diverse demographic including professionals, families, and retirees. Its proximity to central Fremantle means residents can enjoy the larger city's attractions while benefiting from South Fremantle's quieter, more residential feel.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/9cb94bfb-8343-463e-8a15-1202e656787c" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Welcome to the WAQuokka AdLab art series - which intends to form a giant quokka off the coast of Perth. There is a 500m geofence on stages which allows the AdLabs to be solved from between the Fremantle Maritime Museum and the Rottnest Ferry Terminal.

To join this project, please contact the project Admins on WAQuokkaAdLab@gmail.com
&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
