 <wpt lat="-32.053167" lon="115.737717">
  <ele>1.0</ele>
  <time>2025-06-02T08:00:00Z</time>
  <name>LBqA2d-05</name>
  <desc>WAQuokkaAdLa118</desc>
  <url>https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/731825ae-3aad-4891-9bfd-e36533ea89a7</url>
  <urlname>WAQuokka AdLab Art #014 : S5 Looking after our first responders - The Salvo's by I C Nothing</urlname>
  <sym>Geocache</sym>
  <type>Geocache|Lab Cache</type>
  <groundspeak:cache id="-1672" available="True" archived="False" xmlns:groundspeak="http://www.groundspeak.com/cache/1/0/1">
   <groundspeak:name>WAQuokka AdLab Art #014 : S5 Looking after our first responders - The Salvo's</groundspeak:name>
   <groundspeak:placed_by>I C Nothing</groundspeak:placed_by>
   <groundspeak:owner id="">I C Nothing</groundspeak:owner>
   <groundspeak:type>Lab Cache</groundspeak:type>
   <groundspeak:container>Virtual</groundspeak:container>
   <groundspeak:attributes>
   </groundspeak:attributes>
   <groundspeak:difficulty>1</groundspeak:difficulty>
   <groundspeak:terrain>1</groundspeak:terrain>
   <groundspeak:country></groundspeak:country>
   <groundspeak:state>Western Australia</groundspeak:state>
   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;WAQuokka AdLab Art #014&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Looking after our first responders - The Salvo's&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/731825ae-3aad-4891-9bfd-e36533ea89a7"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/731825ae-3aad-4891-9bfd-e36533ea89a7&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;When did the Salvation Army begin in Western Australia ?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/5428b64a-ebc0-440e-8c3e-2cde7e2cfaa5" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Salvos are known for their involvement in disaster relief efforts, providing assistance to communities affected by natural disasters, floods, and other emergencies.
Another role that they provide is looking after our first responders during tasking to major scenes or disasters/ accidents that has our emergency responders on scene for a long duration.

They provide many of our emergency responders with a warm meal and drinks to get them through their shift. As an emergency responder it was always a welcome sight to see the Salvos turn up to look after us whilst we worked to serve our community.

The Salvo's rely on donations and sponsorship to fulfil their vital role in our state's emergency response.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/9d89ab20-f34b-41d6-8118-b3c0cfb39dfb" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Welcome to the WAQuokka AdLab art series - which intends to form a giant quokka off the coast of Perth. There is a 500m geofence on stages which allows the AdLabs to be solved from between the Fremantle Maritime Museum and the Rottnest Ferry Terminal.&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
   <groundspeak:logs>
