   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;WAQuokka AdLab Art #086&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Rove McManus&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/fc0c18e4-cb6c-4f15-995e-4a16636e1b9a"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/fc0c18e4-cb6c-4f15-995e-4a16636e1b9a&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;What does 'Rove' usually say at the end of each episode?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/fccb32f0-c24d-4b5c-8374-2b0412d805e2" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;John Henry Michael 'Rove' McManus is an Australian comedian, television and radio presenter, producer and media personality who has received three Gold Logie awards.
Born In Perth!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/d32df207-a7f6-447f-a938-ac235d53a4cb" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Welcome to the WAQuokka AdLab art series - which intends to form a giant quokka off the coast of Perth. There is a 500m geofence on stages which allows the AdLabs to be solved from between the Fremantle Maritime Museum and the Rottnest Ferry Terminal.&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
