 <wpt lat="-32.053283" lon="115.74005">
  <time>2025-06-11T08:00:00Z</time>
  <name>LBUMpU-02</name>
  <desc>WAQuokkaAdLa146</desc>
  <url>https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/5f44b592-9006-48a7-898f-917c1e03b3c1</url>
  <urlname>WAQuokka AdLab Art #102 : S2 Stage Two - Fremantle Prison by JKJK20</urlname>
  <sym>Geocache</sym>
  <type>Geocache|Lab Cache</type>
  <groundspeak:cache id="-1424" available="True" archived="False" xmlns:groundspeak="http://www.groundspeak.com/cache/1/0/1">
   <groundspeak:name>WAQuokka AdLab Art #102 : S2 Stage Two - Fremantle Prison</groundspeak:name>
   <groundspeak:placed_by>JKJK20</groundspeak:placed_by>
   <groundspeak:owner id="">JKJK20</groundspeak:owner>
   <groundspeak:type>Lab Cache</groundspeak:type>
   <groundspeak:container>Virtual</groundspeak:container>
   <groundspeak:attributes>
   </groundspeak:attributes>
   <groundspeak:difficulty>1</groundspeak:difficulty>
   <groundspeak:terrain>1</groundspeak:terrain>
   <groundspeak:country></groundspeak:country>
   <groundspeak:state>Western Australia</groundspeak:state>
   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;WAQuokka AdLab Art #102&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Stage Two - Fremantle Prison&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/5f44b592-9006-48a7-898f-917c1e03b3c1"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/5f44b592-9006-48a7-898f-917c1e03b3c1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;Of the 44 people executed at the Fremantle Prison, how many were women?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/0c9873e0-da13-49ee-bb44-67ec9a771f6b" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fremantle's most haunted places  

Fremantle Prison History:
Built in the mid-1800s, the prison housed convicts and later served as a place of detention for prisoners.
Reports:
Visitors and staff have reported seeing shadowy figures, hearing unexplained sounds, and feeling a sense of unease within the prison walls. Disembodied Footsteps and Voices:
Many visitors and staff have reported hearing disembodied footsteps and voices echoing through the prison halls. 
The Headless Man:
Stories circulate about a headless man appearing in photographs taken near the gallows. 
Camera Failures and Orbs:
Cameras are said to malfunction, and orbs and strange light anomalies have been observed. 
Strange Smells and Flying Bin Lids:
Unexplained smells and flying bin lids have also been reported. 
Man in Black:
Some guards claim to have seen the apparition of a man in black, with one even fainting upon seeing the figure. 
Cold Spots and Unexplained Sensations:
Some people visiting the YHA Fremantle Prison hostel have reported feeling an inexplicable presence in the shower blocks. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/0ff39bf4-4d8e-416d-93d9-9ed5881ed321" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Welcome to the WAQuokka AdLab art series - which intends to form a giant quokka
off the coast of Perth. There is a 500m geofence on stages which allows the AdLabs
to be solved from between the Fremantle Maritime Museum and the Rottnest Ferry
Terminal.&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
