   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;WAQuokka AdLab Art #049&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Perth People - Actor&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/5b950398-cfe4-4480-a8a8-839f76a333f4"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/5b950398-cfe4-4480-a8a8-839f76a333f4&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;Stranger Things have happened for this actor&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/e3e9e9cb-bc12-4b5e-8342-2c7c59d55c25" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This male was born in Perth, Western Australia, to New Zealand-born Scott Montgomery-Harvey and Judith, daughter of Dr Godfrey Barrett-Lennard, professor of psychology at the University of Waterloo, Ontario, Canada and a descendant of the politician Sir Thomas Barrett-Lennard, 1st Baronet via his fifth son, Edward Pomeroy Barrett-Lennard, an early settler in Western Australia. He has one younger sister, Saskia. His parents worked in the screen industry in Australia. He began performing on screen and in theater at the age of nine. He attended Bayswater Primary School and then later attended Mount Lawley Senior High School in his hometown. When He was in Year 12, his fellow students voted for him to be "The most likely student to become a Hollywood star" in the annual yearbook.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/1f72b1c1-e16c-4b12-8c7d-5756dd2e4954" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Welcome to the WAQuokka AdLab art series - which intends to form a giant quokka off the coast of Perth. There is a 500m geofence on stages which allows the AdLabs to be solved from between the Fremantle Maritime Museum and the Rottnest Ferry Terminal.

To join this project, please contact the project Admins on WAQuokkaAdLab@gmail.com
&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
   <groundspeak:logs>
  </groundspeak:logs>
   <groundspeak:travelbugs>
   </groundspeak:travelbugs>
</groundspeak:cache>
</wpt>
 <wpt lat="-32.05295" lon="115.739117">
