   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;WAQuokka AdLab #110&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Dragon Boat Racing - WA Teams&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/a65bb605-2d99-4e6c-9a1d-b3aed5768218"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/a65bb605-2d99-4e6c-9a1d-b3aed5768218&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;Which WA team is known as the ‘Vikings’?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/e62e6a4a-7cc0-46cc-a0b1-e86dd93d3cfa" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The WA Dragon Boat Racing Clubs: 
*Albany Dragon Boat Club
*Amazons Perth Dragon Boat Club (breast cancer survivors and supporters)
*Blades Dragon Boat Club
Crewsaders DDA Bunbury (breast cancer survivors and supporters)
*Denmark Riverside Club. Dragon Boat section
*Forza Dragon Boat Club
*Fremantle Swan Dragon Boat Club
*Fury River Dragons
*Indian Ocean Dragon Boat Club
*Lakers Dragon Boat Club
*Mandurah Dragon Boat Club (Vikings)
*Ord River Paddlers Inc Kununurra Dragon Boat Club
*Perth Pirates Dragon Boat Club&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/4258cacb-3cb0-4313-a133-335944e2ce5c" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Welcome to the WAQuokka AdLab art series - which intends to form a giant quokka off the coast of Perth. There is a 500m geofence on stages which allows the AdLabs to be solved from between Fremantle Maritime Museum and the Rottnest Ferry Terminal.

To join this project, please contact the project admins on WAQuokkaAdLab@gmail.com&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
