   <groundspeak:difficulty>1</groundspeak:difficulty>
   <groundspeak:terrain>1</groundspeak:terrain>
   <groundspeak:country></groundspeak:country>
   <groundspeak:state>Western Australia</groundspeak:state>
   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;WAQuokka AdLab Art #020&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Mark of the Century&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/3dce4f37-4ff8-47a6-bbea-488c43e48fb9"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/3dce4f37-4ff8-47a6-bbea-488c43e48fb9&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;What football club did John Gerovich play for?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/c2fea4f8-2894-4820-b1ea-058edb4082bb" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This statue commemorates the most famous mark in Western Australian history taken by South Fremantle full forward John Gerovich in the 1956 preliminary final at Subiaco Oval.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/0f42b880-ed35-471e-b0c2-002711ea8456" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Welcome to the WAQuokka AdLab art series - which intends to form a giant quokka off the coast of Perth. There is a 500m geofence on stages which allows the AdLabs to be solved from between the Fremantle Maritime Museum and the Rottnest Ferry Terminal.

To join this project, please contact the project Admins on WAQuokkaAdLab@gmail.com

In this Adventure Lab you will discover a few of the iconic bronze statues and their history in the Fremantle City Centre.&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
