   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;WAQuokka AdLab Art #039&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Our Fave Places in WA - Kings Park&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/a2c6432d-a028-4959-b56a-16e13ab76dc9"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/a2c6432d-a028-4959-b56a-16e13ab76dc9&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;Which is larger: Kings Park or Central Park, New York?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/20a61896-cc50-489c-b8e8-b8249007d9fd" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Kings Park and Botanic Gardens are located very close to Perth CBD.  It is a sprawling urban park, one of the world’s largest inner city parks, which displays a mix of natural bushland, cultivated gardens and stunning views.


Welcome to the WAQuokka AdLab art - Please join in by contacting WAQuokkaAdLab@gmail.com &lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/9e7fcfd4-1f93-433b-8214-caeafb5bfe30" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Welcome to the WAQuokka AdLab art series - which intends to form a giant quokka off the coast of Perth. There is a 500m geofence on stages which allows the AdLabs to be solved from between the Fremantle Maritime Museum and the Rottnest Ferry Terminal.

To join this project, please contact the project Admins on WAQuokkaAdLab@gmail.com&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
