   <groundspeak:difficulty>1</groundspeak:difficulty>
   <groundspeak:terrain>1</groundspeak:terrain>
   <groundspeak:country></groundspeak:country>
   <groundspeak:state>Western Australia</groundspeak:state>
   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;WAQuokka AdLab Art #040&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Dwellingup Railway History&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/e247ea17-2884-4cd0-a895-5cb94449fa26"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/e247ea17-2884-4cd0-a895-5cb94449fa26&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;The Railway that passes through Dwellingup once ran from Pinjarra to where?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/530c6262-48ee-42eb-9eeb-df3e3035e7aa" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Dwellingup is a beautiful town located SE of Perth in the Darling Ranges. It is an "adventure" town with many adventure activities to undertake.

It is also the meeting point for the Munda Bidi Bike Trail and the Bibbulmun Track.

Also located in Dwellingup is the Hotham Valley Railway.

The railway was originally a Government run Railway transporting, goods, passenger's, livestock, grain and timber. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/dce8047e-8208-4ecf-856d-6ffb56ed31a3" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Welcome to the WAQuokka AdLab art series - which intends to form a giant quokka off the coast of Perth. There is a 500m geofence on stages which allows the AdLabs to be solved from between the Fremantle Maritime Museum and the Rottnest Ferry Terminal.

To join this project, please contact the project Admins on WAQuokkaAdLab@gmail.com
&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
