   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Crooked Brook 2&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Coral Vine&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/607647da-4e98-4890-9090-c631ae4f5470"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/607647da-4e98-4890-9090-c631ae4f5470&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;How many distinct lobes does the leaves divide into? (word)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/3f65302c-7c2a-49eb-9af4-a3df63503cd5" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;A vigorous climber or creeper with masses of red, yellow and orange pea-shaped flowers during Spring.  Its leaves divide into three distinct lobes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/afc8c4cc-df96-4079-8026-52ad9e306d7e" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Crooked Brook 2

