   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;A Swing through Swan&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Yahava&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/12123491-dfc0-4b3d-ad8c-6285380e0ef5"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/12123491-dfc0-4b3d-ad8c-6285380e0ef5&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;There is a sticker on this car, what is the word being held up?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/ad4f56d9-a876-42e1-92b1-7ec2692c6b89" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you want coffee this was the place to come.
Yahava is known for going out to find great coffee and bringing back to WA.
Yahava has great drinks, even if your not a coffee drinker. They also have great snacks and a Coffee Safari experience where you get to try different coffees and roast some also.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/adc4fa20-01c9-48bb-856c-e9afac1e098f" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This Adventure Lab features a few favourite places to be with friends when i use to live near by.


The Cover image and starting location is of my Favorite ice cream place but is now sadly closed.
Oggies Ice Cream Cafe.&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
