   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;A Swing through Swan&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Edgecombe Brothers&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/12123491-dfc0-4b3d-ad8c-6285380e0ef5"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/12123491-dfc0-4b3d-ad8c-6285380e0ef5&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;What fruit is on the edgecombe’s sign by the road?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/4d1a4e84-d292-4b4e-b3f7-8ec013a87707" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Founded by the Edgecombe brothers Don and Frank in 1925, Their vintage vines are family-owned to this very day.
Don and Frank immigrated to Western Australia from Worthing in the UK.
They purchased fifty-acres of Swan Valley property that would soon become celebrated as a historic wine region in WA.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/adc4fa20-01c9-48bb-856c-e9afac1e098f" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This Adventure Lab features a few favourite places to be with friends when i use to live near by.


The Cover image and starting location is of my Favorite ice cream place but is now sadly closed.
Oggies Ice Cream Cafe.&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
