   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Watering holes in Guildford&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Rose and Crown Hotel&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/f246ece8-a9c4-4171-8d45-47b8898daa23"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/f246ece8-a9c4-4171-8d45-47b8898daa23&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Radius: 100m&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Stages: 4&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Kind of question: single&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;Find on stand alone plaque.  In what year was the East wing/Stables built?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/57ddfff7-9b84-456c-9f8a-a95a973c9a12" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The oldest operating hotel is nestled in the heart of Perths heritage-rich 
Guildford.  This Georgian style Pub is one of the few remaining original country classics in all Aust.   Indoor and outdoor restaurants offer a delicious range of meals to suit everytaste. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/cc7adf02-64b6-4ff1-a61a-4558773d2023" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This adventure lab will take you around the town of Guildford, close to the Swan Valley and Midland. 
It features 4 historic hotels and 1 liquor merchant. Well known for their craft beers and a variety of cuisines. 
Guilford is well known for its historic colonial architecture, it was established in 1929 on the Swan River. Serving as the first inland port. &lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
