   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Sun-kissed Shorelines  - Mandurah Beaches&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Town Beach &lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/dd9d5216-417d-4cd1-8d9a-d290835bd3cb"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/dd9d5216-417d-4cd1-8d9a-d290835bd3cb&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Radius: 20m&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Stages: 5&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Kind of question: single&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;How many steps lead up to the Surf Life Saving tower lookout? &lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/b3cf348a-93ba-42aa-8b14-6d45c9a1f248" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Welcome to Town Beach! 
Located centrally in the Mandurah Ocean Marina adjacent to Dolphin Quay, Town Beach is a popular beach for swimming, with Surf Life Saving supervision on weekends.
 There are restaurants, cafes and markets nearby as well as bbqs and toilets. 

&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/7c08a902-ed77-4de7-9396-d0f58e9f80f5" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Mandurah's beaches have a lot to offer with a good variety of choice depending on what you are looking to experience.. 

There are relaxed family-friendly spots; surf breaks for those looking for a little more adventure; and calm, scenic bays; all with their own natural beauty. 

Other activities include walking, swimming, snorkelling or simply soaking up the scenic waterside views. 

Whatever your fancy, no trip to Mandurah should go without visiting at least one of these picturesque locations along the coast. I hope you enjoy! And remember to stay safe in the sun and surf ??  &amp;zwj;?? 

**Take note of a letter clue at each completed location to spell out a word associated with the theme of the AdLab to help complete the bonus cache  &lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
