   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Sun-kissed Shorelines  - Mandurah Beaches&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Hall Head Beach&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/dd9d5216-417d-4cd1-8d9a-d290835bd3cb"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/dd9d5216-417d-4cd1-8d9a-d290835bd3cb&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Radius: 20m&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Stages: 5&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Kind of question: single&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;What five character code is displayed on the BEN sign in case of an emergency? &lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/97625b1b-be33-4731-b3b0-42c770af55a7" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Welcome to Halls Head Beach also known as Doddi's Beach. 
Known for its relaxed, laidback vibe, Halls Head beach offers spectacular Indian Ocean views and calm waters making it a perfect spot for families and other beachgoers who come to enjoy the natural coastal beauty coupled with modern amenities. 
The well-frequented cafe nearby is a popular spot to sit and enjoy the views. 

Take a walk to the BEN (Beach Emergency Number) sign to answer the following question. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/7c08a902-ed77-4de7-9396-d0f58e9f80f5" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Mandurah's beaches have a lot to offer with a good variety of choice depending on what you are looking to experience.. 

There are relaxed family-friendly spots; surf breaks for those looking for a little more adventure; and calm, scenic bays; all with their own natural beauty. 

Other activities include walking, swimming, snorkelling or simply soaking up the scenic waterside views. 

Whatever your fancy, no trip to Mandurah should go without visiting at least one of these picturesque locations along the coast. I hope you enjoy! And remember to stay safe in the sun and surf ??  &amp;zwj;?? 

**Take note of a letter clue at each completed location to spell out a word associated with the theme of the AdLab to help complete the bonus cache  &lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
