   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;WAGB25 QUIZ LAB&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;WA&amp;#039;s OLDEST&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/59670649-f936-4f67-b726-ba2d57ace8da"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/59670649-f936-4f67-b726-ba2d57ace8da&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Radius: 100m&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Stages: 5&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Kind of question: multiple choice&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;What cache is WA&amp;#039;s oldest?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/943fe96d-c84e-4eda-9732-ec2ad757f1f8" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The early days of caching in WA saw a number of caches hidden, do you know which is the oldest?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/d26c500c-f4cd-42e4-9008-dd43de1afa57" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Take a wander around the WAGB25 event answering some interesting questions about Geocaching in WA&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
