   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h3&gt;Morawa Wildflower Country&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Historic cemetery&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/2779a42a-e481-4475-a160-012e9d44cd7b"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/2779a42a-e481-4475-a160-012e9d44cd7b&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Radius: 100m&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Stages: 5&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Kind of question: single&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;How old is the youngest soul in this memorial&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/8de2a5e4-eb49-4623-9798-fa7dd8a54132" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Up a windy track with a turn ring at the end. A lovely little historical memorial to our pioneers.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Descriptions&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/acdd6847-9e5d-4d92-9b70-aa73c04923a9" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Morowa Wildflowers are abounding August to October. Including the Wreath flowers. Get a map from info centre and spend some time here. Lots of history and natural beauty.&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
