 <wpt lat="-32.00405" lon="115.843017">
  <ele>21.0</ele>
  <time>2025-10-18T08:00:00Z</time>
  <name>LBNY0B-4</name>
  <desc>LBackInTimeS4Hi</desc>
  <url>https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/52dd925b-fbcf-4ef9-aa2b-e17e80f1e94f</url>
  <urlname>[L] Back In Time : S4 Hill Valley High School by arnott.family</urlname>
  <sym>Geocache</sym>
  <type>Geocache|Lab Cache</type>
  <groundspeak:cache id="9653495" available="True" archived="False" xmlns:groundspeak="http://www.groundspeak.com/cache/1/0/1">
   <groundspeak:name>[L] Back In Time : S4 Hill Valley High School</groundspeak:name>
   <groundspeak:placed_by>arnott.family</groundspeak:placed_by>
   <groundspeak:owner id="">arnott.family</groundspeak:owner>
   <groundspeak:type>Lab Cache</groundspeak:type>
   <groundspeak:container>Virtual</groundspeak:container>
   <groundspeak:attributes>
   </groundspeak:attributes>
   <groundspeak:difficulty>1</groundspeak:difficulty>
   <groundspeak:terrain>1</groundspeak:terrain>
   <groundspeak:country></groundspeak:country>
   <groundspeak:state>Western Australia</groundspeak:state>
   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">
                                                                                                                                        &lt;h3&gt;Back In Time&lt;/h3&gt;
    &lt;h4&gt;Hill Valley High School&lt;/h4&gt;

    &lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="background:#990000;color:#fff;border-radius:5px;padding:3px 5px;"&gt;
        linear
    &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/52dd925b-fbcf-4ef9-aa2b-e17e80f1e94f" target="_blank"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/52dd925b-fbcf-4ef9-aa2b-e17e80f1e94f&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;p&gt;Radius: 20m&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;p&gt;Stages: 5&lt;/p&gt;


    &lt;p&gt;Kind of question:
                    multiple choice
            &lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;What was the name of the Rhythmic Ceremonial Ritual that Doc Brown sees on the poster?&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;hr /&gt;
    &lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/07a1d3d8-fbca-467b-bdbe-faedb927ef2a" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;Marty’s search for answers leads him to the bustling halls of Hill Valley High. The school is alive with chatter, lockers slamming, and 1950s rock ’n’ roll echoing through the corridors. But what really stops Marty in his tracks is the sight of his parents—only, they’re both teenagers.

George shuffles nervously down the hall, books clutched to his chest, while Lorraine swoons with her friends nearby. To Marty’s horror, Lorraine’s attention seems locked not on George, but on him! Instead of falling for George as history intended, she’s fascinated by the mysterious new boy from out of town.

Marty realizes the gravity of the situation: if he doesn’t find a way to bring his parents together, he might erase his own existence. Time is literally running out, and the stakes couldn’t be higher.&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;hr /&gt;
    &lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Description&lt;/h5&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/91fe2570-1ec5-48b6-a307-01fee29c5793" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;It’s 1985. Marty McFly meets Doc Brown at the Twin Pines Mall, who has just finished building a time machine out of a DeLorean. But when Libyan terrorists arrive looking for Doc, Marty jumps behind the wheel and floors it to escape. Suddenly, the DeLorean hits 88 mph… and Marty finds himself in Hill Valley, in the year 1955!

Marty must navigate 1955 Hill Valley, track down Doc Brown, and find a way to get Back to the Future. Help Marty complete his adventure before he’s stuck in the past forever!&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
   <groundspeak:logs>
  </groundspeak:logs>
   <groundspeak:travelbugs>
   </groundspeak:travelbugs>
</groundspeak:cache>
</wpt>
 <wpt lat="-32.003133" lon="115.842667">
  <ele>18.0</ele>
  <time>2025-10-18T08:00:00Z</time>
  <name>LBNY0B-3</name>
  <desc>LBackInTimeS3Do</desc>
  <url>https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/52dd925b-fbcf-4ef9-aa2b-e17e80f1e94f</url>
  <urlname>[L] Back In Time : S3 Doc Brown's Workshop by arnott.family</urlname>
  <sym>Geocache</sym>
  <type>Geocache|Lab Cache</type>
  <groundspeak:cache id="9653494" available="True" archived="False" xmlns:groundspeak="http://www.groundspeak.com/cache/1/0/1">
   <groundspeak:name>[L] Back In Time : S3 Doc Brown's Workshop</groundspeak:name>
   <groundspeak:placed_by>arnott.family</groundspeak:placed_by>
   <groundspeak:owner id="">arnott.family</groundspeak:owner>
   <groundspeak:type>Lab Cache</groundspeak:type>
   <groundspeak:container>Virtual</groundspeak:container>
   <groundspeak:attributes>
   </groundspeak:attributes>
   <groundspeak:difficulty>1</groundspeak:difficulty>
   <groundspeak:terrain>1</groundspeak:terrain>
   <groundspeak:country></groundspeak:country>
   <groundspeak:state>Western Australia</groundspeak:state>
   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">
                                                                                                                                        &lt;h3&gt;Back In Time&lt;/h3&gt;
    &lt;h4&gt;Doc Brown&amp;#039;s Workshop&lt;/h4&gt;

    &lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="background:#990000;color:#fff;border-radius:5px;padding:3px 5px;"&gt;
        linear
    &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/52dd925b-fbcf-4ef9-aa2b-e17e80f1e94f" target="_blank"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/52dd925b-fbcf-4ef9-aa2b-e17e80f1e94f&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;p&gt;Radius: 20m&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;p&gt;Stages: 5&lt;/p&gt;


    &lt;p&gt;Kind of question:
                    multiple choice
            &lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;Where was Doc Brown when he came up with the flux capacitor?&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;hr /&gt;
    &lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/cff00654-41e8-4c32-9db7-d5b896f201ab" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;After the chaos at Lou’s Café, Marty knows he needs help—big time. Following an old address, he tracks down the younger version of Doc Brown in 1955. Instead of the futuristic lab he’s used to, Marty finds a cluttered workshop filled with wires, gadgets, half-finished inventions, and plenty of smoke and sparks.

Doc bursts in wearing his wild lab coat and goggles, eyeing Marty suspiciously. When Marty claims he’s from the year 1985 and traveled back in a time machine, Doc laughs it off as nonsense. But when Marty mentions the flux capacitor—the very idea Doc had only just dreamed up—suddenly the skepticism fades.

Doc’s curiosity takes over, but he’s still not convinced. Is Marty a lunatic, or could he truly be a visitor from the future? This tense moment is the start of their legendary partnership across time.&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;hr /&gt;
    &lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Description&lt;/h5&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/91fe2570-1ec5-48b6-a307-01fee29c5793" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;It’s 1985. Marty McFly meets Doc Brown at the Twin Pines Mall, who has just finished building a time machine out of a DeLorean. But when Libyan terrorists arrive looking for Doc, Marty jumps behind the wheel and floors it to escape. Suddenly, the DeLorean hits 88 mph… and Marty finds himself in Hill Valley, in the year 1955!

Marty must navigate 1955 Hill Valley, track down Doc Brown, and find a way to get Back to the Future. Help Marty complete his adventure before he’s stuck in the past forever!&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
   <groundspeak:logs>
  </groundspeak:logs>
   <groundspeak:travelbugs>
   </groundspeak:travelbugs>
</groundspeak:cache>
</wpt>
 <wpt lat="-32.003883" lon="115.842267">
  <ele>26.0</ele>
  <time>2025-10-18T08:00:00Z</time>
  <name>LBNY0B-5</name>
  <desc>LBackInTimeS5Th</desc>
  <url>https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/52dd925b-fbcf-4ef9-aa2b-e17e80f1e94f</url>
  <urlname>[L] Back In Time : S5 The Clock Tower by arnott.family</urlname>
  <sym>Geocache</sym>
  <type>Geocache|Lab Cache</type>
  <groundspeak:cache id="9653496" available="True" archived="False" xmlns:groundspeak="http://www.groundspeak.com/cache/1/0/1">
   <groundspeak:name>[L] Back In Time : S5 The Clock Tower</groundspeak:name>
   <groundspeak:placed_by>arnott.family</groundspeak:placed_by>
   <groundspeak:owner id="">arnott.family</groundspeak:owner>
   <groundspeak:type>Lab Cache</groundspeak:type>
   <groundspeak:container>Virtual</groundspeak:container>
   <groundspeak:attributes>
   </groundspeak:attributes>
   <groundspeak:difficulty>1</groundspeak:difficulty>
   <groundspeak:terrain>1</groundspeak:terrain>
   <groundspeak:country></groundspeak:country>
   <groundspeak:state>Western Australia</groundspeak:state>
   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">
                                                                                                                                        &lt;h3&gt;Back In Time&lt;/h3&gt;
    &lt;h4&gt;The Clock Tower&lt;/h4&gt;

    &lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="background:#990000;color:#fff;border-radius:5px;padding:3px 5px;"&gt;
        linear
    &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/52dd925b-fbcf-4ef9-aa2b-e17e80f1e94f" target="_blank"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/52dd925b-fbcf-4ef9-aa2b-e17e80f1e94f&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;p&gt;Radius: 20m&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;p&gt;Stages: 5&lt;/p&gt;


    &lt;p&gt;Kind of question:
                    multiple choice
            &lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;How many minutes does Marty adjust the time circuits when he returns from 1955 to 1985?&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;hr /&gt;
    &lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/04fe72e9-340b-454e-a0e5-51e4b933fcd8" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;With the school dance a success and his parents finally brought together, Marty knows his future is safe—but now comes the hardest part. To get back to 1985, he must meet Doc at Hill Valley’s iconic clock tower and harness a bolt of lightning to power the DeLorean.

The night is stormy, the wind howls, and rain lashes against the courthouse square as Doc frantically rigs up wires and cables across the clock face. Every second counts—the lightning strike will only happen once, and if they miss it, Marty could be trapped in 1955 forever.

Marty floors the DeLorean down Main Street, aiming for the exact moment lightning will strike. Doc dangles dangerously from the tower above, fighting to make the final connection. Sparks fly, the clock chimes, and time itself hangs in the balance…&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;hr /&gt;
    &lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Description&lt;/h5&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/91fe2570-1ec5-48b6-a307-01fee29c5793" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;It’s 1985. Marty McFly meets Doc Brown at the Twin Pines Mall, who has just finished building a time machine out of a DeLorean. But when Libyan terrorists arrive looking for Doc, Marty jumps behind the wheel and floors it to escape. Suddenly, the DeLorean hits 88 mph… and Marty finds himself in Hill Valley, in the year 1955!

Marty must navigate 1955 Hill Valley, track down Doc Brown, and find a way to get Back to the Future. Help Marty complete his adventure before he’s stuck in the past forever!&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
   <groundspeak:logs>
  </groundspeak:logs>
   <groundspeak:travelbugs>
   </groundspeak:travelbugs>
</groundspeak:cache>
</wpt>
 <wpt lat="-32.004217" lon="115.8417">
  <ele>23.0</ele>
  <time>2025-10-18T08:00:00Z</time>
  <name>LBNY0B-1</name>
  <desc>LBackInTimeS1Pe</desc>
  <url>https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/52dd925b-fbcf-4ef9-aa2b-e17e80f1e94f</url>
  <urlname>[L] Back In Time : S1 Peabody's Tree Farm by arnott.family</urlname>
  <sym>Geocache</sym>
  <type>Geocache|Lab Cache</type>
  <groundspeak:cache id="9653492" available="True" archived="False" xmlns:groundspeak="http://www.groundspeak.com/cache/1/0/1">
   <groundspeak:name>[L] Back In Time : S1 Peabody's Tree Farm</groundspeak:name>
   <groundspeak:placed_by>arnott.family</groundspeak:placed_by>
   <groundspeak:owner id="">arnott.family</groundspeak:owner>
   <groundspeak:type>Lab Cache</groundspeak:type>
   <groundspeak:container>Virtual</groundspeak:container>
   <groundspeak:attributes>
   </groundspeak:attributes>
   <groundspeak:difficulty>1</groundspeak:difficulty>
   <groundspeak:terrain>1</groundspeak:terrain>
   <groundspeak:country></groundspeak:country>
   <groundspeak:state>Western Australia</groundspeak:state>
   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">
                                                                                                                                        &lt;h3&gt;Back In Time&lt;/h3&gt;
    &lt;h4&gt;Peabody&amp;#039;s Tree Farm&lt;/h4&gt;

    &lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="background:#990000;color:#fff;border-radius:5px;padding:3px 5px;"&gt;
        linear
    &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/52dd925b-fbcf-4ef9-aa2b-e17e80f1e94f" target="_blank"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/52dd925b-fbcf-4ef9-aa2b-e17e80f1e94f&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;p&gt;Radius: 20m&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;p&gt;Stages: 5&lt;/p&gt;


    &lt;p&gt;Kind of question:
                    multiple choice
            &lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;When Marty crashes into the Peabody Farm, what is the name of the comic the boy is reading?&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;hr /&gt;
    &lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/e10e8b89-5c9b-4c17-b09d-2251408a7c14" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;After Marty’s wild escape in the DeLorean, he doesn’t exactly stick the landing. Instead, he crashes straight through the fence and into the barn of Old Man Peabody. Awakened by the ruckus, the farmer storms out with his shotgun, convinced that a flying saucer has landed on his property. To make matters worse, when he catches a glimpse of Marty in his bright yellow radiation suit, Peabody is sure the “alien invasion” has begun!

Panicked, Marty scrambles back into the DeLorean and slams the door just as Peabody takes aim. It’s a narrow escape, but Marty manages to peel away, leaving Peabody shouting after him. This close call marks Marty’s first shocking encounter in 1955—and it won’t be his last.&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;hr /&gt;
    &lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Description&lt;/h5&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/91fe2570-1ec5-48b6-a307-01fee29c5793" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;It’s 1985. Marty McFly meets Doc Brown at the Twin Pines Mall, who has just finished building a time machine out of a DeLorean. But when Libyan terrorists arrive looking for Doc, Marty jumps behind the wheel and floors it to escape. Suddenly, the DeLorean hits 88 mph… and Marty finds himself in Hill Valley, in the year 1955!

Marty must navigate 1955 Hill Valley, track down Doc Brown, and find a way to get Back to the Future. Help Marty complete his adventure before he’s stuck in the past forever!&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
   <groundspeak:logs>
  </groundspeak:logs>
   <groundspeak:travelbugs>
   </groundspeak:travelbugs>
</groundspeak:cache>
</wpt>
 <wpt lat="-32.003283" lon="115.84195">
  <ele>24.0</ele>
  <time>2025-10-18T08:00:00Z</time>
  <name>LBNY0B-2</name>
  <desc>LBackInTimeS2Lo</desc>
  <url>https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/52dd925b-fbcf-4ef9-aa2b-e17e80f1e94f</url>
  <urlname>[L] Back In Time : S2 Lou's Cafe by arnott.family</urlname>
  <sym>Geocache</sym>
  <type>Geocache|Lab Cache</type>
  <groundspeak:cache id="9653493" available="True" archived="False" xmlns:groundspeak="http://www.groundspeak.com/cache/1/0/1">
   <groundspeak:name>[L] Back In Time : S2 Lou's Cafe</groundspeak:name>
   <groundspeak:placed_by>arnott.family</groundspeak:placed_by>
   <groundspeak:owner id="">arnott.family</groundspeak:owner>
   <groundspeak:type>Lab Cache</groundspeak:type>
   <groundspeak:container>Virtual</groundspeak:container>
   <groundspeak:attributes>
   </groundspeak:attributes>
   <groundspeak:difficulty>1</groundspeak:difficulty>
   <groundspeak:terrain>1</groundspeak:terrain>
   <groundspeak:country></groundspeak:country>
   <groundspeak:state>Western Australia</groundspeak:state>
   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">
                                                                                                                                        &lt;h3&gt;Back In Time&lt;/h3&gt;
    &lt;h4&gt;Lou&amp;#039;s Cafe&lt;/h4&gt;

    &lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="background:#990000;color:#fff;border-radius:5px;padding:3px 5px;"&gt;
        linear
    &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/52dd925b-fbcf-4ef9-aa2b-e17e80f1e94f" target="_blank"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/52dd925b-fbcf-4ef9-aa2b-e17e80f1e94f&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;p&gt;Radius: 20m&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;p&gt;Stages: 5&lt;/p&gt;


    &lt;p&gt;Kind of question:
                    multiple choice
            &lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;What drink &amp;#039;without any sugar&amp;#039;does Marty get served in Lou&amp;#039;s Cafe?&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;hr /&gt;
    &lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/24f15917-54dc-47c2-80ea-d167cc72bafd" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;Still disoriented from his sudden trip to 1955, Marty wanders into the heart of Hill Valley and steps inside Lou’s Café. The place is buzzing with the sounds of a jukebox, clinking dishes, and kids sipping sodas at the counter. But Marty’s jaw drops when he spots someone familiar—his teenage dad, George McFly!

George is hunched over, nervously trying to sip his milkshake in peace. Unfortunately, he’s not alone. Towering above him is none other than Biff Tannen, already making George’s life miserable. Biff shoves George around, mocking him and demanding homework answers. Marty can hardly believe his eyes—his dad is being bullied, and nobody seems brave enough to step in.

This is the moment where Marty begins to realize just how fragile his family’s past really is… and how important his actions in 1955 will be.&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;hr /&gt;
    &lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Description&lt;/h5&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/91fe2570-1ec5-48b6-a307-01fee29c5793" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;It’s 1985. Marty McFly meets Doc Brown at the Twin Pines Mall, who has just finished building a time machine out of a DeLorean. But when Libyan terrorists arrive looking for Doc, Marty jumps behind the wheel and floors it to escape. Suddenly, the DeLorean hits 88 mph… and Marty finds himself in Hill Valley, in the year 1955!

Marty must navigate 1955 Hill Valley, track down Doc Brown, and find a way to get Back to the Future. Help Marty complete his adventure before he’s stuck in the past forever!&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
   <groundspeak:logs>
  </groundspeak:logs>
   <groundspeak:travelbugs>
   </groundspeak:travelbugs>
</groundspeak:cache>
</wpt>
 <wpt lat="-34.960167" lon="117.35485">
