    &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/fc76957e-9f5c-4b08-a807-1e332c17ff44" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;Great undercover area with picnic tables, near BBQ.
The gazebo was built and presented to the people of Albany by The Middleton Beach and Albany Apex Clubs.&lt;/p&gt;

