   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">
                                                                                                                                        &lt;h3&gt;The Beauty of Fitzgerald National Park&lt;/h3&gt;
    &lt;h4&gt;Barrens Beach&lt;/h4&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/cf729cac-9d38-42eb-b7a3-224538fd48e2" target="_blank"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/cf729cac-9d38-42eb-b7a3-224538fd48e2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;p&gt;Radius: 500m&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;p&gt;Stages: 5&lt;/p&gt;


    &lt;p&gt;Kind of question:
                    single
            &lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;How many sculptures are there? A number&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;hr /&gt;
    &lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/681ce7e8-e920-488e-b924-e39176b50b31" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;Barren&amp;#039;s Beach is a small, sheltered beach nestled between dunes and a rugged quartzite headland. It is a popular swimming and fishing spot. Whales sheltering near shore in spring may be visible from the beach. The area also features an interpretive display and art exhibit that provide intriguing insights into the area’s natural and cultural values, including the park’s international significance as a conservation area.
The art exhibit, which is part of a giant park map, is hands-on and provides a bit of fun for the kids.&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;hr /&gt;
    &lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Description&lt;/h5&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/2523b7ba-0f93-4463-b4d9-0b140de15f9d" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;Welcome to the diverse beauty and grandeur of this special national park. There are specific flora here not to be found elsewhere and the sweep of beaches is outstanding. &lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
   <groundspeak:logs>
  </groundspeak:logs>
   <groundspeak:travelbugs>
   </groundspeak:travelbugs>
</groundspeak:cache>
</wpt>
 <wpt lat="-33.924517" lon="120.03775">
  <ele>12.0</ele>
  <time>2025-11-01T08:00:00Z</time>
