    &lt;p&gt;Kind of question:
                    multiple choice
            &lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;Where is the Tassie Mega being held?&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;hr /&gt;
    &lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/67aa322c-c592-447d-9c55-0fe268529d89" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;Geocaching Victoria and the Tassie Event sub-committee are thrilled to unveil an extraordinary geocaching opportunity in Tasmania in 2026. Partnering with passionate Tasmanian geocachers, we’re bringing The Tassie Event to Sorell, Tasmania on 7-8 March 2026. Perfectly situated at the new South East Stadium, the location offers incredible convenience – just a quick 10 minute drive from the airport and a mere 25 minutes from Hobart’s bustling heart.

Tasmania is an adventurer’s paradise, brimming with breathtaking landscapes and a treasure trove of geocaching opportunities! This marks the first major event in Tasmania, making it the southernmost major geocaching celebration in Australia.&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;hr /&gt;
    &lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Description&lt;/h5&gt;
