Tasmania is an adventurer’s paradise, brimming with breathtaking landscapes and a treasure trove of geocaching opportunities! This marks the first major event in Tasmania, making it the southernmost major geocaching celebration in Australia.&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
