    &lt;p&gt;Stages: 5&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;p&gt;Possibly bonus:
            &lt;a href="https://coord.info/GCB7TVK" target="_blank"&gt;GCB7TVK&lt;/a&gt;        &lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;p&gt;Kind of question:
                    multiple choice
            &lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;We sincerely say thank you to the following: &lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;hr /&gt;
    &lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/0677f570-9b45-43a9-af6b-0e74686e75ee" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;This memorial would not be here without the support of various members of the community.

We thank them for keeping the memory of the fallen alive.&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;hr /&gt;
    &lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Description&lt;/h5&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/b769644e-1977-45e3-8754-f9eb55873a00" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;***IMPORTANT UPDATE***
