   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">
                                                                                                                                        &lt;h3&gt;Garvey Park&lt;/h3&gt;
    &lt;h4&gt;Garvey Park and picnic area&lt;/h4&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/bdf06e18-4011-4525-8842-5f7b89e3bb86" target="_blank"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/bdf06e18-4011-4525-8842-5f7b89e3bb86&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;p&gt;Radius: 20m&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;p&gt;Stages: 5&lt;/p&gt;


    &lt;p&gt;Kind of question:
                    single
            &lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;What was the year of Peace?&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;hr /&gt;
    &lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/ebf63ab1-e3c1-4b19-b5a4-2803e2dc50e2" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;There is a lot to do at Garvey Park, hire a SUP board, have a picnic, BBQ, bring your canoe, check out the wetlands, or just go for a stroll. Plenty of parking and shady trees to sit under, or have a game of cricket. &lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;hr /&gt;
    &lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Description&lt;/h5&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/2cf8b825-5313-43eb-b96f-49684f12ca5b" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;Garvey Park is a lovely place to walk or have a picnic, with a playground for kids and undercover BBQ’s. A lovely grassed area right on the Swan River. Great place to walk your dog or swim in the river. Lots of parking with public toilets ( behind the kiosk). 
This adventure lab is just a short stroll around the area to take in the views and facilities. 
&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
   <groundspeak:logs>
  </groundspeak:logs>
   <groundspeak:travelbugs>
   </groundspeak:travelbugs>
</groundspeak:cache>
</wpt>
