    &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/56486232-d4d1-4d0d-ab1a-0bb244fb3030" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;This club offers Kayaking and stand up paddle boarding. It boasts  a large club house  right on the river with modern facilities.  Garvey park is a hidden treasure for water sports and wildlife. &lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;hr /&gt;
    &lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Description&lt;/h5&gt;
