    &lt;p&gt;Stages: 5&lt;/p&gt;


    &lt;p&gt;Kind of question:
                    multiple choice
            &lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;What letter is the goal post shaped as?&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;hr /&gt;
    &lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/497082af-b105-4d56-87c0-9a7af98343fd" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;Pat O’Hara Reserve is a welcoming green space located in Morley. The reserve features extensive grassy areas, playground and walking paths, making it an ideal spot for families and outdoor enthusiasts. Visitors can enjoy picnicking on the lawns or engaging in recreational activities.&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;hr /&gt;
    &lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Description&lt;/h5&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/63b3f3a4-7b2f-4971-9bcf-0b1ad6a731fd" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;Welcome to Pat O’Hara Reserve!

Home to the Morley Sport and Recreation Centre, Perth Bayswater Rugby Union Club and Morley Scout Group.

There is also a playground and basketball/netball structure.

This adventure will take you around the park.&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
