    &lt;p&gt;This function area is ideal for a wide range of occasions, including business seminars, conferences, weddings, music and dance productions, cabarets, and personal events. The room can accommodate up to 350 guests in a theatre-style setup and 250 guests for a seated function.&lt;/p&gt;

