  <urlname>BYOM 10 AdLab Art #06 : S5 Reptiles - Dinosaurs by chickenhawk07</urlname>
  <sym>Geocache</sym>
  <type>Geocache|Lab Cache</type>
  <groundspeak:cache id="9697062" available="True" archived="False" xmlns:groundspeak="http://www.groundspeak.com/cache/1/0/1">
   <groundspeak:name>BYOM 10 AdLab Art #06 : S5 Reptiles - Dinosaurs</groundspeak:name>
   <groundspeak:placed_by>chickenhawk07</groundspeak:placed_by>
   <groundspeak:owner id="">chickenhawk07</groundspeak:owner>
   <groundspeak:type>Lab Cache</groundspeak:type>
   <groundspeak:container>Virtual</groundspeak:container>
   <groundspeak:attributes>
   </groundspeak:attributes>
   <groundspeak:difficulty>1</groundspeak:difficulty>
   <groundspeak:terrain>1</groundspeak:terrain>
   <groundspeak:country></groundspeak:country>
   <groundspeak:state>Western Australia</groundspeak:state>
   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">
                                                                                                                                        &lt;h3&gt;BYOM 10 AdLab Art #06&lt;/h3&gt;
    &lt;h4&gt;Reptiles - Dinosaurs&lt;/h4&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/167c997c-918c-4e16-b2a3-92d17de0fa53" target="_blank"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/167c997c-918c-4e16-b2a3-92d17de0fa53&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;p&gt;Radius: 500m&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;p&gt;Stages: 5&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;p&gt;Possibly bonus:
            &lt;a href="https://coord.info/GCBER3Q" target="_blank"&gt;GCBER3Q&lt;/a&gt;        &lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;p&gt;Kind of question:
                    multiple choice
            &lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;Which Era did dinosaurs dominate ?&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;hr /&gt;
    &lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/50d88864-d7df-40b9-9915-459edf3b54a2" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;Yes, dinosaurs are reptiles, belonging to a larger group called archosaurs, which also includes crocodiles and birds (which are modern dinosaurs). They are distinguished from other reptiles by their upright stance, with legs positioned directly beneath their bodies, allowing for more efficient movement, and a hole in their hip socket. While they share common ancestry with other reptiles, dinosaurs are a distinct lineage that dominated land during the Mesozoic Era. &lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;hr /&gt;
    &lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Description&lt;/h5&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/58fb7056-095b-4803-8649-90af5bf4f8f5" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;Welcome to the BYOM 10 AdLab art series. What is BYOM 10? Bring Your Own Marshmallows (BYOM) is a series of events hosted by the Fellowship of the Trail, usually at a campground in regional WA. To celebrate our 10th event this year at Eaglestone Rock, (&amp;lt;a href="https://coord.info/GCBER3Q" target="_blank"&amp;gt;GCBER3Q&amp;lt;/a&amp;gt;), we&amp;#039;ve put together a little geoart for all to enjoy. All the stages have multiple choice answers and a 500 meter geofence to hopefully minimise the limited cell coverage.&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
   <groundspeak:logs>
  </groundspeak:logs>
   <groundspeak:travelbugs>
   </groundspeak:travelbugs>
</groundspeak:cache>
</wpt>
