                                                                                                                                        &lt;h3&gt;BYOM 10 AdLab Art #08&lt;/h3&gt;
    &lt;h4&gt;The Moral Compass - Honesty&lt;/h4&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/a9436b5c-c2b0-49f0-85fc-5c8216928059" target="_blank"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/a9436b5c-c2b0-49f0-85fc-5c8216928059&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;p&gt;Radius: 500m&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;p&gt;Stages: 5&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;p&gt;Possibly bonus:
            &lt;a href="https://coord.info/GCBER3Q" target="_blank"&gt;GCBER3Q&lt;/a&gt;        &lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;p&gt;Kind of question:
                    multiple choice
            &lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;What is the moral lesson for this stage?&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;hr /&gt;
    &lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/a1b657c8-5569-45c5-8284-f285dacc36d9" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;Honesty or truthfulness is a facet of moral character that connotes positive and virtuous attributes such as integrity, truthfulness, along with the absence of lying, cheating, theft, etc. Honesty also involves being trustworthy, loyal, fair, and sincere.  &lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;hr /&gt;
    &lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Description&lt;/h5&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/16043f43-42d1-413a-9ffb-77a71b84adc6" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;Welcome to the BYOM 10 AdLab art series. What is BYOM 10? Bring Your Own Marshmallows (BYOM) is a series of events hosted by the Fellowship of the Trail, usually at a campground in regional WA. To celebrate our 10th event this year at Eaglestone Rock, (&amp;lt;a href="https://coord.info/GCBER3Q" target="_blank"&amp;gt;GCBER3Q&amp;lt;/a&amp;gt;), we&amp;#039;ve put together a little geoart for all to enjoy. All the stages have multiple choice answers and a 500 meter geofence to hopefully minimise the limited cell coverage.&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
   <groundspeak:logs>
  </groundspeak:logs>
   <groundspeak:travelbugs>
   </groundspeak:travelbugs>
