   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">
                                                                                                                                        &lt;h3&gt;BYOM 10 AdLab Art #03&lt;/h3&gt;
    &lt;h4&gt;Thats a lot of chips&lt;/h4&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/8d015c3d-dca7-4aa8-9c26-6e29e04b0f93" target="_blank"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/8d015c3d-dca7-4aa8-9c26-6e29e04b0f93&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;p&gt;Radius: 500m&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;p&gt;Stages: 5&lt;/p&gt;


    &lt;p&gt;Kind of question:
                    multiple choice
            &lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;So the Casino started with 135 gaming tables, how many do you think they have now?&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;hr /&gt;
    &lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/9ecb1050-b62a-49ae-af3d-274667b13c19" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;It was not just a Casino, comprising a 135-table casino, 400-room hotel, 18-hole golf course, convention and exhibition centre, tennis courts, amphitheatre and other amenities, together with a beautification of the Burswood Island area&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;hr /&gt;
    &lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Description&lt;/h5&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/495f602a-da3d-46fb-ad8c-60b9084c8309" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;Crown Casino Perth has now been around for 40 years, and there should be a few interesting facts by now. &lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
   <groundspeak:logs>
  </groundspeak:logs>
   <groundspeak:travelbugs>
   </groundspeak:travelbugs>
</groundspeak:cache>
</wpt>
