                                                                                                                                        &lt;h3&gt;BYOM 10 AdLab Art #03&lt;/h3&gt;
    &lt;h4&gt;Lets build it.&lt;/h4&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/8d015c3d-dca7-4aa8-9c26-6e29e04b0f93" target="_blank"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/8d015c3d-dca7-4aa8-9c26-6e29e04b0f93&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;p&gt;Radius: 500m&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;p&gt;Stages: 5&lt;/p&gt;


    &lt;p&gt;Kind of question:
                    multiple choice
            &lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;What is the estimated cost of Burswood Casino when it was built in 1985&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;hr /&gt;
    &lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;
