    &lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/1892ffe8-668c-41cd-94e8-e572c6dc932e" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;The name Tyrannosaurus rex comes from Greek (tyrannosaurus mean ‘Tyrant Lizard’) and Latin (rex meaning ‘King’) words. 

The undisputed king of the dinosaurs, the Tyrannosaurus rex is the most popular dinosaur of all time, portrayed in movies such as Jurassic Park and The Land Before Time. 
&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;hr /&gt;
    &lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Description&lt;/h5&gt;
