                                                                                                                                        &lt;h3&gt;Kulin Tin Horse Highway&lt;/h3&gt;
    &lt;h4&gt;Famous Sports Person&lt;/h4&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/d3661b7b-bdba-418e-8073-b7a33d7774ca" target="_blank"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/d3661b7b-bdba-418e-8073-b7a33d7774ca&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;p&gt;Radius: 20m&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;p&gt;Stages: 5&lt;/p&gt;


    &lt;p&gt;Kind of question:
                    single
            &lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;What if the name of this horse  XXXXX-XXX&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;hr /&gt;
    &lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/9f188fd2-52c4-441c-bed3-9f58f33ea2dc" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;Welcome to the Tin Horse Highway leading to the Kulin Bush Races in October each year. Enjoy&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;hr /&gt;
    &lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Description&lt;/h5&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/16158ea4-d3e0-4aa4-8680-77ffb189d1bb" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;This is a stretch of road from Kulin to Jilikin Rock.
Farmers and locals have donated tin horses they have built to support the Kulin Bush Races held in October each year.
There is a bonus cache at the end so don&amp;#039;t forget to collect all the information from each Adventure Lab. &lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
