   <groundspeak:country>Australia</groundspeak:country>
   <groundspeak:state>Western Australia</groundspeak:state>
   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">
                                                                                                                                        &lt;h3&gt;Bayswater Street Art&lt;/h3&gt;
    &lt;h4&gt;Bayswater Library and Community Centre&lt;/h4&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/638fada0-31b3-40fe-a597-267587516da4" target="_blank"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/638fada0-31b3-40fe-a597-267587516da4&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;p&gt;Radius: 50m&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;p&gt;Stages: 5&lt;/p&gt;


    &lt;p&gt;Kind of question:
                    multiple choice
            &lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;Name a snack featured on the bird?&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;hr /&gt;
    &lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/e57fbfa7-5d4b-4798-8b7f-0f84106c9f0d" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;The artist, Steven Buckles (Hurben), has painted distinct murals, depicting the history of the Bayswater area, with connections to the river and local wildlife. These are on the side and back walls of the Bayswater Library and Community Centre. 

Make sure you have a closer look at the mural on the Olfe Street wall of the Community Centre to see if you can find some iconic Aussie snacks!&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;hr /&gt;
    &lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Description&lt;/h5&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/22ae7441-2c2e-4854-9dbb-cbf5ae33eb4b" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;The City of Bayswater is proud to be home to countless outdoor artworks from a range of talented homegrown artists. Take a stroll around Bayswater and you’ll find an array of colourful artwork splashed across laneways, walls and shopfronts. &lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
   <groundspeak:logs>
  </groundspeak:logs>
   <groundspeak:travelbugs>
   </groundspeak:travelbugs>
</groundspeak:cache>
</wpt>
