                                                                                                                                        &lt;h3&gt;Maker Magic 2026&lt;/h3&gt;
    &lt;h4&gt;Maker Magic 2026&lt;/h4&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/6da3520e-87a8-4a76-8b44-84ee1a0e05fe" target="_blank"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/6da3520e-87a8-4a76-8b44-84ee1a0e05fe&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;p&gt;Radius: 500m&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;p&gt;Stages: 5&lt;/p&gt;


    &lt;p&gt;Kind of question:
                    multiple choice
            &lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;What regional town is hosting a WA Maker Magic event in 2026?&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;hr /&gt;
    &lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/2382224a-78db-4b6a-b493-caad16b8d8ae" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;Two WA Maker Magic events are planned for 2026. &lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;hr /&gt;
    &lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Description&lt;/h5&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/f6dd70bd-41df-4af4-9fce-9e56040061fd" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;The joy of finding a well-hidden container, the delight of discovering a clever gadget cache, and the twinkle in a cacher&amp;#039;s eye when signing a logbook—it&amp;#039;s all magic.
We&amp;#039;re bringing back that magical feeling with Maker Magic, a time to celebrate creative cache owners and inspire future hides. The magic is in your hands!
Between April 9 and 30, 2026, the geocaching community is invited to host and attend Maker Magic events to earn a special souvenir.&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
