                                                                                                                                        &lt;h3&gt;Katanning Lions Park&lt;/h3&gt;
    &lt;h4&gt;Katanning welcomes you &lt;/h4&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/30405483-a995-465a-ba1f-97a780fe120b" target="_blank"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/30405483-a995-465a-ba1f-97a780fe120b&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;p&gt;Radius: 20m&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;p&gt;Stages: 5&lt;/p&gt;


    &lt;p&gt;Kind of question:
                    multiple choice
            &lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;Katanning is known for what?&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;hr /&gt;
    &lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/0676e458-a76c-45c1-a425-8556e44814e1" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;Fast Facts!!

- Katanning is a town known for its many firsts:
First electric streetlight’s
First orbital engine
First inland swimming pool
First public lending library
First hot and cold running water in a home&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;hr /&gt;
    &lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Description&lt;/h5&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/bd0a6a80-492e-4591-b412-ca2fa39c58bc" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;The Katanning Lions park located on Clive street is home to the “fly your flag display”, aswell as offering toilets, bbq facilities, gazebo and some great visitor information.&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
   <groundspeak:logs>
  </groundspeak:logs>
   <groundspeak:travelbugs>
   </groundspeak:travelbugs>
</groundspeak:cache>
</wpt>
