   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">
                                                                                                                                        &lt;h3&gt;Brookton History&lt;/h3&gt;
    &lt;h4&gt;Brookton Railway Station&lt;/h4&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/2421b65f-780f-441d-b3fe-faee2871a90a" target="_blank"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/2421b65f-780f-441d-b3fe-faee2871a90a&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;p&gt;Radius: 49m&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;p&gt;Stages: 5&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;p&gt;Possibly bonus:
            &lt;a href="https://coord.info/GCBPKMC" target="_blank"&gt;GCBPKMC&lt;/a&gt;        &lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;p&gt;Kind of question:
                    single
            &lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;What altitude is listed on the white station sign?&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;hr /&gt;
    &lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/25b8bc0b-8db6-40dc-aff6-4371fda72e6a" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;Brookton Station opened with the Great Southern Railway in 1889 and gradually developed from a modest stop into a well-equipped station with unusually advanced signalling for its size. Its importance peaked after becoming a junction in 1915 with the opening of the Brookton–Corrigin line, before services declined and the historic signal cabin was eventually removed in the late 20th century.
&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;hr /&gt;
    &lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Description&lt;/h5&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/34d4685e-9608-4b8b-abc1-0b3f47595a41" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;This Adventure Lab will take you on a brief tour of Brookton, including some sights that might not have been on your radar when in town. 

There is a bonus final cache available using the clues collected in this cache. Details of the bonus final cache can be found on the listing. The GC code for the bonus final cache is &amp;lt;a href="https://coord.info/GCBPKMC" target="_blank"&amp;gt;GCBPKMC&amp;lt;/a&amp;gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
