    &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/bb27296b-5951-4c0f-9e7a-7fc6d72cf783" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;Deep underground, the Goonies navigate dark tunnels filled with ancient booby traps designed to protect One-Eyed Willy&amp;#039;s treasure. Every wrong turn could spell disaster.&lt;/p&gt;

