   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">
                                                                                                                                        &lt;h3&gt;The Goonies Adventure&lt;/h3&gt;
    &lt;h4&gt;Treasure&lt;/h4&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/974a2b73-799e-47a5-af2b-8ade9888522e" target="_blank"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/974a2b73-799e-47a5-af2b-8ade9888522e&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;p&gt;Radius: 50m&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;p&gt;Stages: 5&lt;/p&gt;


    &lt;p&gt;Kind of question:
                    multiple choice
            &lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;What phrase does Mikey famously say that became the movie&amp;#039;s enduring motto?&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;hr /&gt;
    &lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/43abdc5f-ff94-40da-bb9b-d8ca4cb3b899" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;You&amp;#039;ve reached the treasure chamber! Gold coins, jewels, and pirate artifacts surround you. Like the Goonies before you, you&amp;#039;ve completed the quest and uncovered One-Eyed Willy&amp;#039;s legendary riches.&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;hr /&gt;
    &lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Description&lt;/h5&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/a53afda0-76e3-4021-8789-718cd66cd0ef" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;Hey you guys!

Join Mikey, Mouth, Data, and Chunk on an unforgettable treasure-hunting adventure inspired by the beloved cult classic The Goonies. Along the way, you&amp;#039;ll need sharp eyes, quick thinking, and a little bit of Goonie determination to overcome the challenges ahead. Gather your crew, embrace the adventure, and remember—the rich stuff may be just around the corner. Because Goonies never say die!

You can complete the adventure in any order you like.  However, for the best story experience, we suggest starting at the Attic!&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
