   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">
                                                                                                                                        &lt;h3&gt;Brookton Memorial Park&lt;/h3&gt;
    &lt;h4&gt;Gun&lt;/h4&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/dd8f7a47-9001-4058-9e3e-e99af7a03f2d" target="_blank"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/dd8f7a47-9001-4058-9e3e-e99af7a03f2d&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;p&gt;Radius: 20m&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;p&gt;Stages: 5&lt;/p&gt;


    &lt;p&gt;Kind of question:
                    single
            &lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;How much was it purchased for? (Two digits)&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;hr /&gt;
    &lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/8a2133ff-9eed-4037-90a0-220b5379694d" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;THIS 25 POUNDER FIELD ARTILLERY GUN WAS
USED IN WORLD WAR TI
IT WAS PURCHASED FROM THE ARMY DEFENCE FORCE SUPPLY STORES AT NUNGARIN, W.A. IN
1960 FOR £10, TRANSPORTED AND DONATED BY WX2650 CAPT. P. M G. MEECHAM TO THE BROOKTON R.S.B. SUB-BRANCH FOR PLACEMENT IN MEMORIAL PARK IN HONOUR OF THOSE WHO GAVE THEIR LIVES FOR THEIR COUNTRY&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;hr /&gt;
    &lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Description&lt;/h5&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/08de605a-24c7-4e5c-8ad4-6548492c339b" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;On the 11 November 1921, the War Memorial in Brookton was unveiled after 12 months of fundraising by the RSL. After a united service was held by the various religious bodies, the unveiling service commenced.
&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
