  <urlname>Bullara Station : S4 Cattle Grid by richlink</urlname>
  <sym>Geocache</sym>
  <type>Geocache|Lab Cache</type>
  <groundspeak:cache id="9754461" available="True" archived="False" xmlns:groundspeak="http://www.groundspeak.com/cache/1/0/1">
   <groundspeak:name>Bullara Station : S4 Cattle Grid</groundspeak:name>
   <groundspeak:placed_by>richlink</groundspeak:placed_by>
   <groundspeak:owner id="">richlink</groundspeak:owner>
   <groundspeak:type>Lab Cache</groundspeak:type>
   <groundspeak:container>Virtual</groundspeak:container>
   <groundspeak:attributes>
   </groundspeak:attributes>
   <groundspeak:difficulty>1</groundspeak:difficulty>
   <groundspeak:terrain>1</groundspeak:terrain>
   <groundspeak:country>Australia</groundspeak:country>
   <groundspeak:state>Western Australia</groundspeak:state>
   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">
                                                                                                                                        &lt;h3&gt;Bullara Station&lt;/h3&gt;
    &lt;h4&gt;Cattle Grid&lt;/h4&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/2181d775-d5e2-4ef0-ade8-4199b0d7c4aa" target="_blank"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/2181d775-d5e2-4ef0-ade8-4199b0d7c4aa&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;p&gt;Radius: 20m&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;p&gt;Stages: 5&lt;/p&gt;


    &lt;p&gt;Kind of question:
                    single
            &lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;What is the word on the right hand side of the cattle grid?&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;hr /&gt;
    &lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/ec3c6fb3-f6bc-4758-a178-a9761025e387" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;Bullara is a working cattle station sprawling across a quarter million acres. It is known as Punurrba by the local Yingarrda people.&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;hr /&gt;
    &lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Description&lt;/h5&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/6ae2ef1e-4cae-409f-80af-5203b35cf2dd" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;PLEASE NOTE;
This adventure is only accessible when Bullara is open to the public from 1st April to mid-October each year.

Bullara Station has been a family run working cattle property since the 1950&amp;#039;s. It is the culmination of a dream to share the experience of life on a cattle station in an authentic, environmentally sustainable and comfortable way. It has stemmed from a passion for the red dirt and connecting with adventurous travellers.
The station is a must see, either just a day trip to check out the cafe and its amazing menu or a longer stay to appreciate the station.
&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
   <groundspeak:logs>
  </groundspeak:logs>
   <groundspeak:travelbugs>
   </groundspeak:travelbugs>
</groundspeak:cache>
</wpt>
 <wpt lat="-22.681533" lon="114.03895">
  <ele>14.0</ele>
  <time>2026-06-18T08:00:00Z</time>
