    &lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/b72c277e-7864-4a5e-bb22-7813492c8c31" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;BORN KATANNING 23/9/1947
KILLED INACTION
VETNAM
215/1970
PTE 5715239 A COMPANY 7 BN, RAR&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;hr /&gt;
    &lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Description&lt;/h5&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/7cae4ccb-5866-4404-884b-1d9038526ae2" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;A rose garden commemorating those who served in World War One and the signing of the Armistice on the 11th November 1989. &lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
