   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">
                                                                                                                                        &lt;h3&gt;RSL Memorial Rose Garden&lt;/h3&gt;
    &lt;h4&gt;Australian Light Horse&lt;/h4&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/a146bb0d-a2ce-46a6-a114-58f284024d24" target="_blank"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/a146bb0d-a2ce-46a6-a114-58f284024d24&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;p&gt;Radius: 20m&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;p&gt;Stages: 5&lt;/p&gt;


    &lt;p&gt;Kind of question:
                    multiple choice
            &lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;The 10th ALH logo features what iconic WA animal?&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;hr /&gt;
    &lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/9b70ecf5-65a4-4a86-b6f3-b3f23ea96c36" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;The 10th Australian Light Horse Regiment AIF was the only AIF light horse regiment recruited in Western Australia during the First World War.&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;hr /&gt;
    &lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Description&lt;/h5&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/7cae4ccb-5866-4404-884b-1d9038526ae2" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;A rose garden commemorating those who served in World War One and the signing of the Armistice on the 11th November 1989. &lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
