   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">
                                                                                                                                        &lt;h3&gt;Fun For All Ages&lt;/h3&gt;
    &lt;h4&gt;Twister&lt;/h4&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/f8badce8-ebd3-401b-a7c7-02c728b2e26e" target="_blank"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/f8badce8-ebd3-401b-a7c7-02c728b2e26e&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;p&gt;Radius: 20m&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;p&gt;Stages: 5&lt;/p&gt;


    &lt;p&gt;Kind of question:
                    multiple choice
            &lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;How many steps make up the spiral ladder?&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;hr /&gt;
    &lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/6ae80448-7fa1-495f-8dcc-431013884815" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;Standing proudly towards the entrance to the park and visible as you drive along the highway.

Standing 10m high the twister draws you in to a world of fun for all ages.&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;hr /&gt;
    &lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Description&lt;/h5&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/999ba783-0956-4c6f-9fc7-1ad4a9688baf" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;Katanning All Ages Playground is one of the Great Southern region’s most popular family attractions, located at the corner of Clive Street and Great Southern Highway in Katanning, Western Australia.

Originally developed by local volunteers in the 1980s, the playground became a much-loved community landmark and was later transformed through a major $5 million redevelopment that modernised the park while preserving its iconic features.

Today, the playground offers a unique recreational space designed for all generations. Its standout attractions include the famous 10-metre-high red spiral slide, a 35-metre aerial walkway, dual flying foxes, climbing nets, rock-climbing features, swings, seesaws, tunnels, spinners, and a dedicated early childhood play area. Families can also enjoy shaded picnic areas, barbecue facilities, and nature-based play elements.

The Katanning All Ages Playground remains a favourite destination for both locals and visitors travelling through the Great Southern region&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
   <groundspeak:logs>
  </groundspeak:logs>
   <groundspeak:travelbugs>
   </groundspeak:travelbugs>
</groundspeak:cache>
</wpt>
