    &lt;p&gt;Kind of question:
                    multiple choice
            &lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;How many sections make up the outside fence?&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;hr /&gt;
    &lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/a58de862-571b-491b-9107-498c40b982bb" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;Rotating and changing angles the "washing maching" has always been a favorite of all those who come to the park.

Whether you are running around in the middle or hanging to the sides being pulled into the air this will give you the thrills you are after.&lt;/p&gt;

