  <name>LBTV6F-4</name>
  <desc>KatanningArtTr4</desc>
  <url>https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/df16e1e5-f12f-47bd-9a04-42e64fc0542f</url>
  <urlname>Katanning Art Trail  : S4 Royal Exchange Hotel Car Park by I C Nothing</urlname>
  <sym>Geocache</sym>
  <type>Geocache|Lab Cache</type>
  <groundspeak:cache id="9769966" available="True" archived="False" xmlns:groundspeak="http://www.groundspeak.com/cache/1/0/1">
   <groundspeak:name>Katanning Art Trail  : S4 Royal Exchange Hotel Car Park</groundspeak:name>
   <groundspeak:placed_by>I C Nothing</groundspeak:placed_by>
   <groundspeak:owner id="">I C Nothing</groundspeak:owner>
   <groundspeak:type>Lab Cache</groundspeak:type>
   <groundspeak:container>Virtual</groundspeak:container>
   <groundspeak:attributes>
   </groundspeak:attributes>
   <groundspeak:difficulty>1</groundspeak:difficulty>
   <groundspeak:terrain>1</groundspeak:terrain>
   <groundspeak:country></groundspeak:country>
   <groundspeak:state>Western Australia</groundspeak:state>
   <groundspeak:short_description html="True"> </groundspeak:short_description>
   <groundspeak:long_description html="True">
                                                                                                                                        &lt;h3&gt;Katanning Art Trail &lt;/h3&gt;
    &lt;h4&gt;Royal Exchange Hotel Car Park&lt;/h4&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/df16e1e5-f12f-47bd-9a04-42e64fc0542f" target="_blank"&gt;https://labs.geocaching.com/goto/df16e1e5-f12f-47bd-9a04-42e64fc0542f&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;p&gt;Radius: 20m&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;p&gt;Stages: 5&lt;/p&gt;


    &lt;p&gt;Kind of question:
                    single
            &lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;Question:&lt;br /&gt;How many ducks are located in the mural?&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;hr /&gt;
    &lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/1dd5f53e-5326-4eec-9033-64f0c7e0395e" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;A mural located behind the Royal Exchange Hotel that is not part of the official Silo Art Trail, but we believe is worthy of a visit. &lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;hr /&gt;
    &lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Description&lt;/h5&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/af32f271-008e-4751-abda-03671f2889aa" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;This Adventure Lab will take you on a tour of the public artwork that can be seen around Katanning.
The artwork around town is part of the Public Silo Trail. Whilst there are no silos, several Western Australian artists have transformed Western Power electrical transformer boxes at the four Katanning schools and have painted large scale murals on walls throughout town.

This Adventure Lab will provide you a sample of some of the artwork that can be seen around town.
The Lab adventure can be a walking tour and can be completed as you experience the full Katanning artwork trail.&lt;/p&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
    <groundspeak:encoded_hints></groundspeak:encoded_hints>
   <groundspeak:logs>
  </groundspeak:logs>
   <groundspeak:travelbugs>
   </groundspeak:travelbugs>
</groundspeak:cache>
</wpt>
