    &lt;h5&gt;Waypoint Description&lt;/h5&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://gsmediadata.blob.core.windows.net/mediacontainer/1810d98c-6ff7-4bce-8e82-e3a0d0b875d0" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;This is Murdoch Universitys newest building which began having classes in it in 2024. My favourite thing about this building are the study halls, views, the different events held here and the sushi place&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;hr /&gt;
    &lt;h5&gt;Adventure Lab Description&lt;/h5&gt;
